DESCRIPTION:301 14th Avenue\, Koret Hall\n\nA special Friday night supper h
 as been arranged for the community to come together in response to Rabbi Le
 w's passing. We do not sit shiva or mourn on Shabbat. However\, we will hav
 e a light supper at 7:30 p.m. following Kabbalat Shabbat service for our co
 mmunity to draw strength and solace from each other's company.\n\nFor more 
 information call the office at 415.221.8736\, ext. 101.
LAST-MODIFIED:20090219T235818Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Special Kabbalat Shabbat\nCommunity Supper
TRANSP:OPAQUE
