UID:fg3k6v1n59mulr9jpb87ds3ubc@google.com
CREATED:20140417T233135Z
DESCRIPTION:Poetics and Poetry: The Multiple Voices of Political Poetry in 
 Israel \n\nJoin us when we welcome Dr. Rachel Korazim on Saturday\, April 2
 6\, 7 p.m. for a poetry reading. Dr. Korazim is the Academic Director of Di
 stance Learning programs at The JAFI Department of Education and a graduate
  of Haifa University. Since her first Shlichut to Canada where she was the 
 head of JAFI delegation from (1985 to 1988) she is involved with Jewish edu
 cation in the Diaspora\; creating and implementing in-service training prog
 rams for educators\, writing educational materials\, counseling and teachin
 g.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20140417T233157Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel and MMR
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rachel Korazin Israeli Poetry - Havdallah
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
