UID:ksb5i25mkn3rmf6bpf05lsenfs@google.com
CREATED:20160212T001815Z
DESCRIPTION:Following our 3rd Friday Musical Kabbalat Shabbat service\, we 
 invite you to join fellow members of the CBS community for a delicious Shab
 bat dinner!\n\nCBS Executive Chef Jane Sykes is crafting a Shabbat feast th
 at will delight your tummy\, buoy your spirits\, and generally put you in a
  Shabbat state of mind! We encourage attendees to bring their favorite bott
 le of wine to share with others. Together\, we will turn our attention from
  the demands of the work week\, celebrate our points of connection\, and en
 joy some really\, really good food!\n\nThe menu:\nOven-roasted ratatouille 
 (with eggplant\, bell peppers\, onion\, zucchini\, tomatoes\, and garlic)\n
 Grilled parmesan polenta triangles\nGreen salad with balsamic dressing\nDre
 am bars (aka 7-layer bars: graham cracker crust\, baked with chocolate chip
 s\, butterscotch chips\, coconut\, walnuts\, and sweetened condensed milk)\
 n\nTickets are $27 per adult and $15 per child.\n\nPurchase your dinner tic
 ket by clicking here.\n \nPlease note that tickets must be reserved by 6 p.
 m. on Sunday\, February 14. Late orders cannot be guaranteed and will incur
  a $10 per person surcharge (e.g.\, $40 for a family of 4).
LAST-MODIFIED:20160212T001815Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CBS Community Shabbat Dinner
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
