CREATED:20160127T170104Z
DESCRIPTION:Post b’nai mitzvah teens (ages 13 and up) are invited to learn 
 with and from their peers and CBS Rabbinic Intern Amanda Russell. This sess
 ion's topic: Jewish stereotypes.\n\nParticipating teens select topics of di
 scussion which are explored through Jewish thought and texts. Informal\, dr
 op-in study groups will meet on five Shabbat mornings — November 7\, Decemb
 er 5\, March 5\, April 16\, and May 7 — over the school year\, 9:30 – 10:30
  a.m.\, in the CBS Administrative Office meeting area.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160428T195229Z
LOCATION:CBS Administrative Office
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hot Topics for Teens
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
