DESCRIPTION:Saturdays when Religious School is in session\nRabin Library fr
 om 11-11:30 a.m.\n\n2013 DATES: January 12 & 26\, February 2 & 9\, March 2\
 , 9\, 16 & 23\, April 6\, 20 & 27\, May 4\, 11 & 18\n\nA Shabbat service du
 ring the school year at 11 a.m.\, for children from birth to five years of 
 age and their parent(s). Munchkins & Mishpacha has its own siddur – a basic
  structure of the adult service\, with colorful stuffed Torahs for the Tora
 h parade\, a discussion of the holidays or other events marking Jewish life
  as they occur\, stories\, and songs. Held in the Rabin Library.\n\nFamilie
 s and children are encouraged to also join the main kiddush in Koret Hall a
 round 12:15 p.m. 
