 ng LGBT equality in Israel!\nGal will share clips from his films (Yossi and
  Jagger\, Walk on Water\, The Bubble\, and more) as he charts the evolution
  of the media portrayal of Israeli LGBT people and their lives.\nFor more i
 nformation\, visit www.awiderbridge.org/gal \nor contact Tyler Gregory at t
 yler@awiderbridge.org\n
