DESCRIPTION:On May 14\, 1948\, the Jewish leadership headed by future Prime
  Minister David Ben-Gurion\, announced the establishment of the State of Is
 rael as the homeland of the Jewish people.\n\nCome celebrate the 68th anniv
 ersary of this momentous event! \n\nSunday\, May 15\, 2016 • 3 – 5:30 PM\nC
 ongregation Beth Sholom\n301 – 14th Avenue\nSan Francisco 94118\n\nThere wi
 ll be fun\, food\, and activities for the whole family:\n\nMUSIC – Israeli 
 musician Lior Ben Hur and his band Sol Tevel will perform in Koret Hall—com
 e ready to dance!\n\nFILM – Screening of Dancing in Jaffa in the CBS Rabin 
 Family Library.\n\nFUN – A variety of activities for kids on Eva Gunther Pl
 aza\n\nFOOD – Israeli goodies & drinks\n\nREFLECTION – Schmoozing and refle
 cting on Israel's accomplishments and challenges in the last 68 years\n\nSt
 ay tuned for more details and how to get tickets!\n\nThis program is brough
 t to you by Beth Sholom’s Achshav Yisrael\, with the generous support of th
 e Jewish Community Federation of San Francisco\, the Peninsula\, Marin and 
 Sonoma Counties.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160425T180645Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Achshav Yisrael Yom Ha'Atzmaut celebration
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
