BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20090111T013000Z
DTEND:20090111T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055328Z
UID:1235087898-a0c51d8-20802@www.bethsholomsf.org
CREATED:20090219T235818Z
DESCRIPTION:301 14th Avenue\, Koret Hall\n\nRabbi Micah Hyman and Congregat
 ion Beth Sholom invite your to PJ Havdallah.\n\nPut on your finest PJs (par
 ents\, too!) and come be a part of our very special Havdallah ceremony. \n\
 nWe will sing all of our end-of-Shabbat favorites\, and have art projects\,
  games\, and stories galore.\n\nDelicious Potluck Dinner will follow.  Plea
 se bring a vegetarian or dairy dish to share. Heckshered (certified kosher)
  dishes are always appreciated. If your last name begins with:\n\nA-F: Wine
  or Beverage \nG-L: Salad\nM-S: Main Dish \nT-Z: Dessert\n\nSweet\, scented
  blessings and the spirit of community...come pray\, sing dance\, dine\, an
