DESCRIPTION:301 14th Avenue\, Gronowski Family Chapel\n\nLearners' Minyan w
 ith Ellen Shireman and David Malman\n\nThis is a four class series. The cla
 ss will be based on the major prayers presented in the evening weekday serv
 ice. Students will participate\, in class\, in the evening service and lear
 n about the meaning\, structure\, and choreography. They will be introduced
  to methods of participation that can be used regardless of an individual's
  Hebrew skills. \n\nThis class is highly recommended\, but not limited\, to
  students who took an Intro to Judaism conversion class\, people who have n
 ot participated in synagogue life much since their B'nai Mitzvah\, and cong
 regants who attend services but would like to understand more or deepen the
  experience. \n\nTo register contact Yaffa Tygiel at YTygiel@bethsholomsf.o
 rg.
