CREATED:20160428T052154Z
DESCRIPTION:The CBS Book Club will meet Sunday\, May 22 at 9:30am. in the R
 abin Library. The book to be discussed is: THE ORIGINS AND DIVERSITY OF AXI
 AL AGE CIVILIZATIONS\, edited by Shmuel N. Eisenstadt (z"l).\n\nThis book p
 resents a new and original analysis of the great ancient civilizations\, fo
 cusing on the breakthroughs and their institutionalization in Greece\, Isra
 el\, China\, and India. The conditions under which these civilizations deve
 loped are systematically explored. For comparative purposes\, the civilizat
 ion of Assyria\, where such a breakthrough did not take place is analyzed.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160428T052154Z
LOCATION:Rabin Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CBS Book Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
