DESCRIPTION:The Breakfast club currently meets three times this each year o
 n a Sunday (except summer months). There is a brief business meeting follow
 ed by an informal talk on topics of interest to the Jewish Community. Speak
 ers have included many community leaders of the San Francisco Jewish Commun
 ity\, along with members of Beth Sholom. Meetings are held at 9:00 a.m. and
  start with a breakfast.\n\nProfessor Erich Gruen\, Professor of Jewish Stu
 dies at University of California\, Berkeley will be our speaker on February
  8\, 2015.\n\nCost: $50 per couple\, $25 per individual\, $10 drop-in
