DESCRIPTION:44 candles can be lit from the flame of one candle & the life o
 f the candle will not be shortened!\n\nSave the date for our Hanukkah celeb
 ration on the evening of Saturday\, December 20. Bring your families and fr
 iends to dance in the light of the candles\, enjoy latkes and sufganiyot\, 
 and be together as a community. We encourage you to bring your favorite cha
 nukiah and join us for an inter-generational\, music filled evening! Festiv
 ities begin at 5:30 p.m. with Havadallah\, followed by a community meal\, c
 rafts for the children\, and music by Conspiracy of Beards\, a 30 member ma
 le choir that performs dynamic\, original\, a cappella arrangements of Leon
 ard Cohen songs\, in Koret Hall. At 7:30 p.m.\,the Ben Goldberg Band\, on T
 zadik record label\, will perform in the Sanctuary.
LAST-MODIFIED:20141203T213240Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall and Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Congregation Beth Sholom Hanukkah Celebration
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
