DESCRIPTION:CBS teens and their friends are invited to join San Francisco U
 SY Chapter's "Israel Tech Challenge" on Sunday\, February 28\, 2 - 6 p.m.!\
 n\nIsraelis have a way of solving our hardest problems. From getting to wor
 k to learning to walk again\, Israeli technology has improved our lives. Us
 ing Waze\, participating teens will explore the CBS campus\, discovering ne
 w and unknown Israeli tech and helping solve real world problems along the 
 way. And there's food -- lots and lots of food!\n\nClick here to register n
 ow!
