CREATED:20140724T181119Z
DESCRIPTION:Join the CBS community for the observance of Tisha B'Av\, which
  begins Monday\, August 4 at sundown and concludes at nightfall the next da
 y. Like Yom Kippur\, on the fast of Tisha B’Av\, we abstain from eating\, d
 rinking\, bathing\, wearing leather footwear and marital relations. Tisha B
 ’Av will include a light supper with teachings by Rabbi Glazer in preparati
 on for the fast and throughout\, and a candlelight reading of Eicha/Lamenta
 tions. Makor Or will lead a meditation session preceding the supper. All ar
 e welcome.  \n\n6 p.m. - Minyan in the Gronowski Family Chapel\n6:15 - 7 p.
 m. - Makor Or Meditation in the meditation room\n7 - 8 p.m. - Light supper 
 in the Main Meeting Room with teaching by Rabbi Glazer\n8:15 - 9:30 p.m. - 
 Reading of Eicha/Lamentations in the Gronowski Family Chapel by candle-ligh
 t\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20140724T181840Z
LOCATION:Makom Shalom\, Main Meeting Room\, Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tisha B'Av Observance
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
