DTEND:20160612T124500Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055328Z
UID:thp6n6pv4q17n0u94nuh39r8ac@google.com
CREATED:20160603T170652Z
DESCRIPTION:"Dialogue on Dawn\," with Rabbi Aubrey Glazer and Henry Holland
 er\n\nWhat is the exact moment that dawn comes? Is there even an exact mome
 nt of dawn? The Rabbis don’t ask this question\, but they do discuss how to
  judge the coming of twilight and nightfall. They have several different ap
 proaches to answering the question and we will apply them to the coming of 
 dawn. We will take their multiple answers and precautions as a starting poi
 nt for an inquiry into the Jewish attitude towards direct observation of th
 e world and the uncertainty that comes from the limits of our senses.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160607T172533Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dialogue on Dawn
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
