UID:1235087898-a0c294c-20802@www.bethsholomsf.org
CREATED:20090219T235818Z
DESCRIPTION:301 14th Avenue\, Koret Hall\n\nThe Joy of Jewish Dancing with 
 Bruce Bierman\n10 sessions. Cost: $75 members\, $100 nonmembers\nPreregistr
 ation strongly encouraged\, but walk-ins welcome.\n\nWorkshop participants 
 will learn the basic steps\, patterns\, gestures\, and styles of Yemenite\,
  Hasidic\, Yiddish\, and Israeli folkdance. Special emphasis will be on dan
 cing with "dveykus"-clinging close to the powerful rhythms of the music\, o
 n another's friendship\, and your own unique expression.\n\nBruce Bierman i
 s the artistic director of the Jewish Dance Theatre. He is an award-winning
  actor\, director\, choreographer and playwright with dance residencies cur
 rently throughout the Bay Area.\n\nContact Yaffa Tygiel to register at YTyg
 iel@bethsholomsf.org.
LAST-MODIFIED:20090219T235818Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Joy of Jewish Dancing
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
