UID:32sjksbjot8l76v4k0m1d11ra8@google.com
CREATED:20140805T181721Z
DESCRIPTION:Heart of Darkness: Parashat Hashavuah from Esh Qodesh 1939-1942
  \n\nThroughout the generations\, no book has been more valuable as a const
 ant source of inspiration to the Jewish people and the Western Canon than t
 he Book of Psalms. Everyone is welcome to join us as we delve into the poet
 ic power of the Psalms and discover why not even the Torah has been drenche
 d with as many tears and recited with as much spiritual enthusiasm as this 
 shelter in the word! 
LAST-MODIFIED:20140902T012327Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Heart Of Darkness
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
