DESCRIPTION:Maimouna: A Post Passover Celebration with Jaffa Road\n\nOn Sat
 urday\, April 18 Congregation Beth Sholom is partnering with JIMENA (Jews I
 ndigenous to the Middle East and North Africa) for further exciting Maimoun
 a celebrations for all ages. The evening will include delicious catered Mor
 occan food and desserts\, henna painting\, belly dancers\, and Havdalah wit
 h Rabbi Glazer and Jaffa Road. Following our Maimouna celebration please jo
 in us in the Sanctuary for a Jaffa Road concert featuring Hebrew\, English 
 and Spanish poetry intertwined with electrifying improvisations\, belly-dan
 ce rhythms and pulsing dub grooves.\n\nContact Beth Jones at bjones@bethsho
 lomsf.org or 415.940.7092 for further information.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150330T180110Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall and Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Mainouna: A Post Passover Celebration wtih Jaffa Road - Dinner & Co
 ncert
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
