DESCRIPTION:Join us on Sunday\, June 28\, for "Jerusalem West" the first in
  a series of pop-up restaurant experiences highlighting the food of differe
 nt Mizrahi culinary traditions. Our first meal will take you back to the Go
 lden Age of Jews in the Middle East and will feature modern takes on tradit
 ional Persian cuisine as well as other food from the region. Music and imag
 es from Iran will accompany the lunch. Food will be prepared by Lauren Wiln
 er\, Bay Area native with roots in Iran\, and creator of the cooking blog m
 yjerusalemkitchen.com.\n\nTwo Seatings\n11:30 a.m. - 1 p.m.\n1:30 - 3 p.m.\
 n$25 per person. Space is limited\, buy your tickets today! 
LAST-MODIFIED:20150603T175821Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jerusalem West
TRANSP:OPAQUE
