  out the possibility for transformation. Music is a key component to make t
 his journey come alive.\n\nOur next station on this musical journey of the 
 spirit will be—\nYetziratiyut-Creativity יצירתיות\n\nMusic by Hazzan Richar
 d Kaplan\, Shir haShirim Ensemble\, Rabbi Glazer and special musical guest 
 Basya Schechter. \n
