DESCRIPTION:Israel has one of the world’s most developed science and techno
 logy sectors\, and is a major contributor to the advancement of agriculture
 \, computer science\, electronics\, genetics\, healthcare\, optics\, solar 
 energy\, and various fields of engineering. Home to more than 3\,000 high-t
 ech companies and startups\, Israel also has the world’s second highest con
 centration of high-tech companies\, behind only Silicon Valley.\n\nIn partn
 ership with Congregation Kol Shofar (Tiburon\, CA)\, the Achshav Yisrael co
 mmittee of Congregation Beth Sholom invites to learn more about Israeli tec
 hnology and how it connects to the Bay Area and the rest of the United Stat
 es.\n\nThe program will feature presentations by local Israeli tech firms\,
  including demonstrations and an opportunity for Q&A. Snacks and refreshmen
 ts will be served.\n\n$10 per person. Purchase your tickets on Universe.\nh
 ttps://www.universe.com/israeltechforum\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160223T044255Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Achshav Yisrael -- "Israel Technology Forum"
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
