DESCRIPTION:The ‘aliyah to Tiberias from Eastern Europe in 1777 is a relati
 vely unknown chapter in the Yishuv of Eretz Yisrael. In this seminar\, we w
 ill learn about the historical context of 18th century Ottoman Palestine in
  order to explore the nearly lost tradition of Tiberean Hasidism through th
 e lens of weekly commentary or Parshat haShavua as collected in the teachin
 gs of R. Menahem Mendel of Vitebsk’s Peri haAretz. 
