 o of our age. As always\, breakfast will be served.\n\nTo receive monthly a
 nnouncements about the Dr. Ernest M. Weitz Breakfast Club happenings\, plea
 se contact Ariana Barth in the office at 415.221.8736\, ext. 111 or ABarth@
 bethsholomsf.org. Open to everyone.
