RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20150402T183000
CREATED:20140805T235332Z
DESCRIPTION:In the pre-modern period\, philosophy was not separated from my
 stical religious experience. This advanced seminar will examine the seams a
 t which philosophy and mysticism meet. Specifically focusing in on the phil
 osophy of the “Great Eagle”\, Moses Maimonides (1135-1204) as well as his d
 escendants\, Abraham Maimonides (1186-1237)\, ‘Obadya Maimonides (1228-1265
 ) and David Maimonides (1222-1300)\, Abraham Maimonides II (1245-1313)\, Jo
 shua Maimonides (1310-1355)\, and David Maimonides II (1335-1415) and Abrah
 am Abulafia (1240-1291).  
LAST-MODIFIED:20150601T194011Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Postponed: On the Eagle's Wings: Between Philosophy & Mysticism in 
 Judaism
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
