DESCRIPTION:We're thrilled to have Amanda Russell\, a cantorial soloist and
  rabbinical student at the Ziegler School of Rabbinic Studies\, serving as 
 our CBS Rabbinic Intern and enhancing our Shabbat offerings this year.\n\nT
 his week\, Amanda will co-lead Kabbalat Shabbat services with Rabbi Glazer 
 on Friday\, lead Musaf davening and facilitate our Hot Topics for Teens cla
 ss on Shabbat\, and teach our university-accredited Intro to Judaism course
  on Sunday.
