UID:ld96ohg2e11bpqkfss2855pego@google.com
CREATED:20160205T051412Z
DESCRIPTION:Join other members of the Bay Area Jewish community at the Gian
 ts annual Jewish Heritage Night!\n\nYour ticket price includes: a collector
 's-edition Jewish-themed Giants hat\; a seat in one of Jewish Heritage club
  sections for the game versus the Diamondbacks\; and admission to the Jewis
 h Heritage Night pregame party in Seals Plaza from 5 -7 p.m.! Live entertai
 nment will take place at the pre-game party\, and cultural food and drink s
 pecials will be available for purchase.\n\nPartial proceeds from every spec
 ial event ticket sold will benefit local charitable programs in the Jewish 
 community. You are invited to bring your family and friends or your entire 
 congregation! Don't miss this fun-filled night out at the park to celebrate
  Jewish Heritage!\n\nTickets are $58 each\, and our CBS group will sit in S
 ection 325 of the Club Level (a "high end" area with private restaurants an
 d bars). We have 100 tickets available. Children under 2 do not need a tick
 et.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160205T174006Z
LOCATION:AT&T Park
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SF Giants -- Jewish Heritage Night
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
