DESCRIPTION:On November 2-3\, communities across the country are participat
 ing in AJWS’s Global Hunger Shabbat\, a Shabbat designed to spark reflectio
 n\, education and action on the root causes of global hunger. Global Hunger
  Shabbat is part of AJWS’s Reverse Hunger campaign\, an advocacy effort to 
 reform U.S. food aid policy to better meet the needs of those facing hunger
  across the world. We encourage you to visit www.ajws.org/reversehunger to 
 learn more. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20121031T163619Z
LOCATION:Main Sanctuary during Services 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Global Hunger Shabbat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
