DESCRIPTION:Raise a Glass with Beth Sholom!\n\nPlease join us for an aftern
 oon of premium wine and gourmet chest tasting.\n\nWe will be pouring premiu
 m wines form six of the most prestigious vintners from the great Northern C
 alifornia wine country\, accompanied by the delectable cheeses (vegetarian 
 based) from Cowgirl Creamery. Each winery will be bringing its top of the l
 ine wines\, many of which are not otherwise available outside the winery. T
 here will be opportunities to sign up for these vintners’ premium wine club
 s and to order wines directly from these vintners.\n\nParticipating Winerie
 s include:\nB.R. CohnLieff Wines\nCovenant WinesPatland Estate Vineyards\nH
 agafen CellarsTetra/Expression Wines\n\nCello music will be provided by Dr.
  Alex Kelly. Information about Dr. Kelly can be found at alexkelly.com.\n\n
 Tickets to the event are $100 per person until March 2\, 2014 ($125 thereaf
 ter and at the door). All proceeds support our congregation programs.\n\nYo
 ur entry ticket entitles you to one raffle ticket. We are raffling off fine
  wines from the cellars of congregants who have been collecting premium win
 es for many years. You may purchase additional raffle tickets at $25 each\,
  or five for $100. There will be a minimum of ten raffle prizes and the val
 ue of each raffle prize is at least $100. You need not be present to win a 
 raffle prize.\n\nTickets can be purchased at: bethsholomwienandcheese.event
 brite.com or by contacting Julia Yasser\, jyasser@bethsholomsf.org or 415.2
 21.8736\, ext. 101.\n\nWe’re looking forward to sharing this fabulous after
 noon with you!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20140222T202903Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Wine & Cheese Tasting Fundraiser
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
