DESCRIPTION:Post b’nai mitzvah teens (ages 13 and up) are invited to learn 
 with and from their peers and CBS Rabbinic Intern Amanda Russell. This sess
 ion's topic: Israel.\n\nParticipating teens select topics of discussion whi
 ch are explored through Jewish thought and texts. Informal\, drop-in study 
 groups will meet on five Shabbat mornings — November 7\, December 5\, March
  5\, April 16\, and May 7 — over the school year\, 9:30 – 10:30 a.m.\, in t
 he CBS Administrative Office meeting area.
