DESCRIPTION:Bring Your Voice To “In this Place”\n\nWant to get involved in 
 the creative process and work with artist Elyssa Wortzman?\n\nBring your vo
 ice on Friday\, May 15\, at 9:30 a.m. when artist Elyssa Wortzman will be r
 ecording women in our community reciting her English interpretation of Shma
  and V'Ahavta. Elyssa is looking for women of all ages who have faced chall
 enges in their lives and have found or are searching for healing through lo
 ve/self-love. The program includes a discussion of Elyssa's contemporary in
 terpretation of the Shma and recording of your voices reading her text.  If
  you are interested in participating\, please email Elyssa at ewortzman@hot
 mail.com.  \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150423T173731Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bring Your Voice to In this Place
TRANSP:OPAQUE
