DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone!  Passover begins this year on Friday evening\, Apr
 il 3. \n\nWe'll be screening "The Prince of Egypt" on the big screen in Kor
 et hall on Sunday\, March 29. \n\nBring your blankets\, beans bags and pill
 ows to get comfy and relax with your friends.\nBYO-Chametz! Popcorn\, beer\
 , cookies- anything you feel like sharing with the group.\nSunday March 29t
 h from 4-6pm at CBS\n\nTell your friends to come! This event is free\, and 
 is intended for families with kids ages 5-12 yrs. \n\nHope you can make it!
 !\n\nAriella Toeman\, CBS Shabbat School Room Parent\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150305T203121Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Religious School film: Prince of Eygpt
TRANSP:OPAQUE
