CREATED:20150304T230712Z
DESCRIPTION:Are you still using the Maxwell House Haggadah?\n\nMaybe it is 
 time to upgrade to one that may be more meaningful for you! After our Purim
  Carnival on Sunday\, March 8\, 1- 3 p.m.\, begin to prepare for Passover\,
  and come look at dozens of haggadot! Ask questions and discover something 
 new. Find a haggadah that sings to you! If you want to bring more ruach and
  meaning into your celebration\, you NEED to come see what haggadot are ava
 ilable.\n\nCongregant\, Eva-Lynne will be bringing haggadot in from Dayenu\
 , the Judaica store at the JCCSF. As an incentive to go into the store and 
 purchase Passover items\, Dayenu will make a donation to CBS when you shop 
 through April 3. We will also have haggadot in from the CBS library\, which
  you are welcome to borrow for study and some are even available for your s
 eder. Rabbi Glazer will be joining us with his insight and advice.\n\nEnjoy
  tasting 3 types of charoset\, and take home recipes to prepare them yourse
 lf. We hope to see you on Sunday!   \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150304T230712Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Prepare for Passover: Peruse Haggot and Taste Charoset!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
