DESCRIPTION:301 14th Avenue\, Main Meeting Room\n\nKeshet Chavurah is the l
 esbian\, gay\, bisexual\, and transgender Jewish group at Congregation Beth
  Sholom. Keshet gathers together to create visibility\, support\, and aware
 ness for issues related to LGBT. \n\nWe would like to take this evening to 
 gather with friends to remember Rabbi Lew\, a wonderful rabbi and teacher a
 nd a great friend of our community\, and to support each other during this 
 difficult time.  Please let us know if you are interested in attending.\n\n
 For more information contact Ariana Barth at 415.221.8736\, ext. 111\, or A
 Barth@bethsholomsf.org.
