DESCRIPTION:Join our CBS Tu B'Shevat interactive seder on Sunday\, January 
 24\, 4:30 - 6 p.m.\n\nWe'll gather to celebrate Rosh HaShanah La'Ilanot (th
 e New Year of the Trees) and plant seeds of connection to our spiritual jou
 rneys. Inspired by the seder that began in the Galilee in the 16th century\
 , we'll explore what it means to be part of a "spiritual ecosystem" as we d
 ine on nuts\, figs\, dates\, pomegranates\, almonds\, carobs\, and deliciou
 s Tu B’Shevat dishes. There will be wine and grape juice aplenty. Following
  the seder\, we invite you to join us for evening minyan in the Gronowski F
 amily Chapel.\n\nPlease purchase your tickets ($18/plate) by Thursday\, Jan
 uary 21\, so that our Executive Chef will know how much food to prepare.\n\
 nhttps://www.universe.com/cbstubshevatseder
LAST-MODIFIED:20160119T224638Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tu B'Shevat Interactive Seder
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
