DESCRIPTION:Mitch Braff\, Founder of the Jewish Partisan Education Foundati
 on\, will speak during this occurrence of the Ernest M. Weitz Breakfast Clu
 b.\n\nThe Breakfast Club currently meets four times each year on a Sunday w
 ith an informal talk on topics of interest to the Jewish Community. Speaker
 s have included many community leaders of the San Francisco Jewish Communit
 y\, along with members of Beth Sholom. Meetings are held at 9:00 a.m. and s
 tart with a delicious breakfast.\n\nCost: $80 per couple & $40 per individu
