DESCRIPTION:In the spirit of speaking out as a united community against the
  expression of hate and bigotry we saw in Charlottesville\, Virginia\, all 
 Beth Sholom congregants are encouraged to join the Jewish Community Relatio
 ns Council\, San Francisco Interfaith Council\, Jewish Community Federation
 \, Jewish Community Center of San Francisco\, and Congregation Emanu-El for
  an interfaith-communal Shabbat service and gathering this coming Friday ev
 ening\, August 25.\n \nThis will be a welcoming\, interfaith\, inter-commun
 ity gathering for all of us\, whether religious and non-religious\, who inh
 abit this beautiful city and reject hate!\n \nWe hope you will join us. Ple
 ase RSVP to Hallie Baron via email or by calling 415-977-7411.
LAST-MODIFIED:20170821T224258Z
LOCATION:Congregation Emanu-El San Francisco\, 2 Lake St\, San Francisco\, 
 CA 94118\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:An Interfaith Gathering Against Hate
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
