DESCRIPTION:Students will hone their decoding (reading) skills\, knowledge 
 of key words\, shoreshim (Hebrew root letters)\, and prayers. The enduring 
 understandings of our Hebrew curriculum are: \n\n     *Prayers and rituals 
 teach us about Jewish values and mitzvot.\n\n     *When we know how to reci
 te prayers\, and what they mean\, we feel like a participating member of ou
 r Jewish community.\n\nAll students are expected to study-at-home and pract
 ice their Hebrew learning during the week when they are not in class.
LAST-MODIFIED:20181003T181110Z
LOCATION:CBS
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hevruta Hebrew (grades 2-6)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
