DESCRIPTION:Each Shabbat morning\, join Rabbi Glazer in Makom Shalom for an
  engaging exploration of Jewish mysticism\, myth\, esoteric teachings\, and
  meditation.\n\nThe Lehrhaus Philosophy Circle Zohar series that Rabbi Glaz
 er taught in 2015-16 was organized in honor of the completion of Professor 
 Daniel C. Matt’s epic translation and annotation of the first nine volumes 
 of "The Zohar: Pritzker Edition." The Zohar is the masterwork of Kabbalah a
 nd Jewish mysticism. Matt describes the text as “a challenge to the normal 
 workings of consciousness [that] dares one to examine one’s assumptions abo
 ut tradition\, G-d\, and self.” We invite you to take on the Zohar's challe
 nge with Rabbi Glazer as your guide!
LAST-MODIFIED:20180510T223813Z
LOCATION:Makom Shalom
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shabbat Morning Zohar Meditation w/ Rabbi Glazer
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
