DESCRIPTION:Thinking Matters\n"Jewish Thinking & Activism In Black Lives Ma
 tter"\nNovember 3\n(1 session w/ Ilana Kaufman)\n\nRegistration: https://ww
 w.universe.com/cbsthinkingmatters\n\nCourse Description: Jewish identity. J
 ewish values. Black lives. They all matter. Thinking about and reflecting o
 n Jewish identity and values\, Ilana Kaufman will present experiences from 
 field work and data\, and delve into interesting community dilemmas connect
 ing who we are as Jews and the Racial Justice movement.\n\nReadings: TBD\n\
 nCost per session for CBS members is $12. Alternatively\, members can purch
 ase an 8-session pack for $84 or a full semester subscription (17 sessions 
 confirmed to date) for $180. For nonmembers\, each session is $24\, $168 fo
 r an 8-session pack\, or $360 for the full semester subscription.
