CREATED:20180301T185322Z
DESCRIPTION:The next meeting of the CBS Book Group will be on Sunday\, Marc
 h 18\, 2018\, at 9:30 am to discuss Umberto Eco's novel "The Prague Cemeter
 y."\n\n19th century Europe is in tumult and everyone needs a scapegoat. But
  what if\, behind all of the popular conspiracies and loathing is just one 
 lone anti-Semite?\n\nThe book is readily available in print\, e-book and au
 dio through the public library\, the SF Jewish Community Library and online
  through Amazon.
