CREATED:20171223T024429Z
DESCRIPTION:The next meeting of the CBS Book Group will be on Sunday\, Janu
 ary 21\, 2018 at 9:30 am to discuss Joshua Cohen's novel "Moving Kings".\n\
 nThe story of two young Israelis who come to the US following their years o
 f military service spent fighting in Gaza.  Working as laborers in New York
  City for a cousin's moving company\, living in an environment that puts no
  boundaries on their thoughts or actions\, they fight to overcome the traum
 a of their military experience and emerge new men. \n\n"Moving Kings" is av
 ailable in the SF public library at Amazon in print\, e-book and audio.
LAST-MODIFIED:20171227T042050Z
LOCATION:Rabin Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CBS Book Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
