DESCRIPTION:"Yizkor\, Yortsayt\, & Kaddish: Memory as value and structure i
 n Jewish Life"\n\nWe’re pleased to announce the first Annual Mendel Cranow 
 Memorial Teaching! Learn how Jewish prayer interacts with mourning and how 
 Judaism organizes our grief into manageable parts.\n\nNamed for the first P
 resident of CBS\, the Annual Mendel Cranow Memorial Teaching will be led by
  Henry Hollander. Henry is a bookseller\, the leader of our Talmud study gr
 oup\, and our outstanding B'nai Mitzvah Coordinator volunteer.
