DESCRIPTION:The CBS Book Club will meet Sunday\, April 17 at 9:30am. in the
  Rabin Library. The book to be discussed is: "Till We Have Built Jerusalem\
 ," by  Adina Hoffman.\n\nThe book is readily available in print and e-book 
 versions.  The SF Public library has a few couple of copies\, but there are
  many copies available through Link+ interlibrary lending.\n\nFocusing on t
 he stories of three architects\, Hoffman tells the history of Jerusalem und
 er British mandate.  A period when the Arabs\, Ottomans\, British and Ashke
 nazi competed politically\, socially and culturally in shaping and reformin
 g the city.
