DESCRIPTION:<br>Congregation Beth Sholom invites you to experience the&nbsp
 \;Americana Jam Band Kabbalat Shabbat!<br><br>It’s a folk-rock jam session 
 with a Jewish soul\, a casual prayer service with country swagger. If you l
 ike to sing and/or play an instrument (think piano\, guitar\,&nbsp\;<a href
 ="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Double_bass" target="_blank">double bass</a
 >\,&nbsp\;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melodica" target="_blank">
 melodica</a>\,&nbsp\;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harmonica" targ
 et="_blank">harmonica</a>\, or&nbsp\;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki
 /Vibraphone" target="_blank">vibraphone</a>)\, pull up a chair and&nbsp\;jo
 in the jam on select Friday nights in 2017-18. Maybe you won’t always&nbsp\
 ;<a href="http://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=In%20the%20Pocket"
  target="_blank">play “in the pocket”</a>\, but that’s not the point – it’s
  about our journey. Together\, we’ll make music in a sacred space and creat
 e something new and meaningful as we mark the week’s end and the arrival of
  Shabbat.<br><br><b><br></b><b>For more information:</b>&nbsp\;http://beths
 holomsf.org/americana-jam-band-returns/&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20180212T220719Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Canceled: Americana Jam Band Musical Kabbalat Shabbat Services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
