UID:64a30q362nlcabi97jmqm9qsi6@google.com
CREATED:20180124T032137Z
DESCRIPTION:Join the Beth Sholom community for a special bimah dialogue wit
 h Naomi Davis\, Program Manager of the national non-profit Jewish Veg\, who
  will speak about Jewish values as they relate to our treatment and care of
  animals. She will share three core teachings of Judaism: a plant-based die
 t is the Jewish ideal\; meat-eating is described as a concession\; and the 
 mandate to treat animals with compassion. She will tie these teachings dire
 ctly to the week's Torah portion. Don't miss this fruitful discussion!\n\nM
 ore info: https://www.jewishveg.org/
LAST-MODIFIED:20180124T032706Z
LOCATION:Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Special Bimah Dialogue: Naomi Davis of Jewish Veg
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
