DESCRIPTION:Join us for our Simchat Torah Jamboree! The evening of celebrat
 ion will feature live music from Book of J\, with special guest drummer Dar
 ian Grey\, a lot of dancing (with our beloved Torah scrolls).\nThere is als
 o plenty of Israeli food\, drinks\, plenty of schmoozing\, and\, yes\, more
  dancing!
