DESCRIPTION:Our new Valor Grrrls Kabbalat Shabbat musical service celebrate
 s this intrinsic feminine nature of Kabbalat Shabbat by spotlighting the mu
 sic of female singer-songwriters. Through powerful\, deeply-felt lyrics and
  moving melodies\, Joan Armatrading\, Natalie Merchant\, Gillian Welch\, an
 d The Wailin’ Jennys help transport us into this other world we call Shabba
 t. Their beautiful songs inspire in us a commitment to work for redemption 
 by hearkening to a more just and equitable world.<br><br>For more info: <a 
 href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fbethsholomsf.org%2Fannounci
 ng-valor-grrrls-kabbalat-shabbat%2F&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNH9K
 ERKBUBDAL1gx-fpeN5dFEddrg" target="_blank">http://bethsholomsf.org/announci
 ng-valor-grrrls-kabbalat-shabbat/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180402T222552Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Valor Grrrls Kabbalat Shabbat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
