CREATED:20181004T223403Z
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us to hear from Professor Eran Kaplan\, who will break d
 own the components of Israel's new Basic Law\, known simply as the Nation-S
 tate Law. It defines Israel as the nation state of the Jewish people and th
 e right to self-determination in Israel as unique to the Jewish people. Pro
 fessor Kaplan will help us understand its significance to Israel’s democrat
 ic character\, as well as to its Jewish and non-Jewish citizens.\n\nAdults:
  $15 advance ($20 at the door)\, 17 & under: FREE.  LEARN MORE.
LAST-MODIFIED:20181004T223550Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall and Kitchen
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Achshav Yisrael Event - Eran Kaplan
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
