DESCRIPTION:Following morning minyan (7–8 a.m.)\, grab a bite and join Rabb
 i Glazer for an hour of interactive learning to start your day.\n\nRabbi Gl
 azer offers two\, eight-session classes on Thursday mornings in 5777: "The 
 Defiant Muse: Hebrew Feminist Poems from Antiquity to the Present –a Biling
 ual Anthology" (November 3–December 8 & January 12–February 23) and "The Pi
 llar of Prayer: Teachings of Contemplative Guidance in Prayer\, Sacred Stud
 y\, and the Spiritual Life from the Ba’al Shem Tov and His Circle" (March 2
 –May 25). No knowledge of Hebrew required\, but students must pre-register 
 and purchase course books (via Amazon). Please visit the CBS website for de
 tails.\n\nhttp://bethsholomsf.org/education/adult-education/
