DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, July 16\, at 5 p.m.\, Ephraim Margolin will prese
 nt a lecture on hukkim\, mitzvot that lack an obvious rationale or are fund
 amentally illogical. Some rabbis describe hukkim as because-HaShem-said-so 
 mitzvot. This week’s parsha\, Chukat\, includes one of the best examples of
  such a mitzvah\, the purification ritual known as parah adumah\, or the re
 d heifer.\n\nEphraim’s lecture will replace this week’s Psalms: A Shelter i
 n the Word class.
LAST-MODIFIED:20161017T210805Z
LOCATION:Board Room\, CBS
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ephraim Margolin On Hukkim
TRANSP:OPAQUE
