DESCRIPTION:The CBS Book Club will meet in the Rabin Library.\n\nThe book t
 o be discussed is "Catch the Jew!\," by Tuvia Tenenbom. Tenenbom's popular 
 and much-praised book recounts the adventures of Tuvia Tenenbom\, who wande
 rs around Israel of our time calling himself “Tobi the German.” In the cour
 se of numerous interviews Tuvia extracts information\, sentiments\, hidden 
 theories and delusional visions motivating the miscellany of peoples formin
 g the present-day Holy Land.\n\n
