UID:gs4uoi7e3ds4tl6qou8vhskp2o@google.com
CREATED:20161212T222603Z
DESCRIPTION:Book: "The Best Place on Earth\," by Ayelet Tsabari\n Tsabari’s
  debut collection won the 2015 Sami Rohr Prize for Jewish Literature. These
  eleven short stories\, set between Israel and Canada\, feature mothers and
  children\, soldiers and bohemians\, lovers and best friends\, all searchin
 g for their place in the world. Tsabari's Mizrahi characters grapple with l
 ove\, violence\, faith\, the slipperiness of identity\, and the challenges 
 of balancing old traditions with modern times.\n \nThe book is available to
  borrow thanks to the Jewish Community Library's book club in a box program
 . Books are available to check out in Rebecca's office. \n\nNo RSVP necessa
 ry for the Parents' Book club. Just show up!
LAST-MODIFIED:20161212T222603Z
LOCATION:Boardroom
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CBS Shabbat School Parents' Book Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
