DESCRIPTION:On Saturday night\, July 9\, rock out with Lazer Lloyd at Congr
 egation Chevra Thilim! CBS is co-sponsoring the concert in partnership with
  Chabad Of SF\, The SOMA Shul\, Chabad of Pacific Heights\, Adath Israel of
  San Francisco\, and others.\n\nCome for a musical ‪Havdalah‬ and stay for 
 an evening of acoustic solo music and stories packing venues in ‎Israel‬ an
 d around the world. Do not fail to RSVP to save a space today! Snacks and o
 pen bar included.\n\nCall 415.987.8355 for information or RSVP with purchas
 e of ticket at link above.\n\nCongregation Chevrah Tehillim\, Sat. July 9th
 \, 10PM\, 751 25th Ave\, San Francisco\, CA 94121 Brown paper tickets in ad
 vance $15 and $20 at the door.\nhttp://www.brownpapertickets.com/event/2570
 028
