DESCRIPTION:Come hear from Dr. Colin Winston\, Senior Analyst and Deputy Di
 rector for Policy and Government Affairs at AIPAC and a 30-year veteran of 
 the CIA.  Colin will describe the geo-political challenges currently facing
  Israel\, including those posed by terrorists and their sponsors.  He will 
 also describe ways in which the U.S. and Israel can work together to addres
 s them.  This program\, co-sponsored by Congregation Beth Sholom\, Congrega
 tion Adath Israel\, and Congregation Chevra Thilim is an opportunity to lea
 rn from AIPAC’s unique expertise on the intricacies of Middle East politics
  and security challenges faced by Israel.  It is also an opportunity to lea
 rn more about the organization’s bipartisan strategy in support of a strong
  U.S.-Israel relationship.
LAST-MODIFIED:20171030T184922Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:AIPAC - "Israel's Turbulent Neighborhood\," w/ Dr. Colin Winston
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
