DESCRIPTION:Join the CBS community for Yom Kippur services.\n\nEven if you 
 will be attending the Koret Hall service as your primary service\, the enti
 re community begins services in the Sanctuary. Following Yizkor (approx. 12
  p.m.)\, the Koret Hall attendees will move from the Sanctuary to Koret.\n\
 n\nProgramming For Children:\nDays of AWE (ages 5 – 12): 10 a.m. – 2 p.m.\,
  locations TBD\nChildcare (ages newborn – 4): 10 a.m. – 2 p.m.\, locations 
