CREATED:20160725T214723Z
DESCRIPTION:We fast from dawn to dusk to lament the assassination of Gedali
 ah\, the righteous governor of Judah of that name\, which ended Jewish rule
  following the destruction of the First Temple. Like other minor fasts\, Tz
 om Gedaliah begins at dawn (first light) and ends at nightfall (full dark).
LAST-MODIFIED:20160725T215041Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TZOM GEDALIAH
