  tapestry of which a thriving Jewish population formed an essential part\, 
 as well as a celebration of the survival of Odessa’s dream in a diaspora re
 aching all the way to Brighton Beach."\n\nThe book is available in print th
 rough the San Francisco Public Library and in print or Kindle format throug
 h Amazon.\n\n
