  meals and take time to contemplate together this precious gift of life and
  renewal of the soul. Makor Or Shabbat retreats have always been our favori
 te – full of joy\, depth\, and fellowship.<br><br><br>Details &amp\; regist
 ration:&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fbethsholom
