 baton/</a><br><br><u>Meeting Dates/Times:</u><br>Friday\, January 26\;&nbsp
 \;5 – 9 p.m.<br>Saturday\, January 27\; 10 a.m. – 7 p.m.<br><br><u>Meeting 
