DESCRIPTION:Following morning minyan (7–8 a.m.)\, grab a bite and join Rabb
 i Glazer for an hour of interactive learning to start your day.\n\nOn Thurs
 day mornings in 5777 (2016-17)\, Rabbi Glazer offers a sixteen-session cour
 se titled "The Pillar of Prayer: Teachings of Contemplative Guidance in Pra
 yer\, Sacred Study\, and the Spiritual Life from the Ba’al Shem Tov and His
  Circle." No knowledge of Hebrew required\, but students must pre-register 
 and purchase course book: "The Pillar of Prayer." We encourage you to buy v
 ia the CBS Amazon Smile store.\n\nRegistration: https://www.universe.com/ev
 ents/the-pillar-of-prayer-tickets-4D0RYV\n\nOther info: http://bethsholomsf
 .org/education/adult-education/#pillar
