DESCRIPTION:Family Education with Rabbi Glazer and Rebecca Goodman\, Direct
 or of Youth Education. Four family education workshops will take place on T
 hursday evenings. Students in grades 6 and 7 are required to attend these e
 vents\, with at least one parent. \n\nDetails for this year:\n•December 8\,
  2016Kehillah Kedoshah: Holy Community\n•January 26\, 2017Find a Mitzvah th
 at Fits Ya (Keeping the Mitzvah in Bar/Bat Mitzvah)\n•March 16\, 2017Kippah
