CREATED:20170425T170307Z
DESCRIPTION:The CBS Book Club will meet in the Rabin Library.\n\nThe book t
 o be discussed is Moacyr Scliar's "The Centaur in the Garden."\n\nAn outsid
 er among outsiders\, a Jewish centaur narrates his life’s journey from his 
 birth on a farm homesteaded by his Russian immigrant family in southern Bra
 zil through his efforts to rid himself of the equine portion of his body an
 d take his place in contemporary Brazilian society. Listed by the National 
 Yiddish Book Center as one of the 100 greatest works of modern Jewish liter
 ature\, this earthy tale is one you won’t soon forget.\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170425T170307Z
LOCATION:Rabin Family Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CBS Book Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
