UID:kfi3drnfc3f3be8gfgvppjpq3g@google.com
CREATED:20170627T173528Z
DESCRIPTION:"World Gone Mad: The Question Concerning Heidegger"\n\nAn exami
 nation of several excerpts from Martin Heidegger's "The Question Concerning
  Technology." We will discuss not only his argument itself and its place in
  our new technological reality\, but what can (or should) be the place of H
 eidegger's thought vis-a-vis Judaism and modern philosophy.\n\nMichael Loeb
 s is a lecture of political philosophy at San Francisco State University an
 d has taught at Beth Sholom on such writers as Nietzsche\, Benjamin\, the R
 ambam\, and Arendt.
LAST-MODIFIED:20170926T060655Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Michael Loebs' Teaching
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
