 ah service begins (approx. 9:45 a.m.\, the Koret Hall attendees will move f
 rom the Sanctuary to Koret).\n\n\nProgramming For Children:\nDays of AWE (a
 ges 5 – 12): 10 a.m. – 2 p.m.\, locations TBD\nChildcare (ages newborn – 4)
 : 10 a.m. – 2 p.m.\, locations TBD\n\nA TICKET IS REQUIRED. For information
