UID:npkpht652627gsflp26a1q32ng@google.com
CREATED:20160620T195938Z
DESCRIPTION:Following our Fusion Friday Kabbalat Shabbat service\, we invit
 e you to join fellow members of the CBS community for a delicious Shabbat d
 inner!\n\nCBS Executive Chef Jane Sykes is crafting a Shabbat feast that wi
 ll delight your tummy\, buoy your spirits\, and generally put you in a Shab
 bat state of mind! We encourage attendees to bring their favorite bottle of
  wine to share with others. Together\, we will turn our attention from the 
 demands of the work week\, celebrate our points of connection\, and enjoy s
 ome really\, really good food!\n\nThe menu:\nOven Roasted Salmon Teryiaki\n
 Vegetable Chow Mein\nStir Fried Broccoli with Garlic\nFruit Platter\nApple 
 Tart\n \nCost: $36 per person ($18 kids 12 and under).\nShab-box $26 (whole
  meal only)\n \nPlease note that tickets must be reserved by 6 p.m. on Sund
 ay\, September 11. Signups after that deadline incur a $10 per person surch
 arge\, and no sign ups are accepted after 9 a.m. on Wednesday\, September 1
 4.\n\nhttps://www.universe.com/events/community-shabbat-dinner-cbs-good-sha
 b-box-tickets-FYNKD1
LAST-MODIFIED:20160914T215122Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:(POSTPONED) CBS Community Shabbat Dinner
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
