DESCRIPTION:Join Congregation Beth Sholom and Faith In Action to learn more
  about the work for racial and economic justice that Faith In Action is doi
 ng in the Bay Area. This evening workshop will be a dialogue\; Faith In Act
 ion trainers will explain why social justice work is needed in the Bay Area
  right now\, and why organizing is a powerful strategy for faith communitie
 s to respond to racial and economic disparities. Faith In Action aims to ma
 ke clear the connection between faith\, personal purpose\, community-buildi
 ng\, and social action.
LAST-MODIFIED:20171122T051334Z
LOCATION:Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Faith In Action Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
