UID:u4kdm3ppjjpnhcittv169apm70@google.com
CREATED:20161103T235205Z
DESCRIPTION:The CBS Book Club will meet in the Rabin Library. The book to b
 e discussed is: "American Pastoral\," by  Philip Roth.\n\nWe have arranged 
 to borrow the Jewish Community Library's Book Club in a Box copies of this 
 novel (it availability is why this particular novel from his oeuvre was sel
 ected). The book is also readily available in print\, e-book and audio vers
 ions. The SF Public Library has a copies\, but there is currently a waiting
  list. \n\n"American Pastoral" focuses on a successful Jewish American busi
 nessman and former high school star athlete from Newark\, New Jersey\, whos
 e happy and conventional upper middle class life is ruined by the domestic 
 social and political turmoil of the 1960s during the presidency of Lyndon B
 . Johnson.
LAST-MODIFIED:20161103T235205Z
LOCATION:Rabin Family Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CBS Book Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
