DESCRIPTION:Each year\, Ephraim Margolin’s popular Yom Kippur teaching is i
 nformative\, erudite\, surprising\, and intellectually rewarding. This titl
 e of his 5777 teaching is On Love of Israel & Criticism.\n\nEphraim Margoli
 n served as Secretary to Menachem Begin\, leader of the IRGUN\, and is also
  a past Chair of the San Francisco Jewish Community Relations Council (JCRC
 ). He taught for years in law school – he is a Hebrew University and Yale L
 aw School graduate – is also a teacher in our Thinking Matters mini-course 
 series (Lifelong Learning).
