DESCRIPTION:Chicken Soupers feeds the Jewish Family and Children Services c
 lients with disabilities. \nTim to convert the kitchen from dairy to meat a
 nd next day a.m. back to dairy. \nFrom 9 a.m.-12 noon food is cooked\, \n2:
 30-3:30 p.m.\, food is packaged on long tables in the Main Meeting Room\nan
 d deliveries are made from approximately 3:30-5 p.m. \n\nSteve Sloan will d
 elivery items for goodie bags earlier this week\nJANE TO LET DEBRA KNOW IF 
 SHE NEEDS TO BRING THE CHICKEN ON SUNDAY.\nMaralyn Tabatsky to deliver dess
 erts on the Friday prior to this date.\n\nTIM:\nGarbage cans in the kitchen
  for landfill and recyclable garbage\nTake the foil packet of chicken meat 
 out of the meat freezer on Saturday morning and put it in the meat fridge s
