UID:pbb16jeucg3t2rktr8ggio4ikc@google.com
CREATED:20160725T230057Z
DESCRIPTION:The question ‘Who Is A Jew?’ gets a lot of attention. However\,
  a much more essential issue is how can we live as Jews\, regardless of whe
 ther we were born Jews or have become Jews By Choice and whether we have li
 ved active Jewish lives or have been largely disengaged. How Is A Jew? will
  explore essential Jewish values through a comparison of the opening invoca
 tion of the Sh’ma and Hillel’s description of on-one-foot Judaism.\n\nHenry
  Hollander is a bookseller and the leader of our Talmud study group. He wil
 l also teach our university-accredited Intro To Judaism course this year.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160813T234758Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Henry Hollander's Teaching
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
