DTEND:20190209T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055328Z
UID:7j4lgamgo5hkjhrsbjfqm8g8vl@google.com
CREATED:20181005T170358Z
DESCRIPTION:\nOnce a month Rabbi Ain and Cantorial Soloist\, Jacob Erez\, w
 ill guide us through a traditional service\, provide insight and explanatio
 n toward the prayers we recite on Shabbat Morning. As prayer becomes more c
 omfortable and familiar\, individuals will have the opportunity to help lea
 d prayers\, portions of the service\, and bless or read from the Torah. The
  service concludes at noon\, followed by an invitation to a delicious Kiddu
 sh lunch in Koret Hall. When there is not a Learners Service\, all students
  are invited to attend Shabbat morning services in the sanctuary.\n\nShabba
 t Learners Services will take place on October 20\, November 17\, January 2
 6\, February 9\, March 9\, April 13\, and May 4
LAST-MODIFIED:20181005T170359Z
LOCATION:Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shabbat Learners Service
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
