CREATED:20180801T174238Z
DESCRIPTION:Inner Preparation for the High Holy Days\nSunday August 12th 3:
 00 – 6:00 pm - and - Thursday September 13th 6:30-8:00 pm \nNorman Fischer 
 will lead two meditation sessions in preparation for the High Holy Days. \n
 Using guided meditation and readings from R. Lew’s\, This is Real and You a
 re Completely Unprepared\, we will reach deeply into the silence to draw cl
 oser to our inner lives. \nWith love and compassion we will care for our so
 uls and move towards the teshuvah/turning point that allows us to repair ou
 rselves\, our relationships and ultimately the world.\n\nSunday August 12th
  3:00 – 6:00 pm\nThursday September 13th 6:30-8:00 pm\nLocation: Congregati
 on Beth Sholom\n301 14th Ave. SF 94118\nTuition: $65 cash or check at the d
 oor (sorry no credit cards yet)\nRegistration RSVP to: makororsf@gmail.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20180810T222343Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Sholom\, 301 14th Ave\, San Francisco\, CA 94118
 \, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CANCELED: Inner Preparation for the High Holy Days
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
