CREATED:20160620T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Newman Fisher on "Jewish Cryptology"\n\nThe history of cryptolo
 gy (secret messages) began ages ago. We will examine examples of cryptology
  through the ages in a variety of cultures and see how the subject has evol
 ved in modern times with a special focus on the Jewish influence on current
  practice. No mathematical background is necessary.\n\nMore info: http://be
 thsholomsf.org/dr-e-m-weitz-breakfast-club-march-26/
LAST-MODIFIED:20170301T180951Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dr. Ernest M. Weitz Breakfast Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
