UID:7957ncfl7np3el5jdtjjm17doi@google.com
CREATED:20181003T175332Z
DESCRIPTION:\nAll students in 6th and 7th grade participate in four Family 
 Education sessions with Rabbi Ain and Rebecca Goodman\, Director of Youth E
 ducation\, on Thursday evenings. We begin with minyan\, followed by dinner 
 and learning together. Students are required to attend these events\, with 
 at least one parent\; we hope these workshops are enriching and meaningful 
 experiences for child and parent alike. The dates and themes for this year 
 are:\n\nOctober 11 - Orientation & The Science of Character\nNovember 29 - 
  Find a Mitzvah that Fits Ya: Keeping the Mitzvah in Bar/Bat Mitzvah\nJanua
 ry 31 - Tzedek & Tzedakah: Changing the World\nApril 4\, 2019 - Kippah\, Ta
 llit & Tefillin: But I just want to wear a hat!
LAST-MODIFIED:20181003T181110Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:B'nai Mitzvah Family Education
TRANSP:OPAQUE
