DESCRIPTION:The words of our Jewish liturgy may be recited silently\, chant
 ed\, or sung. The CBS Fusion Friday Musical Kabbalat Shabbat series emphasi
 zes the latter\, louder approach!\n\nLed by Rabbi Aubrey Glazer\, the Shir 
 Hashirim Ensemble (Hazzan Richard Kaplan\, violinist Lila Sklar\, and John 
 Erlich on ud and guitar) provides participants with an exquisite Friday nig
 ht service that features Jewish sacred music from around the world - Sefard
 i\, Mizrachi\, and Ashkenazic\, including a Jewish/Turkish/Sufi zikr\, cont
 emplative prayer\, and Zoharic teachings and meditations by Rabbi Glazer.\n
 \nWhen we raise our voices together as a community to welcome Shabbat\, we 
 create a powerful transformative experience\, one that sustains and empower
 s us not just in the moment\, but also during the rest of the week. Let's s
 ing together on Friday\, September 16\, at 6:30 p.m.!
LAST-MODIFIED:20160620T200604Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Fusion Friday Kabbalat Shabbat Services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
