CREATED:20151029T221201Z
DESCRIPTION:The words of our Jewish liturgy may be recited silently\, chant
 ed\, or sung. The CBS 3rd Friday Musical Kabbalat Shabbat series emphasizes
  the latter\, louder approach!\n\nLed by Rabbi Aubrey Glazer\, the Shir Has
 hirim Ensemble (Hazzan Richard Kaplan\, violinist Lila Sklar\, and John Erl
 ich on ud and guitar) provides participants with an exquisite Friday night 
 service that features Jewish sacred music from around the world - Sefardi\,
  Mizrachi\, and Ashkenazic\, including a Jewish/Turkish/Sufi zikr\, contemp
 lative prayer\, and Zoharic teachings and meditations by Rabbi Glazer.\n\nW
 hen we raise our voices together as a community to welcome Shabbat\, we cre
 ate a powerful transformative experience\, one that sustains and empowers u
 s not just in the moment\, but also during the rest of the week. Let's sing
  together on Friday\, June 17\, at 6:30 p.m.!
LAST-MODIFIED:20180222T231511Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:3rd Friday Musical Kabbalat Shabbat Services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
