DESCRIPTION:You are invited to the Religious School Open House for all pare
 nts with children ages Kindergarten (starting Fall 2010) and older.\n\nSche
 dule: \n\n9.30-10 a.m.: Join the service Rabbi Philmus leads for the younge
 r Religious School students. (Gronowski Family Chapel) \n10-10.15 a.m.: Int
 roduction to the Religious School at Congregation Beth Sholom by Rabbi Phil
 mus. (Koret Hall) \n10.15-10.30 a.m.: Observe the learning and the activiti
 es in the classrooms. (School Building) \n10.30-11 a.m.:  Q &A with Rabbi P
 hilmus and current Religious School parents. Light refreshments will be ser
 ved. (Koret Hall) \nThe goal of the open house is to offer a taste of the p
 rogram our Religious School offers. The event is geared towards parents. Un
 fortunately we are unable to offer childcare.      \n\nIf you have any ques
 tions about this event\, please contact Elin Cohen at elincohen@hotmail.com
 \,  Rabbi Aaron Philmus at RabbiPhilmus@bethsholomsf.org or Sarah Hefter at
  SHefter@bethsholomsf.org.\n\nPlease RSVP to Elin Cohen at elincohen@hotmai
 l.com.\n \n(The Education Committee at Congregation Beth Sholom) \n
