 life with a Jew and want to crack the code? Or maybe you’re a Jew who doesn
 ’t know much about Judaism or Jewish identity?\n\nOur engaging\, university
 -accredited Intro To Judaism course is interactive and encourages questions
 \, discussion\, and hands-on learning. No knowledge of Hebrew is required\,
  but you will be learning to read the language as part of the class.\n\nTau
 ght by Henry Hollander\, CBS congregant\, bookseller\, and the leader of ou
 r Talmud study group. \n\nDetails here: http://bethsholomsf.org/education/a
 dult-education/#conversion
