DESCRIPTION:Following our Fusion Friday Kabbalat Shabbat service\, we invit
 e you to join fellow members of the CBS community for a delicious Shabbat d
 inner!\n\nCBS Executive Chef Jane Sykes is crafting a Shabbat feast that wi
 ll delight your tummy\, buoy your spirits\, and generally put you in a Shab
 bat state of mind! We encourage attendees to bring their favorite bottle of
  wine to share with others. Together\, we will turn our attention from the 
 demands of the work week\, celebrate our points of connection\, and enjoy s
 ome really\, really good food!\n\nThe menu:\nTBD\n\nTickets are TBD.\n\nPur
 chase your dinner ticket by TBD.\n \nPlease note that tickets must be reser
 ved by 6 p.m. on TBD. Late orders cannot be guaranteed and will incur a $10
  per person surcharge (e.g.\, TBD for a family of 4).
