CREATED:20151106T235931Z
DESCRIPTION:This week\, a special afternoon study on Eicha / Lamentations i
 n preparation for Tisha B'Av.\n\nEach week a different psalm is studied. Th
 e text is easily accessible\, but the issues are full of complexity. No kno
