 th 6:30-8:00 pm \nNorman Fischer will lead two meditation sessions in prepa
 ration for the High Holy Days. \nUsing guided meditation and readings from 
 R. Lew’s\, This is Real and You are Completely Unprepared\, we will reach d
 eeply into the silence to draw closer to our inner lives. \nWith love and c
 ompassion we will care for our souls and move towards the teshuvah/turning 
 point that allows us to repair ourselves\, our relationships and ultimately
  the world.\n\nThursday September 13th 6:30-8:00 pm\nLocation: Congregation
  Beth Sholom\n301 14th Ave. SF 94118\nTuition: $65 cash or check at the doo
 r (sorry no credit cards yet)\nRegistration RSVP to: makororsf@gmail.com
