DESCRIPTION:School Building\n\nShorashim for Teens\nSeptember 8\, 6 p.m. (M
 adrichim Orientation\nSeptember 17\, 6:30 p.m. (High Holidays Madrichim Pre
 p)\nShorashim means roots. Once a month we will gather to explore our Jewis
 h roots and identity through film and food. Shorashim teens will also be ex
 pected to fulfill volunteer hours as madrichim (counselors) for the religio
 us school or by restoring native plant habitats in local parks. At the end 
 of the year participants will get to make their own film on Jewish identity
 .\n\n\nFor more information contact Sarah Hefter at 415.221.8736\, ext. 140
 \, or SHefter@bethsholomsf.org.
