 o opens. Since so many families are zoo members\, we are not organizing a g
 roup admission. Beth Sholom staff will welcome you before the ticket gates 
 to answer any questions and just past the gatehouse at the Leaping Lemur Ca
 fÃ© when you arrive. Weâll provide you with new and improved (age-appropr
 iate) activities that you can complete as a family or with your friends. At
  noon\, weâll bring our whole group together at the Patas Lawn for a picn
 ic lunch (bring a picnic blanket and your lunch or pick up some food from o
 ne of the cafÃ©s at the zoo). Weâll conclude with some songs and celebrat
 ion of Noah saving all the animals from the flood. Animal cookies will be s
 erved.
