UID:40lhp2cm6a8276fc8cd19g5c23@google.com
CREATED:20180510T223302Z
DESCRIPTION:<p> </p><p>Israeli Innovation</p><p>You already know that Israe
 l is a world leader in many areas of scientific and technological innovatio
 n. Would you like to learn more about pioneering Israeli research into the 
 biology of the human brain. </p><p>Professor Adi Mizrahi is the Director of
  The Edmond &amp\; Lily Safra Center for Brain Sciences in Jerusalem\, and 
 is a professor and research team leader in the Department of Neurobiology a
 t the Hebrew University of Jerusalem.</p><p>Achshav Yisrael invites you to 
 hear Professor Adi Mizrahi share his expertise in this fascinating field. H
 is presentation will cover:</p><p>• Brain plasticity: How much do our brain
 s really change?</p><p>• Brain function: The brain as a prediction machine<
 /p><p>• Brain repair: Can we replace damaged brain circuits?</p><p>• Parent
 hood: Brain changes when you become a parent</p><p>• New treatments: Medica
 l advancements in diseases such as Parkinson's and Alzheimers</p><p>COST: $
 15 advance\, $20 at the door. Children under 18 attend for FREE!&nbsp\;&nbs
 p\;</p><p>Please email Beth Jones if a waiver is needed or call at 415-940-
 7092.</p><p>See the Beth Sholom website to register for this event.</p><p><
 br></p><p></p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180605T203922Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Achshav Yisrael Event - Israeli Innovation with Professor Adi Mizra
 hi
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
