DESCRIPTION:The San Francisco Public Health Department announced an aggress
 ive recommendation cancelling all large gatherings. Therefore\, with an abu
 ndance of concern for protecting our community and helping to stop the spre
 ad of the COVID-19 virus\, we are cancelling Purim Palooza.Please join us f
 or PURIMPALOOZA! Our annual Purimpalooza Carnival will feature a Spiel\, an
  80's themed carnival\, prizes\, food\, a raffle\, silent auction\, jumpy h
 ouses\, Megillah reading and more!  It’s an absolute blast … and it’s for a
  great cause! All proceeds from this fundraiser support CBS youth education
  including the Congregation Beth Sholom Family Preschool and Shabbat School
 . Join the CBS community to celebrate a world turned upside down with a tot
 ally gnarly Purimpalooza celebration!  https://bethsholomsf.secure.nonprofi
 tsoapbox.com/purimpalooza2020https://www.signupgenius.com/go/30e0a4ea5ab23a
 2fa7-purimpalooza 
LAST-MODIFIED:20200308T161730Z
