CREATED:20190913T005300Z
DESCRIPTION:Preparation for Yom Kippur: The Days of Awe\n\nJoin Norman Fisc
 her and Rabbi Dorothy Richman during the Days of Awe\, for a day of meditat
 ion\, teaching and prayer as we continue our journey into the soul of the H
 igh Holy Days. The Days of Awe open us to the questions of who we are and h
 ow we live our lives. As we breathe in meditation we allow ourselves to ope
 n to change and teshuvah. Turning from the path of distraction we realign o
 urselves with love and compassion\, as we approach the day of at-one-ment\,
  Yom Kippur.\n\nNo previous experience with meditation\, Hebrew\, or prayer
  is necessary. Makor Or is egalitarian and LGBTQIA friendly.\n\nPlease resp
 ect our members with asthma and do not wear scented products\, even natural
  scents\, to Makor Or programs.\n\nDATE: Sunday\, October 6\nTIME: 10 a.m.-
 5 p.m.\nPLACE: Makom Shalom\nRSVP: makororsf@gmail.com\nCOST: $80 (cash or 
 check) at the door\nPlease make checks payable to: Makor Or
LAST-MODIFIED:20190913T005300Z
LOCATION:Makom Shalom
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Makor Or High Holy Days Retreat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
