DESCRIPTION:Join Dale Kleisley\, Katherine Barboni and Jonathan Bayer every
  Tuesday at 10 a.m. for a live production - geared towards preschool aged c
 hildren as we explore Jewish values and holidays as a community. <br><br>Ch
 eckers driving your crackers?  Candyland giving you a toothache?   <br><br>
 Those games will all lose-a-turn when you come and learn creative new indoo
 r games from the Beth Sholom teachers!  They'll inspire you to turn everyda
 y objects and tiny indoor playing fields into hours of easy-to-clean up fun
  for you and your child.  And just to make sure things get really wild\, we
 'll have a visit from the Original Grandmaster himself\, Moses!<br><br><str
 ong>Note: This event will have a password!</strong>&nbsp\;<br>Zoom Link:&nb
 sp\;<a href="https://zoom.us/j/96226947925">https://zoom.us/j/96226947925</
 a>&nbsp\;<br>Meeting ID: 962 2694 7925<br>RSVP for password:&nbsp\;<a href=
 "mailto:preschool@bethsholomsf.org">preschool@bethsholomsf.org</a>&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20200429T191708Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Netzach is the name of the Game!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
