DESCRIPTION:Dr. Anat Balint is an Israeli media scholar\, a member of the S
 eventh Eye independent media watchdog and former Ha'aretz media corresponde
 nt. She writes about political and economic pressures brought upon the medi
 a and frequently deals with questions of journalism ethics and freedom of t
 he press in Israel. She is a frequent commentator on Israeli media and Jour
 nalism ethics in general. She is currently an Israel Institute visiting sch
 olar at San Francisco State University.&nbsp\;<br><br><br>When: Sunday\, Ma
 y 19\, 2019 | 3 - 5 p.m.<br><br>Where: Congregation Beth Sholom\, Koret Hal
 l<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;301 14t
 h Avenue (at Clement Street)<br><br>Cost: $15 advance <a href="https://www.
 eventbrite.com/e/israeli-politics-and-media-in-the-aftermath-of-the-electio
 ns-tickets-60473369476" id="ow8742" __is_owner="true">tickets available her
 e</a> |  $20 at the door  |  17 &amp\; under: free
LAST-MODIFIED:20190503T215210Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Achshav Yisrael Presents: Israeli Politics and Media in the Afterma
 th of the Elections Featuring Speaker Dr. Anat Balint
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
