DESCRIPTION:Once a month Rabbi Russell will guide us through a traditional 
 service providing insight and explanation toward the prayers we recite on S
 habbat Morning. As prayer becomes more comfortable and familiar\, individua
 ls will have the opportunity to help lead prayers\, portions of the service
 \, and bless or read from the Torah. The service concludes at noon\, follow
 ed by an invitation to a delicious Kiddush lunch in Koret Hall. When there 
 is not a Learners Service\, all students are invited to attend Shabbat morn
 ing services in the sanctuary.\n\nB'nai Mitzvah Learner's Minyan will take 
 place on:\nNovember 16 \nDecember 7 \nJanuary 4 \nFebruary 8 \nMarch 14 \nA
 pril 18 \nMay 16
LAST-MODIFIED:20190913T173339Z
LOCATION:Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shabbat Learners Service
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
