 nt potpourri of songs\, stories\, games and activities for children and fam
 ilies\, all inspired by our journey through the Jewish year.<br><br>Parshat
  B'haalotecha inspires us to explore different kinds of light\, reflections
  and famous lamps throughout Jewish History. Plus\, a story about what happ
 ens when even the closest family has an argument.<br><br><br>Listen to our 
