DESCRIPTION:JOIN Kabbalat Shabbat Service<br>On the fourth Friday of each m
 onth<br><br>Have you ever skipped out on Shabbat services because you feare
 d your kids would be disruptive?&nbsp\;<br><br>Have you ever looked around 
 and wished there were more families during times of prayer?&nbsp\;<br><br>T
 his is the service for you!<br><br>The youth and our families are the futur
 e! Please join us for what will be an inter-generational Shabbat service. A
  space where children can be themselves\, where parents can pray alongside 
 their children and congregants of all ages can feel at home.<br><br>This mo
 nth\, the service will be led by Rabbi Dan Ain accompanied by guest musicia
 ns David Israel Katz and Ben Chinn. They will use instruments through Kabba
 lat Shabbat and we will pray from a family-friendly siddur.<br><br>Dinner w
 ill be served in advance of each service. This event is free to the communi
 ty but please register in advance to help us prepare the appropriate amount
  of food.<br><br>L’dor V'dor...please JOIN us!<br><br><a href="https://docs
 .google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc-mOu7c_1t-DeYcue9RuU7anPfWN6KEDUSMtcdrqb2VgG
 i_g/viewform" id="ow8989" __is_owner="true">CLICK HERE TO RSVP</a><br><br>D
 ATE: Fourth&nbsp\;Friday of every month<br>TIME: 5:30 p.m. dinner\, 6 p.m. 
 service<br>LOCATION: Koret Hall &amp\; Sanctuary
LAST-MODIFIED:20191024T195944Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall & Sanctuary
