DESCRIPTION:How do Jews come to know God?\n\nJoin Rabbi Ain for a thought-p
 rovoking dialogue about revelation and what we mean when we talk about God.
  We'll consult rabbinic texts\, hear from each other\, and investigate how 
 our answers to this question has shaped denominational Jewish life for the 
 last 150 years. We'll also have lots of dairy treats and refreshments.
