UID:2uh0coa8tkmop8bf3dfqp6116e@google.com
CREATED:20191030T171853Z
DESCRIPTION:Glide Memorial Church in the Tenderloin serves 2000 meals a day
 \, 365 days a year to the homeless and those who are food insecure. We rese
 rve 20 spaces for CBS members\, ages 6-106\, to help serve lunch (11 a.m. –
  1 p.m.)\, each month. Check the CBS website for dates and to reserve your 
 spot.<br><br>Last year\, a group of 10 Beth Sholom families participated in
  a pilot project at Glide\, learning with Rabbi Michael Lezak\, Glide Commu
 nity Rabbi\, about the Tenderloin community through a Jewish lens and volun
 teering on a monthly basis. Now we’re extending this mitzvah opportunity to
  you!<br>Please join us for this important work taking our Jewish values of
  justice and righteousness outside the CBS. <br><br>Price: Free<br>Location
 : Glide Memorial Church <br>Dates/Time: Oct 27\; Nov 10\; Dec 22\; Jan 19\;
  Check website for additional dates<br>For more information about volunteer
 ing to serve meals\, contact: Dawne Bear Novicoff <a href="mailto:dbnovicof
 f@gmail.com">dbnovicoff@gmail.com</a> or Becky Buckwald <a href="mailto:bec
 kybuckwald@gmail.com">beckybuckwald@gmail.com</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20191119T233924Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Serve Sunday Lunch at Glide
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
