DESCRIPTION:Join Dale Kleisley\, Katherine Barboni\, and Jonathan Bayer eve
 ry Tuesday at 10 a.m. for a fragrant potpourri of songs\, stories\, games a
 nd activities for children and families\, all inspired by our journey throu
 gh the Jewish year. community!&nbsp\;<br><br><br><b>T</b>otal <b>M</b>iriam
  <b>I</b>nspiration!&nbsp\;<br><br>Miriam Fest 2020! &nbsp\;<br><br>Celebra
 te the amazing life of Miriam the Prophet!&nbsp\; We'll review her early ye
 ars as Moses' babysitter\, her virtuoso tambourine performance at the Sea o
 f Reeds and her finding water in the middle of the desert. Get ready for wa
 ter play with teacher Pam\, a percussion discussion with teacher Liz\, Hide
  and Seek with teacher Anne\, and of course Dale's Chassidic tales!<br><br>
 Note: This event will have a password! <br><a href="https://zoom.us/j/96226
 947925" id="ow2106" __is_owner="true">Zoom Link (click here)</a><br>Meeting
  ID: 962 2694 7925<br>RSVP to <a href="mailto:preschool@bethsholomsf.org">p
 reschool@bethsholomsf.org</a> for the event password.<br><br>Listen to the 
 T.M.I. theme song by Jonathan Bayer!<br><a href="https://mixcord.co/acapell
 a/p/vN_STNozcUCB-3Z4hi_wXQ/">https://mixcord.co/acapella/p/vN_STNozcUCB-3Z4
 hi_wXQ/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200625T224502Z
LOCATION:https://zoom.us/j/96226947925\, 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:T.M.I. at 10 - Total Miriam Inspiration! 
