CREATED:20191003T231759Z
DESCRIPTION:After you shake the lulav and shake the aravot\, what's left to
  do? Shake a leg with the Torah!\n\nJoin us for our Simchat Torah Celebrati
 on! The celebration will feature live music from Veretski Pass\, a lot of d
 ancing (with our beloved Torah scrolls)\, Israeli food\, caramel apples\, e
 dible Torah making\, flag decorating\, plenty of schmoozing\, and\, yes\, m
 ore dancing!\nAll ages are welcome!
LAST-MODIFIED:20191017T180203Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Community Simchat Torah Celebration!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
