UID:59dq4e9oetvk0pjjd7navbhp0p@google.com
CREATED:20190627T231530Z
DESCRIPTION:DAVEN - on the first Friday of each month \n\n\nFor 500 years\,
  Jews have used the Kabbalat Shabbat service to\nmake a transition from bus
 y weekdays to the calm spaciousness\nof Shabbat. In the DAVEN service\, we 
 will explore the Hebrew\nliturgy\, using niggun (wordless melody)\, chant\,
  song\, and silence\nto engage this joyous tradition with our friends and f
 amilies.\n\nDavid Malman has been a CBS member since 1998. He has led\nShab
 bat\, daily minyan\, and High Holy Days services. He is an\nactive particip
 ant in Makor Or\, the meditation group started by\nRabbi Alan Lew (z”l). Da
 vid and his wife Ellen Shireman taught\na successful Learner’s Minyan for s
 everal years\, and he attended\nJoey Weisenberg’s “Building Singing Communi
 ties” multi-day\nworkshops in 2013 and 2014. He is honored and pleased to b
 e\nwelcoming Shabbat with the CBS community.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190828T014746Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:DAVEN Kabbalat Shabbat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
