DESCRIPTION:Happy Hour\, 5:30pm\nTalking Torah and Talmud with Rabbi Ain at
  various bars throughout San Francisco. An intimate opportunity for connect
 ion\, learning and inspiration. Come meet other young professionals trying 
 to build a community and/or family in the Bay Area and tap into a fresh per
