DESCRIPTION:A special kiddush to honor Billy Kwong!\n\nAfter 32 years with 
 the CBS community\, Billy Kwong is retiring from our Facilities staff. For 
 those of you who do not know Billy\, he is a mensch of the first order.\n\n
 Billy has provided generations of congregants and families with caring and 
 committed service. His buoyant personality\, can-do attitude\, and diligenc
 e will be missed dearly\, as well as the fact that\, without fail\, he perf
 orms above and beyond the call of duty — truly\, he is irreplaceable!\n\nWe
  will honor Billy during Shabbat kiddush lunch on Saturday\, June 4. That a
 fternoon\, we will also present him with a retirement gift. \n\nFor more in
 formation or to sponsor a Kiddush please contact Jane Sykes at jsykes@beths
 holomsf.org.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200717T002432Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kiddush
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
