DESCRIPTION:Join Dale Kleisley\, Katherine Barboni and Jonathan Bayer every
  Tuesday at 10 a.m. for a live production - geared towards preschool aged c
 hildren as we explore Jewish values and holidays as a community.&nbsp\;<br>
 <br>If you come\, we will build it! Join us for a session of tips\, tricks\
 , songs and games all about building\, in honor of the Omer's week of Yesod
 \, or foundation. We will welcome a special visit from Joe the Builder!&nbs
 p\;<br><br>Bring your blocks and <a href="https://mixcord.co/acapella/p/w7p
 yInfmvVb9Joj5GIOFrQ/">watch this building song from Jonathan Bayer</a> to i
 nspire your creations.&nbsp\; <br><br><br><strong>Note: This event will hav
 e a password!</strong>&nbsp\;<br><a href="https://zoom.us/j/96226947925%C2%
 A0">Zoom Link (click here)</a><br>Meeting ID: 962 2694 7925<br>RSVP to&nbsp
 \;<a href="mailto:preschool@bethsholomsf.org">preschool@bethsholomsf.org</a
 >&nbsp\;for the event password.
