DESCRIPTION:<p>Join Dale Kleisley\, Katherine Barboni\, and Jonathan Bayer 
 every Tuesday at 10 a.m. for a fragrant potpourri of songs\, stories\, game
 s and activities for children and families\, all inspired by our journey th
 rough the Jewish year. <br></p><br>Too Much Iteration<br><br>You might hear
  it called D'varim\, words\, or Deutoronmy\, a repetition\, but we're calli
 ng it:<br><br>Moses's Greatest Hits!<br><br>That's right-- all the laws\, a
 ll the stories\, all the staff raising\, all the face falling\, and of cour
 se\, the Torah Torah Tziva Lanu Moshe song!<br>Note: This event will have a
  password!&nbsp\;<a href="https://zoom.us/j/96226947925">Zoom Link (click h
 ere)</a><br>Meeting ID: 962 2694 7925<br>RSVP to <a href="mailto:preschool@
 bethsholomsf.org">preschool@bethsholomsf.org</a> for the event password.<br
 ><br>Listen to the T.M.I. theme song by Jonathan Bayer!<br><a href="https:/
 /mixcord.co/acapella/p/vN_STNozcUCB-3Z4hi_wXQ/">https://mixcord.co/acapella
 /p/vN_STNozcUCB-3Z4hi_wXQ/</a>
