DESCRIPTION:\n** Update: This month's DAVEN Kabbalat Shabbat service will b
 e led by Adam Hertz\, and he and his wife\, Joan \, will lead the meditatio
 n beforehand.**\n\nFriday Night Meditation\n\nUnwind from the week and prep
 are for Kabbalat Shabbat with a 30-minute silent meditation session. This m
 onth's DAVEN will be led by Beth Sholom congregants Adam and Joan Hertz. Co
 me join us for silent sitting and Jewish chant\, as we enter into the beaut
 y and peace of Shabbat.\n\nAll are welcome\, no experience necessary!\n\nDA
 TE: Every First Friday before DAVEN Kabbalat Shabbat\nTIME:  5:50 - 6:20 p.
 m.\nPLACE: Makom Sholom\nWHO: Free and open to all! Beginners are encourage
 d to attend. No RSVP required!
