 e service that allows even our youngest community members to experience the
  joy of Shabbat in a warm and welcoming setting.\n\nTot Shabbat begins at 1
 1:15am and concludes at noon in the chapel. Everyone is invited to join the
  greater CBS community for Kiddush lunch at noon in Koret Hall every month 
 (no RSVP or payment required).\n\nMark your calendars now for these excitin
 g dates:\n     March 30\, 2019\n     April 6\, 2019 \n     April 13\, 2019 
