DESCRIPTION:Our Annual Meeting will take place on Sunday June 2\, at 10 a.m
 . The meeting is an opportunity to come together as a community to celebrat
 e\, schmooze\, nosh\, and also attend to our synagogue's important business
 \, including aspects of our finances and programming\, and discuss the exci
 ting year ahead.\n\nParents\, please note that we are offering free childca
 re (for ages 0-8) in the CBS Family Preschool during the meeting. You must 
 register your child(ren) in advance so that we know how many childcare prov
 iders to staff.\n\nDeadline to register for childcare is Tuesday\, May 28. 
 Please register a spot for each child.
