CREATED:20190501T175028Z
DESCRIPTION:FRIDAY NIGHT MEDITATION\nTime:   Friday evening: 5:50 - 6:20 pm
  before Daven Kabbalat Shabbat\nPlace:  Makom Sholom Meditation Room\n301 1
 4th Ave @ Clement\n\nFree open to all\, meditation beginners are encouraged
  to attend.\n\nUnwind from the week and prepare for Kabbalat Shabbat\, with
  a 30 minute silent meditation session.  This session will be led by Beth S
 holom congregant Ellen Shireman\, director of Makor Or: A Center for Jewish
  Meditation.  Come join us for silent sitting and Jewish chant\, as we ente
 r into the beauty and peace of Shabbat.  All are welcome\, no experience ne
 cessary. \n \nThe once a month Friday night meditation session precedes the
  Daven Kabbalat Shabbat service at Beth Sholom. The Daven Kabbalat  Shabbat
  service on the first Friday of the month is led by Makor Or member David M
 alman and is filled with the traditional text\, niggunim and singing of the
  service.\n\nQuestions? Comments? Reach us here: makororsf@gmail.com\n\nL'S
 halom\,\nEllen Shireman\nMakor Or Director
LAST-MODIFIED:20190501T175034Z
LOCATION:Makom Sholom 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pre-Shabbat Meditation
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
