 r’s LISTEN Kabbalat Shabbat services\, everyone will find an accessible and
  meaningful way to connect to each other and to the awesome power that call
 s us each year through the blast of the shofar. <br><br>YOM KIPPUR SCHEDULE
 :8:30 a.m. - 10 a.m.      Traditional Morning Service (Sanctuary)<br>8:30 a
