DESCRIPTION:<p><strong>YOM HASHOAH - Reading &amp\; Memorial</strong></p><h
 2><strong>We Remember</strong></h2><p><em>A special virtual community event
  commemorating Yom HaShoah.</em></p><p>Join the JFCS Holocaust Center and t
 he greater Bay Area community as we commemorate Yom HaShoah online&nbsp\;fo
 r the very first time.</p><p>Though we must practice social distancing\, we
  will harness the power of online platforms so we can come together virtual
 ly for a series of programs offered April 20 &amp\; 21.</p><p>On April 20\,
  join us for a reading of the names and community yizkor service with parti
 cipating clergy from San Francisco synagogues and the Israeli Consul Genera
 l. More details on programming to be announced in the coming weeks!</p><p>4
 :00 pm - 6:00 pm —Virtual Reading of the Names* on a continuous cycle&nbsp\
 ;(*To remember loved ones on this day\,&nbsp\;<a href="https://forms.gle/nL
 5JV2LfgPQBfVie8">please submit their names here</a>.)</p><p>6:00 - 6:45 pm—
 Virtual Memorial Commemoration and Program</p><p><a href="https://norcalrab
 bis.us15.list-manage.com/track/click?u=03f1b5d460fd8932ead1675a0&id=7cda9a3
 068&e=0c6b7d4f95" id="ow1232" __is_owner="true">Register HERE to join this 
 event.</a><br><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200415T020711Z
LOCATION:Virtual
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:YOM HASHOAH - Reading & Memorial
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
