DESCRIPTION:Following Shabbat Morning Services\, we conclude with Kiddush l
 unch at noon\, with the entire CBS community.\n\nCBS Shabbat School strives
  to:\n*Support parents in the mitzvah of teaching our children.\n*Teach mid
 dot (Jewish values) through Torah study\, personal reflection\, and acts of
  Tikkun Olam.\n*Create powerful Shabbat and holiday experiences with the gr
 eater CBS community.\n*Teach our children to pray as Jews.\n*Cultivate an a
 wareness of God in nature and in human relationships.\n*Provide the tools t
 o lead an engaged Jewish life in our modern world.
