DESCRIPTION:<p>Join Dale Kleisley\, Katherine Barboni\, and Jonathan Bayer 
 every Tuesday at 10 a.m. for a fragrant potpourri of songs\, stories\, game
 s and activities for children and families\, all inspired by our journey th
 rough the Jewish year. <br><br>Sarach\, the world's oldest woman has seen i
 t all\, done it all\, and now\, in a Congregation Beth Sholom exclusive int
 erview she TELLS IT ALL!  Did Jacob our father have a scratchy beard? How d
 id Miriam stay well moisturized even in the desert? Did Moses really have a
  six foot walking stick?<br><br>Tune in Tuesday at 10am\, for <b>T</b>oo <b
 >M</b>uch <b>I</b>nterview!</p><p>Hide and go seek\, freeze dance and more!
 </p><br>Note: This event will have a password!&nbsp\;<a href="https://zoom.
 us/j/96226947925">Zoom Link (click here)</a><br>Meeting ID: 962 2694 7925<b
 r>RSVP to <a href="mailto:preschool@bethsholomsf.org">preschool@bethsholoms
 f.org</a> for the event password.<br><br>Listen to the T.M.I. theme song by
  Jonathan Bayer!<br><a href="https://mixcord.co/acapella/p/vN_STNozcUCB-3Z4
 hi_wXQ/">https://mixcord.co/acapella/p/vN_STNozcUCB-3Z4hi_wXQ/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200702T172406Z
