CREATED:20200331T190017Z
DESCRIPTION:On Sunday April 5 at 4pm\, musicians and scholars Jeremiah Lock
 wood and Jewlia Eisenberg will present a fast moving and pleasure-intensive
  round up of songs for the Passover seder. They will be teaching a mix of c
 lassics from the Haggadah and some radical departures from the rich heritag
 e of American psalmody to bring extra joy and dimension to the seder experi
 ence. Lockwood and Eisenberg will use the spiritual technology of<i>&nbsp\;
 musical midrash</i>&nbsp\;to provide commentary on the iconic stories of th
 e Exodus and the rich Rabbinic text of the Haggadah. They will use the Zoom
  format in ways that play to its strengths\, moving round robin style betwe
 en the teachers and creating space for communal singing...even if we can't 
 all be in the same room\, we can still find joy and community through music
 !<br><br>Zoom details :<br><br>Topic: Music for the Festival of Liberation<
 br>Time: Apr 5\, 2020 05:00 PM Pacific Time (US and Canada)<br><br>Join Zoo
 m Meeting<br>https://zoom.us/j/122069027<br><br>Meeting ID: 122 069 027<br>
 <br>One tap mobile<br>+16699006833\,\,122069027# US (San Jose)<br>+13462487
 799\,\,122069027# US (Houston)<br><br>Dial by your location<br>&nbsp\; &nbs
 p\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; +1 669 900 6833 US (San Jose)<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ; &nbsp\; +1 346 248 7799 US (Houston)<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; +
 1 301 715 8592 US<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; +1 312 626 6799 US (Ch
 icago)<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; +1 929 205 6099 US (New York)<br>
 &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; +1 253 215 8782 US<br>Meeting ID: 122 069 0
 27<br>Find your local number: https://zoom.us/u/afsVMDuQG
LAST-MODIFIED:20200331T235917Z
LOCATION:https://zoom.us/j/122069027
