 t of Queen's Bohemian Rhapsody.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br>Julia returns to Congr
 egation Beth Sholom to play a recital on Sunday\, March 1\, at 6:30pm.&nbsp
 \; Julia visited two years ago and put on an exceptional performance of div
 erse repertoire from classical to tango to pop music. Those of you who hear
 d Julia's recital in 2018 know how engaging and talented she is.&nbsp\; For
  any of you who missed that performance\, here is your chance to hear the h
 arp played in ways that will surprise and delight you.&nbsp\;<br><br>Ticket
 s are available at&nbsp\;<a href="http://bacharp.org/julia-kay-jamieson-con
 cert-tickets/">http://bacharp.org/julia-kay-j<wbr>amieson-concert-tickets/<
 /a>&nbsp\; When you purchase your tickets\, please choose the "Beth Sholom 
 Members" tickets from the drop down menu.&nbsp\; There is a discount for yo
 u\, your family and friends.&nbsp\; Additionally\, 50% of the net proceeds 
 from tickets purchased through the Beth Sholom members link are donated bac
 k to Beth Sholom.&nbsp\; Please invite your friends and family to enjoy a t
 ruly exceptional musical experience."
