DESCRIPTION:\nTHE UPCOMING ISRAELI ELECTIONS\n\nTICKETS: Adults: $15 in adv
 ance ($20 at the door) \n\n17 & under: FREE.\n\nHow does the Israeli politi
 cal system differ from the US political system? How does the Israeli politi
 cal system work? Why are elections being held now?\n\nJoin Achshav Yisrael 
 for another stimulating presentation by Professor Eran Kaplan. Professor Ka
 plan will guide us through the intricacies of Israeli politics and educate 
 us on how the upcoming Israeli elections will determine the next government
  of Israel.\n\nProfessor Kaplan\, an Israeli-American\, holds the Richard a
 nd Rhoda Goldman Chair of Israel Studies at San Francisco State University.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190319T165717Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Achshav Yisrael - Israeli Election Event with Eran Kaplan
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
