  begin the High Holy Days on Erev Rosh Hashanah with a traditional service 
 led by Rabbis Amanda Russell and Dan Ain\, located in our main sanctuary fr
 om 6:30-8:30pm on September 29th. \n\nPlease visit our website at https://w
 ww.bethsholomsf.org/high-holy-days-events-5780 for more details on our serv
 ice offerings and our HHD schedule. 
