DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to get engaged in social activism? We wil
 l be hosting several letter writing parties on various themes and invite al
 l teens and adults to participate. Bring a friend or two! We will provide s
 nacks and supplies\, all you need to do is show up. Hand written letters ca
 rry significantly more weight with your elected representatives and members
 hip organizations than emails\, form letters\, or online petitions. Our fir
 st letter writing party will take place on Tuesday\, October 29th\, 6:30-8:
 00 PM. The theme for this inaugural event will be climate change. Let your 
 elected officials know what you think about climate change or thank them fo
 r the work they are already doing. Please join us!\n\nCost: Free with RSVP 
 to rgoodman@bethsholomsf.org
