UID:518akoqavbdbjbkfhepnffchfv@google.com
CREATED:20190208T194626Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear Women of Beth Sholom\,\n\nIt's been so exciting for me to 
 connect with you over the past 6+ months\, and to learn that so many of us 
 are seeking similar things: greater opportunities to connect\, and for ment
 orship from one another - across the generations - in the realms of life\, 
 work and spirit.\n\nAs a step to move us closer towards this shared goal\, 
 let's gather on March 3rd\, 10 AM at CBS for an ideas exchange & light nosh
 .\n\nWe'll have a chance to discuss what we're hoping to build with one ano
 ther\, and unpack iterations of "Sisterhood" reconsidering and imagining th
 is concept as something that can hold relevance in our lives now.\n\nWe'll 
 leave time for a creative writing exercise to help us flesh out ideas that 
 bring us closer to our personal and communal visions.\n\nI'd love to know h
 ow many of you to expect\, so please send me a quick note to alana@bethshol
 omsf.org to let me know you'll be joining us.\n\nLooking forward to more wi
 th all of you\,\nAlana\n\n\nPS -- Even if you can't make it\, we still want
  to hear your thoughts. Feel free to email them to the address above as wel
 l.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190208T230731Z
LOCATION:Chapel 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Women of CBS: Sisterhood Reconsidered
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
