DESCRIPTION:<b>First Night Hanukkah fun for the whole family!</b><p>A great
  miracle happened there. Sure. Undeniable. You can't disagree with what's w
 ritten on a dreidel....</p><p>But what if we told you... Nes Gadol Koreh Po
 !&nbsp\; A great miracle is happening here.&nbsp\; And you aren't just a pa
 rt of it-- you are the heart of it! Just like the Maccabees\, who\, denied 
 access to their holy places\, DEDICATED themselves to reclaiming their comm
 unity even at the darkest time of the year\, we at Congregation Beth Sholom
  will start off Hanukkah with a bright blaze of story\, song and prayer: no
 t in spite of the darkness\, but INSPIRED by the darkness. It just makes ou
 r candles shine brighter! Join Katherine Friedman Barboni\, Adam Lowy\, Jon
 athan Bayer &amp\; Dale Kleisley for our first night celebration!</p><ul><l
 i><p>Candle lighting&nbsp\;</p></li><li><p>Live Action Play-- The Marvelous
  Ms. Menorah</p></li><li><p>Family Fun Hanukkah game show</p></li></ul><br>
 <b><u><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/89815978884" id="ow427" __is_owner
 ="true">Join on Zoom</a></u></b>:&nbsp\;https://us02web.zoom.us/j/898159788
 84
