 Learning Moreh Derech\, Adam Lowy\, Jonathan Bayer\, Rabbi Ain and Rabbi Ru
 ssell will be beaming live from the CBS Sukkah\, welcoming ancestors\, patr
 iarchs\, matriarchs and some present day heroes! Mark your calendars and pr
 epare to join us from your sukkah\, your couch or from your favorite virtua
 l background for this entertaining\, educational and excellent Sukkot eveni
