DESCRIPTION:<h1><a href="http://goog_28157036">Shofar Experience Mini Serie
 s </a></h1><h1><a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/upcoming-events/shofar
 serieselul-a8b">with Beth Sholom Ba'alot Tikiot</a></h1><br><b><i>(Please n
 ote: This series began on Sunday\, August 23. Attending Part 1 is not requi
 red to attend Part 2)</i></b><p>On the first day of the seventh month (<em>
 Tishrei</em>) “you shall observe complete rest\, a sacred occasion commemor
 ated with loud blasts.”&nbsp\;(<a href="https://www.sefaria.org/Leviticus.2
 3.24?lang=he-en&utm_source=myjewishlearning.com&utm_medium=sefaria_linker">
 Leviticus 23:24</a>)</p><p>These High Holy Days will be different from any 
 other most of us have ever experienced.&nbsp\;One of the primary <em>mitzvo
 t</em> of the holy days is to hear the sound of the shofar.&nbsp\;Since we 
 will not be able to gather this year\, this could be difficult. In an effor
 t to bring Judaism to your home\, Beth Sholom is offering a “mini series” i
 n shofar blowing so that everyone can learn and hear the shofar.&nbsp\; </p
 ><p>We have enticed two of our congregation’s most experienced <em>baalot t
 ikiot</em> (shofar blowers) to be our teachers for this event!</p><p><em>Th
 is is an appropriate activity for the entire family (we suggest limiting it
  to kids 6 and older).</em></p><p><a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/upc
 oming-events/shofarserieselul-a8b">Check website</a> event for <b>details</
 b>\, <b>registration </b>and <b>shofar matching signups</b>!</p><p>Zoom lin
 k:&nbsp\;<a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86213855222" id="ow3580" __is_o
 wner="true">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86213855222</a></p><p>Meeting ID: 862
  1385 5222</p><p>Call in #: (669) 900 6833&nbsp\;</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200821T180641Z
LOCATION:https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86213855222
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shofar Experience Mini Series (Part 2 | Option 1)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
