  about the ups and downs. Share parenting tips and more with this intimate 
 group of new and expecting parents.<br><p>This group is FREE to CBS members
  and $18/session for non-members.</p><p><strong>Facilitator: </strong><a hr
 ef="mailto:rabbirussell@bethsholomsf.org" id="ow5330" __is_owner="true">Rab
