CREATED:20210202T211254Z
DESCRIPTION:Art journaling is journaling through art\, in a book. It can be
  anything—collage\, stamps\, painting\, sketching\, mark-making\, writing—“
 anything goes” in your art journal.  Join us as we take inspiration from Je
 wish texts and our own life experiences\, and process what we're learning t
 hrough art journaling.&nbsp\;<br><br>We will meet each week for six weeks a
 nd spend some time together learning\, sharing\, and making art together. N
 o art or Jewish learning experience necessary!  We will supply a materials 
 list\, or you can use whatever you have at home.  Our guide\, Debbie Bamber
 ger\, is a women's health nurse practitioner who discovered art journaling 
 in 2016\, and it changed her life.  Join us\, and explore your creativity i
 n this challenging time.<br><br>* Please note\, this event requires advance
  registration and may require some supplies to be purchased in advance.&nbs
 p\;<b><u><br></u></b><br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQL
 Sepkot83ghvyEpT9-6Oz1l2zxIO7VTwh0YJCxtgRykII9Nnlw/viewform?gxids=7628"><b>C
 lick Here to Register</b></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210202T211313Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Art Journaling for Your Jewish Soul
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
