CREATED:20210622T192538Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><p>A Speaker Series of Dynamic and Diverse Leaders in the J
 ewish World - come learn with incredible people as a part of Beth Sholom's 
 commitment to Organizational Change around Anti-Racism\, Diversity\, Equity
  and Inclusion. Let's live our foundational Jewish values and be the commun
 ity that represents all of our people! <strong>These events are virtual\, f
 ree\, and open to all!</strong></p><p><strong>Marcella White Campbell </str
 ong>is the Executive Director of Be’chol\, an organization that has advocat
 ed for the diversity of the Jewish people for more than 20 years. Before jo
 ining Be’chol Lashon\, Marcella was a branding and storytelling consultant\
 , guiding clients towards developing clear\, innovative\, and culturally se
 nsitive content and media.</p><p><b><a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/u
 pcoming-events/2021/6/27/dei-speaker-series-with-marcella-white-campbell">V
 isit the event on our website for more information and to register via Zoom
 .&nbsp\;</a></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210622T193158Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Include Speaker Series: with Marcella White Campbell
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
