CREATED:20190709T225326Z
DESCRIPTION:Kabbalat Shabbat Service\nSING on the second Friday of each mon
 th\n\n\nSING with us\, every second Friday of each month!\n\nHow can we tak
 e the routine liturgy that we know so well and make it new time and time ag
 ain? One way: by singing out loud!\nJoin Rabbi Amanda Russell and Jonathan 
 Bayer for a musical Shabbat experience\, which will combine old and new tun
 es from different places around the world. We will use the music as a vehic
 le to prayer\, grounding us where we feel comfortable and allowing us to de
 epen our prayer with melodies more unfamiliar to us.\n\nJonathan Bayer of S
 an Francisco is a singer\, instrumentalist and Jewish educator. You may kno
 w him as the Music Specialist at CBS and he is an asset to our musical team
 . His contributions in the Preschool\, Shabbat School program and other Sha
 bbat services are unmatched and he looks forward to another year with the C
 BS team and exploring new ways to pray and make music together.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200717T002516Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SING - Kabbalat Shabbat Services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
