DESCRIPTION:Sukkot is the festival of booths. We build a temporary shelter 
 and fill it with the plentitude of life – family\, friends and fun! On Frid
 ay\, September 24\, we will host JOIN\, a family friendly Sukkot evening of
  Ushpizin & Kabbalat Shabbat. It is a Sukkot tradition to welcome Ushpizin\
 , Aramaic for "Guests"\, into your Sukkah. These guests can be ancient\, mo
 dern or from anywhere or anytime in between. Join Rabbi Russell\, Jonathan 
 Bayer\, Adam Lowy\, Katherine Barboni and Dale Kleisley as we welcome the m
 ystery guests and celebrate the joy with music\, blessings\, Sukkah decorat
 ing and pizza-to-go! \n\nPlease RSVP below to help us know who to expect an
 d how best to prepare for our time together. We look forward to celebrating
  with you at CBS as a community in our Sukkah!\n\n\nWhen: Friday\, Septembe
 r 24\, 2021\nTime: 5:00 - 6:30 p.m. ~ service at 6:00 p.m.\nWhere: CBS Sukk
 ah - Eva Gunther Plaza\nRSVP HERE
LAST-MODIFIED:20210920T050707Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:JOIN: Sukkot Evening of Ushpizin & Kabbalat Shabbat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
