 ir names here</a>.)<br>7:00 pm (PT) —Memorial Ceremony and Program<br><b><a
  href="https://yhs2021.eventbrite.com/?aff=BethSholom">Register for the Yom
  HaShoah Days of Commemoration</a></b><br><br>For more information visit th
