DESCRIPTION:<h1><a href="http://goog_28157036">Shofar Experience Mini Serie
 s </a></h1><h1><a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/upcoming-events/shofar
 serieselul-a8b" id="ow2765" __is_owner="true">with Beth Sholom Ba'alot Tiki
 ot</a></h1><p>On the first day of the seventh month (<em>Tishrei</em>) “you
  shall observe complete rest\, a sacred occasion commemorated with loud bla
 sts.”&nbsp\;(<a href="https://www.sefaria.org/Leviticus.23.24?lang=he-en&ut
 m_source=myjewishlearning.com&utm_medium=sefaria_linker">Leviticus 23:24</a
 >)</p><p>These High Holy Days will be different from any other most of us h
 ave ever experienced.&nbsp\;One of the primary <em>mitzvot</em> of the holy
  days is to hear the sound of the shofar.&nbsp\;Since we will not be able t
 o gather this year\, this could be difficult. In an effort to bring Judaism
  to your home\, Beth Sholom is offering a “mini series” in shofar blowing s
 o that everyone can learn and hear the shofar.&nbsp\; </p><p>We have entice
 d two of our congregation’s most experienced <em>baalot tikiot</em> (shofar
  blowers) to be our teachers for this event!</p><p><em>This is an appropria
 te activity for the entire family (we suggest limiting it to kids 6 and old
 er).</em></p><p><a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/upcoming-events/shofa
 rserieselul-a8b">Check website</a> event for <b>details</b>\, <b>registrati
 on </b>and <b>shofar matching signups</b>!</p><p>Join on Zoom:&nbsp\;<a hre
 f="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/83431753002">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/8343175
 3002</a>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><p>(This Zoom link is the same as today's Sunday 
 Morning Minyan zoom link.)&nbsp\;</p><p>Meeting ID: 834 3175 3002&nbsp\;</p
 ><p>&nbsp\;Call in: (669) 900 6833&nbsp\;<br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200821T220121Z
LOCATION:https://us02web.zoom.us/j/83431753002
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shofar Experience Mini Series (Part 1)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
