DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><b><i>Shir shel</i> Beth Sholom\, </b>Music T
 hrough the Ages: A conversation about Beth Sholom's history of musical trad
 ition and innovation. Led by Rabbi Amanda Russell and featuring special gue
 sts Cantors Brian\, Linda\, and Barry Reich (the children of Cantor Israel 
 Reich\, z"l) and Cantor Adi Wyner.&nbsp\;<br><br>Our guests will share thei
 r favorite memories\, melodies\, and musical influences\, and Rabbi Russell
  will facilitate a discussion of how cantorial approaches\, preferences\, a
 nd expectations have changed over time and ultimately influenced our commun
 ity into being the "singing community" that we are today!<br><br><a href="h
 ttps://us02web.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZEsd-GorzMjGNO0QV8ZkoNChB-z71R07Gy
 P"><u><b>Register here</b></u></a>!<br><br><b><u><a href="https://docs.goog
 le.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeGLk4M3MERKPDdk_k1FPXIF5so7AiCXi0R4Ev5mUH3s1OJdQ/v
 iewform" id="ow547" __is_owner="true">Share a musical memory from your time
  at Beth Sholom</a></u></b>.&nbsp\;<br><p>Virtual event -- April 28\, 2022\
 , from 7-8:15 p.m.</p><u></u></html-blob>
