DESCRIPTION:<p>Beth Sholom is proud to be a partner of Scholar Stream so th
 at we can offer our members this learning for free. Congregants must sign u
 p individually for the sessions and can use the Discount Code specific to o
 ur congregation.<br></p>Series #6: Living our Values: Social Justice and So
 cial Action<br><p>Wednesdays\, 5 p.m.<br></p><p>March 8\, 15\, 22\, 29</p><
