DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">Sacred Drumming as a Gate into the G!dzone (<i>Dve
 ikut</i>) with Rabbi Tsvi Bar-David.</p><p dir="ltr">The path I love the mo
 st is the path of music: rhythm\, <i>niggun </i>- wordless melody\, and sim
 ple repetitive words. Your body and spirit are the instrument! Let's learn 
 how to play it together.&nbsp\;</p><p dir="ltr">In these <b>4 sessions</b>\
 , we focus on the intersection of Jewish and Middle Eastern rhythm\, includ
 ing: Maqsoum\, Sufi Maqsoum\, Baladi and Chiftetelli. There are no prerequi
 sites for this class. The goal for you is deeper participation in spiritual
  events and services.</p><p dir="ltr"><b><br></b></p><p dir="ltr"><b>WHEN</
 b>: August 24\, 31 &amp\; September 7\, 14</p><p dir="ltr">7:30 p.m. - 8:30
  p.m.</p><p dir="ltr"><b>WHERE</b>: Zoom <i>(</i><a href="mailto:tsvi.barda
 vid@gmail.com"><i><u>Email Reb Tsvi</u></i></a><i> </i><a href="mailto:tsvi
 .bardavid@gmail.com"><i><u>tsvi.bardavid@gmail.com</u></i></a><i> to regist
 er/pay and receive Zoom link)</i></p><p dir="ltr"><i>Money is no barrier to
  enter this class!</i></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220810T190225Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sacred Drumming Class on Zoom
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
