DESCRIPTION:<p>We are thrilled to announce the launch of <i><b>Jews for Hot
  Cocoa</b></i>!&nbsp\; A new Beth Sholom Teen initiative that will engage\,
  challenge\, provoke and nurture your child as they continue to grow into t
 heir Jewish selves.</p><p>Your post-b'nai mitzvah teen will have the opport
 unity to co-construct their Jewish identity with the support and guidance o
 f Rabbi Dan Ain\, Rabbi Amanda Russell and Lifelong Learning Moreh Derech\,
  Adam Lowy.&nbsp\; Rabbi Ain will step into the ring with your teens as the
 y grapple with G-d and identity.&nbsp\; Rabbi Russell will offer hot topics
  that are found at the cross-section of individuality\, community\, gender\
 , sexuality\, expression and Judaism.&nbsp\; Adam will create space for the
  group to learn\, talk\, walk and take responsibility for our commandments 
 to do <i>tzedakah</i> and be a force of good in the world\, contributing to
  <i>tikkun olam</i>.</p><p>This program will meet virtually\, two Thursdays
  a month\, from 7 - 8:30 pm\, beginning November 5th.</p><p>Please Click <a
  href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScc2fswSMAZ4R6_zporyOYTzDss
 y3dWiDZG5OhcmOt-ivsBPQ/viewform">Here</a> to Enroll.&nbsp\;</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201022T031936Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jews for Hot Cocoa!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
