 ructures of consciousness from a Jewish perspective uses meditation and cha
 nt as well as cognitive teaching\, learning and dialogue.</p><p>Class begin
 s after the weekly Shabbat morning services and Kiddush at Beth Sholom.</p>
 <br>Each week will feature a specific topic\; some topics will span two wee
 ks. We hope you’ll join us every week\, but it’s not required.<br><b><br></
