CREATED:20210622T193103Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><p>A Speaker Series of Dynamic and Diverse Leaders in the J
 ewish World - come learn with incredible people as a part of Beth Sholom's 
 commitment to Organizational Change around Anti-Racism\, Diversity\, Equity
  and Inclusion. Let's live our foundational Jewish values and be the commun
 ity that represents all of our people!</p><p><strong>These events are virtu
 al\, free\, and open to all!</strong></p><p><strong>Rabbi Juan Mejía </stro
 ng>was born in Bogotá\, Colombia. Raised a Catholic\, he converted to Judai
 sm after discovering the powerful beauty and message of Judaism. He holds a
  degree in philosophy from Universidad Nacional de Colombia\, and a Masters
  degree in Jewish Civilization from the Hebrew University of Jerusalem.&nbs
 p\;</p><p><b><a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/upcoming-events/2021/6/2
 7/dei-speaker-series-with-rabbi-juan-mejia">Visit the event on our website 
 for more information and to register via Zoom.</a></b></p>
