DESCRIPTION:Come and be a part of a fun\, festive\, casual\, family-friendl
 y JOIN Kabbalat Shabbat and Friday BYODinner Picnic in Mountain Lake Park. 
 The Youth Education team of Adam Lowy\, Katherine Barboni and Dale Kleisley
  will bring the games\, as well as\, provide the ritual candles\, grape jui
 ce and challah. <br><p><a href="https://hummusbodega.com/" id="ow2974" __is
 _owner="true"><strong>Place your order for a delicious Shabbat dinner from 
 Hummus Bodega here</strong></a><strong>.</strong> Your order will be delive
 red to Mountain Lake Park!&nbsp\; <strong>Orders must be placed by Thursday
 \, July 22 \, at 8 p.m.</strong>&nbsp\; </p><p>When ordering your meal from
  the Hummus Bodega website\, click on Store Pick-Up\, place your order and 
 in the notes\, please write <strong>“Deliver to the Beth Sholom Picnic”</st
 rong> - this will ensure that your meal arrives in time and to the right pl
 ace.&nbsp\;If you have any questions about the ordering process\, please em
 ail Dale Kleisley at <a href="mailto:dkleisley@bethsholomsf.org">dkleisley@
 bethsholomsf.org</a>.</p><p>Please click the button below to RSVP to help u
 s know who to expect and how best to prepare for our time together\, thanks
 ! We look forward to seeing you in the park!</p><p><a href="https://docs.go
 ogle.com/forms/d/1FJbkgwJYvwAtpLsJJAuPCvBGsAIQVFylp-wSv-_ZsoI/edit" id="ow2
 978" __is_owner="true">Register HERE</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210720T182300Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:JOIN Kabbalat Shabbat Picnic in the Park
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
