UID:67r7ak5gquh604vld5sr436r7d@google.com
CREATED:20200820T223207Z
DESCRIPTION:<h1><span>Shofar Experience Mini Series&nbsp\;</span>with Beth 
 Sholom Ba'alot Tikiot</h1><br><b><i>(Please note: This series began on Sund
 ay\, August 23. Attending Part 1 is not required to attend Part 2)</i></b><
 p>On the first day of the seventh month (<em>Tishrei</em>) “you shall obser
 ve complete rest\, a sacred occasion commemorated with loud blasts.”&nbsp\;
 (<a href="https://www.sefaria.org/Leviticus.23.24?lang=he-en&utm_source=myj
 ewishlearning.com&utm_medium=sefaria_linker">Leviticus 23:24</a>)</p><p>The
 se High Holy Days will be different from any other most of us have ever exp
 erienced.&nbsp\;One of the primary <em>mitzvot</em> of the holy days is to 
 hear the sound of the shofar.&nbsp\;Since we will not be able to gather thi
 s year\, this could be difficult. In an effort to bring Judaism to your hom
 e\, Beth Sholom is offering a “mini series” in shofar blowing so that every
 one can learn and hear the shofar.&nbsp\; </p><p>We have enticed two of our
  congregation’s most experienced <em>baalot tikiot</em> (shofar blowers) to
  be our teachers for this event!</p><p><em>This is an appropriate activity 
 for the entire family (we suggest limiting it to kids 6 and older).</em></p
 ><p><a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/upcoming-events/shofarserieselul-
 a8b">Check website</a> event for <b>details</b>\, <b>registration </b>and <
 b>shofar matching signups</b>!</p><p>Join on Zoom:&nbsp\;<a href="https://u
 s02web.zoom.us/j/86213855222">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86213855222</a></p>
 <p>Meeting ID: 862 1385 5222</p><p>Call in #: (669) 900 6833</p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200825T232728Z
LOCATION:https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86213855222
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shofar Experience Mini Series (Part 2 | Option 1)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
