DESCRIPTION:<p><b>Jews for Hot Cocoa!&nbsp\; </b>A new Beth Sholom Teen ini
 tiative that will engage\, challenge\, provoke and nurture your child as th
 ey continue to grow into their Jewish selves.</p><p>Your post-b'nai mitzvah
  teen will have the opportunity to co-construct their Jewish identity with 
 the support and guidance of Rabbi Dan Ain\, Rabbi Amanda Russell and Lifelo
 ng Learning Moreh Derech\, Adam Lowy.&nbsp\; Rabbi Ain will step into the r
 ing with your teens as they grapple with G-d and identity.&nbsp\; Rabbi Rus
 sell will offer hot topics that are found at the cross-section of individua
 lity\, community\, gender\, sexuality\, expression and Judaism.&nbsp\; Adam
  will create space for the group to learn\, talk\, walk and take responsibi
 lity for our commandments to do <i>tzedakah</i> and be a force of good in t
 he world\, contributing to <i>tikkun olam</i>.</p><p>This program meets vir
 tually\, two Thursdays a month\, from 7 - 8:30 pm.</p><p>Please Click <a hr
 ef="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScc2fswSMAZ4R6_zporyOYTzDssy3d
 WiDZG5OhcmOt-ivsBPQ/viewform">Here</a> to Enroll.&nbsp\;</p>
