DTEND:20220110T014500Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:745r3cdllcdg9m869m08j7vs9u@google.com
CREATED:20211105T160336Z
DESCRIPTION:Rabbi Dorothy Richman and Zoketsu Norman Fischer will lead us a
 s we remember and celebrate Rabbi Alan Lew\, z'l\, Beth Sholom's Rabbi from
  1991-2005. We will touch on all aspects of his profoundly influential Rabb
 inate\, including his meditations\, sermons\, pastoral care\, social action
 \, Torah study\, and prayer. We will be asking for your memories\, as well\
 , so please think through (or even write out) stories you'd like to share. 
 We will conclude with El Malei\, the Jewish prayer for the soul. Special gu
 ests including Sherril Jaffe (Rabbi Lew's widow) will also share their thou
