DESCRIPTION:Beth Sholom Professional Networking Group Meeting\n\nGet a Head
  Start in the New Year: Meet with The Beth Sholom Professional Network.\n\n
 \nThe Beth Sholom Professional Network is dedicated to supporting the profe
 ssional and business lives of all of our congregants. Come meet new people\
 , make connections\, and discover more about the talented and fascinating f
 ellow congregants you've been davening next to at shul!  \n\n\nPlease be pr
 epared to give a thirty second pitch about your work or the position which 
 you are seeking. (Schmoozing and noshing will be encouraged too.)\n\n\nAll 
 are welcome to attend the evening minyan at 6 p.m.\, in the Gronowski Famil
 y Chapel before the meeting.\n\n\nIf you have not already joined the Beth S
 holom LinkedIn Business and Professional Group\, please consider doing so\;
  we now have over 60 participating members. The group is a convenient way t
 o make referrals\, recommendations\, and introductions\, and will greatly e
 xpand your professional and business connections. Please visit www.linkedin
 .com and search under groups for "Beth Sholom SF Business and Professional"
 . \n\n\nFor further information\, contact Lisa Berkelhammer: lisabwellness@
 gmail.com and Rebekah Jackson Sapirstein: rebekah@lawrjs.com.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T075442Z
LOCATION:301 14th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA\, Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beth Sholom Professional Networking Group
TRANSP:OPAQUE
