DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>Rosh Hashanah Day 1</html-blob><br><html-blob><br>Jo
 in Rabbi Richman at the start of the day to “go deep” and connect with pray
 er\, with yourself\, with community\, and the Divine. Leave your shoes outs
 ide the door\, disconnect from your phone\, and sit on floor cushions or ch
 airs\, enjoying the serenity of Makom Sholom and the Meditation Garden. Tog
 ether\, we will prepare to hear the rallying voice of the shofar and the <i
 >kol demama daka</i> (still\, small voice inside). &nbsp\;</html-blob><br><
 br><html-blob><b>WHERE</b>: Makom Sholom / Meditation Garden</html-blob>
