DESCRIPTION:<p>Ki Teitze ... Lo tishkach</p><p>When you go out ... don't fo
 rget!</p><p>That's first and last words of this week's Torah Portion and a 
 perfect Tuesday Morning Inspiration all about.... TAKING TRIPS!</p><p>And w
 hile anyone with reasonable&nbsp\;internet access and 30 minutes to spare c
 an take a virtual trip to a museum\, or Buckingham Palace or the Great Wall
  of China\, only TMI can take you\, virtually\, to famous destinations in t
 he Tanach. Sing a song about swimming on the&nbsp\;ancient sea of Galilee! 
 Explore the caves of Ein Gedi with King David as he runs from his mercurial
  father-in-law!&nbsp\; Hide and go seek with Anne and Olivia\, a brand new 
 Spot-it\, a travellers edition of Dale's Chassidic Tales and more. Tuesday 
 at 10\, lo Tishkach\, don't forget!</p><p>Join Dale Kleisley\, Katherine Ba
 rboni\, and Jonathan Bayer every Tuesday at 10 a.m. for a fragrant potpourr
 i of songs\, stories\, games and activities for children and families\, all
  inspired by our journey through the Jewish year.&nbsp\;<br></p>Note: This 
 event will have a password!&nbsp\;<a href="https://zoom.us/j/96226947925">Z
 oom Link (click here)</a><br>Meeting ID: 962 2694 7925<br>RSVP to <a href="
 mailto:preschool@bethsholomsf.org">preschool@bethsholomsf.org</a> for the e
 vent password.<br><br>Listen to the T.M.I. theme song by Jonathan Bayer!<br
 ><a href="https://mixcord.co/acapella/p/vN_STNozcUCB-3Z4hi_wXQ/">https://mi
 xcord.co/acapella/p/vN_STNozcUCB-3Z4hi_wXQ/</a>
