 cal holiday? Pagan? Nationalistic? Spiritual? Commercial? Yes! And so much 
 more today on<b> Eva Gunther Plaza</b>.&nbsp\;<br><br>We will look at Hanuk
 kah through ancient texts to contemporary videos to find resonant ways to c
 onnect to Hanukkah this year. Prepare yourself\, body\, mind and spirit for
  the Festival of Lights and Darkness with our Beth Sholom learning communit
 y.<u></u><br><u></u><br><b>WHEN: </b>After Shabbat morning services Saturda
 y\, December 10&nbsp\;<b>and&nbsp\;</b>Thursday\, December 15 (via <b><a hr
 ef="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/3276833779"><u><u>Zoom</u></u></a></b>&nbsp\;
 )<br><br><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
