DESCRIPTION:Join us for any and all of our four Yom Kippur prayer experienc
 es\, specifically designed for listening at home. To view these prayer expe
 riences\, visit the Congregation Beth Sholom <a href="https://www.bethsholo
 msf.org/highholydays">website</a>.<br><ul><li><b>Traditional Morning Abbrev
 iated Service</b> with <b>Rabbi Ain and Rabbi Russe</b>l\, premiering on Yo
 uTube at 10:15 a.m.&nbsp\;</li><li><b>Meditation\, Singing and Reflection w
 ith Rabbi Dorothy Richman and Rabbi Amanda Russell</b>. There’s no better t
 ime to create a space of deep listening in your life\, a place you can be e
 ntirely present\, than the High Holy Days. And even though it’s a personal 
 journey\, you don’t have to do it alone.&nbsp\;</li><li><b>Family Services<
 /b>. Join our family engagement and education team of Adam Lowy\, Katherine
  Barboni\, Dale Kleisley\, and Jonathan Bayer for exciting\, engaging and i
 nspirational family VIDEO experiences. There will be two options\, for fami
 lies with children age birth - 5\, and for families with children ages 6 -1
 2.&nbsp\;</li><li><b>Traditional Morning Service. </b>This full service\, a
 udio recording will be lead by Rabbi Ain\, Rabbi Russell\, and CBS leaders.
 &nbsp\;</li></ul><p>For all Traditional services\, we will use the Conserva
 tive machzor (Lev Shalem)\, which provides both English translation and tra
 nsliteration for the Hebrew prayers\, as well as a compendium of additional
  sources.&nbsp\;</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200922T212038Z
LOCATION:https://www.bethsholomsf.org/highholydays
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yom Kippur Video Premieres 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
