UID:4srcj3cgrncv17ccgcgo1iu10c@google.com
CREATED:20201028T043942Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>We are thrilled to announce the launch of <i><b>Jews for Hot
  Cocoa</b></i>!  A new Beth Sholom Teen initiative that will engage\, chall
 enge\, provoke and nurture your child as they continue to grow into their J
 ewish selves.</p><p>Your post-b&#39\;nai mitzvah teen will have the opportu
 nity to co-construct their Jewish identity with the support and guidance of
  Rabbi Dan Ain\, Rabbi Amanda Russell and Lifelong Learning Moreh Derech\, 
 Adam Lowy.  Rabbi Ain will step into the ring with your teens as they grapp
 le with G-d and identity.  Rabbi Russell will offer hot topics that are fou
 nd at the cross-section of individuality\, community\, gender\, sexuality\,
  expression and Judaism.  Adam will create space for the group to learn\, t
 alk\, walk and take responsibility for our commandments to do <i>tzedakah</
 i> and be a force of good in the world\, contributing to <i>tikkun olam</i>
 .</p><p>This program will meet virtually\, two Thursdays a month\, from 7 -
  8:30 pm\, beginning November 5th.</p><p>Please Click <a href="https://docs
 .google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScc2fswSMAZ4R6_zporyOYTzDssy3dWiDZG5OhcmOt-ivs
 BPQ/viewform" target="_blank">Here</a> to Enroll. </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201028T043942Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jews for Hot Cocoa!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
