DESCRIPTION:Join us for any and all of our five Rosh Hashanah prayer experi
 ences specifically designed for listening at home. To view these prayer exp
 eriences\, visit our <a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/highholydays" id
 ="ow4397" __is_owner="true">High Holy Days website page</a>.&nbsp\;<br><ul>
 <li><b>Traditional Morning Abbreviated Service</b> with <b>Rabbi Ain and Ra
 bbi Russe</b>l\, premiering on YouTube at 10:00 a.m.&nbsp\;</li><li><b>Medi
 tation\, Singing and Reflection with Rabbi Dorothy Richman and Rabbi Amanda
  Russell</b>. There’s no better time to create a space of deep listening in
  your life\, a place you can be entirely present\, than the High Holy Days.
  And even though it’s a personal journey\, you don’t have to do it alone.</
 li><li><b>"Soul Music" with Jeremiah Lockwood. </b>For those who want to ex
 perience the prayers and melodies of the High Holy Days through intense spi
 ritual music that is both rooted in Jewish tradition and decidedly nontradi
 tional.&nbsp\;</li><li><b>Family Services</b>. Join our family engagement a
 nd education team of Adam Lowy\, Katherine Barboni\, Dale Kleisley\, and Jo
 nathan Bayer for exciting\, engaging and inspirational family VIDEO experie
 nces. There will be two options\, for families with children age birth - 5\
 , and ages 6 -12.&nbsp\;</li><li><b>Full Traditional Morning Audio Service.
  </b>This full service\, AUDIO recording will be lead by Rabbi Ain\, Rabbi 
 Russell\, and CBS leaders.&nbsp\;</li></ul><p>For all Traditional services\
 , we will use the Conservative machzor (Lev Shalem)\, which provides both E
 nglish translation and transliteration for the Hebrew prayers\, as well as 
 a compendium of additional sources.&nbsp\;</p>&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20200917T042627Z
LOCATION:https://www.bethsholomsf.org/highholydays
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rosh Hashanah Day 1 Video Premieres
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
