CREATED:20210304T173239Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>A Passover concert presented by the Congregation Beth Sholom
  Community<br></p><p>Coming after a year of limitations and loss\, the fest
 ival of Freedom approaches bearing promises and blessings we deeply need. T
 his virtual concert event\, featuring artists in diverse genres and separat
 ed across the geography of the United States\, will help us access the deep
 ly desired and always fleeting feeling of freedom through song and sound.&n
 bsp\;</p><p>Featuring Brooklyn-based composer and vocalist Fay Victor\, New
  Mexico-based (but Brooklyn-born) singer and songwriter Hieronymus Bogs\, a
 nd musician\, scholar and Beth Sholom High Holiday music director Jeremiah 
