 motor equipment\, read stories and engage in a musical Tot Shabbat experien
 ce while you attend services in the Main Sanctuary. <br><br>Participating c
 hildren will be required to remain socially distanced from other children a
 t all times and wear a double layer mask. If your child is unable to remain
  socially distanced or wear a mask then we request that your child remain w
 ith you during services. At this time\, we are unable to care for children 
 under the age of two. <br><br>Your child will be provided with snacks and c
 hallah that they can enjoy outside in the Zweifach Meditation Garden.<br><b
 r>The Shabbat Children's Program is free to CBS members\, and available for
  $18 per child to the community.<br><br>We look forward to spending Shabbat
  with your family! Advanced Registration Required. Please register below.<b
