  together in sisterhood to discuss the ways we imagine expansiveness during
  a pandemic.&nbsp\;</p><p>What can we leave behind and what can we embrace 
 - in this particular moment - during this celebration from exile to freedom
 ? Led by our Rebbetzin\, Alana Ain.</p><p>Space is limited! Please RSVP to:
  <b><u><a href="mailto:alana@bethsholomsf.org">alana@bethsholomsf.org</a></
 u></b></p>
