UID:3qnql95rs3ornvana0k9tflnug@google.com
CREATED:20220825T182244Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><p>On Simchat Tor
 ah we complete the annual reading of the Torah and begin again. Celebrate t
 he joy of the holiday with singing and dancing with our holy Torah scrolls.
 &nbsp\;</p><p>Featuring SHAMATi Trio featuring Isaac Zones (whose band you 
 may remember from our Centennial Gala).&nbsp\;We also extend a warm welcome
  to our friends at Congregation Kol Shofar\, who will be joining in our cel
 ebrations this year.</p><p>All are welcome. If you like to dance\, eat and 
 sing - you can expect a great time!</p><p><b style="background-color: var(-
 -textfield-surface)\; color: var(--on-surface)\;">5:30 p.m.</b><span style=
 "background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\; color: var(--on-surface)\;"> 
 - Dinner</span><br></p><p><b>6:30 p.m.</b> - Dancing and <i>Hakafot</i></p>
 <p><b>8:00 p.m</b>. - Tisch - <i>L’chayim</i> and sing the night away (21+)
 <br><br></p><p><b style="color: var(--on-surface)\; background-color: var(-
