DESCRIPTION:Please join us to celebrate CBS Preschool Teacher Vered Levinso
 n and the joy she's brought to 17 classes of Beth Sholom preschoolers!&nbsp
 \;We'd love to see you and hear your stories of Beth Sholom preschool life\
 , whether it's from this past year\, 2018\, or way back in 2005!&nbsp\;<br>
 <br>A delicious buffet dinner will be prepared by our very own Chef Marlene
 .&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.evite.com/event/01ECKVFUIUIJKY2LGEPNAIARPOU7DI
