UID:1qlq9quf174ve681d3l21gjaj1@google.com
CREATED:20210622T192715Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><p>A Speaker Series of Dynamic and Diverse Leaders in the J
 ewish World - come learn with incredible people as a part of Beth Sholom's 
 commitment to Organizational Change around Anti-Racism\, Diversity\, Equity
  and Inclusion. Let's live our foundational Jewish values and be the commun
 ity that represents all of our people!</p><p><strong>These events are virtu
 al\, free\, and open to all!</strong></p><p><strong>Rabbi Jacqueline Mates-
 Muchin</strong> is the Senior Rabbi of Temple Sinai in Oakland\, CA. Rabbi 
 Mates-Muchin focuses her efforts in serving her community through worship\,
  pastoral care\, social justice work\, and encouraging the recognition of t
 he vast diversity within the Jewish community.</p><p><b><a href="https://ww
