DESCRIPTION:A special 5th Friday Kabbalat Shabbat this month!\nRabbi Russel
 l will be joined by her friend and colleague\, Rabbi Rebecca Schatz (anothe
 r singing Rabbi!) to lead a musical Kabbalat Shabbat full of joy and song.\
 n\nMasks must be worn at all times and physical distancing must be maintain
 ed.\nRabbi Rebecca Schatz is the Assistant Rabbi at Temple Beth Am in Los A
 ngeles. Formerly the Assistant Rabbi and Education Director in Foster City\
 , CA. She studied with Rabbi Russell at the Ziegler School of Rabbinic Stud
 ies and prior to smikha received a Masters in Experiential Education and a 
 Bachelors in Choral Music Education. \n\nVisit our website's event page for
  more details and registration.
