 /b> will bring the <i>ruach</i><i>&nbsp\;</i>as we join together for one of
  our cherished weekly rituals! Food will not be served\, please arrive with
  full bellies.&nbsp\;</p><p>Please click the button below to <b>RSVP </b>to
