RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20200228T173000
CREATED:20191011T171317Z
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever skipped out on Shabbat services because you feare
 d your kids would be disruptive?&nbsp\;<br><br>Have you ever looked around 
 and wished there were more families during times of prayer?&nbsp\;<br><br>T
 his is the service for you!<br><br>The youth and our families are the futur
 e! Please join us for what will be an inter-generational Shabbat service. A
  space where children can be themselves\, where parents can pray alongside 
 their children and congregants of all ages can feel at home.<br><br>Rabbi A
 manda Russell joined our team full-time in July after serving as the Rabbin
 ic Intern for four years. She has a young family and truly appreciates the 
 structure of a “traditional” Shabbat service. She is excited to explore the
  merging of these two Jewish values\, family and prayer\, into a service th
 at will be inviting for all! Rabbi Russell will be joined by some of our mo
 st loved CBS staff and musicians.<br><br>Our musicians will use instruments
  through Kabbalat Shabbat and we will pray from a family-friendly&nbsp\;<em
 >siddurim&nbsp\;</em>(prayer books).&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br>Dinner will be se
 rved in advance of each service. This event is free to the community but pl
 ease register in advance to help us prepare the appropriate amount of food.
 <br><br>L’dor Vador...please JOIN us!<br><br><b>DATE: </b>Fourth&nbsp\;Frid
 ay of every month<br><b>TIME:</b> 5:30pm dinner (KG)\, 6:00pm service (SANC
 )<br><b>LOCATIONS: </b>Koret Hall &amp\; Sanctuary<br><b><a href="https://d
 ocs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc3eEFVsm3YImznf7n4kypqX4y_mIQe0kR1bBmv6p2N
 wU3cLQ/viewform" id="ow527" __is_owner="true">REGISTER HERE</a></b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200717T002835Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall and Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:JOIN Kabbalat Shabbat Services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
