 day\, October 2\, 2009\, 7:30 p.m.\nKabbalat Shabbat Service\, 6:30 p.m.\, 
 Gronowski Family Chapel\n\nJoin Congregation Beth Sholom for Kabbalat Shabb
 at service and a community-wide dinner in our Sukkah on Erev Sukkot.\nCost:
  Member: $18 adult\; $8 child ages 3-12\, under 3 free\nNonmember: $20 adul
 t\; $10 child ages 3-12\, under 3 free\n \nR.S.V.P. by September 25 to Debr
 a at 415.221.8736\, ext. 126\, DSPerloff@bethsholomsf.org. \nReserve your s
 paces now—seating is limited!\n
