CREATED:20100901T224713Z
DESCRIPTION:For more information and tickets for First Day Rosh Hashanah Se
 rvice\, Kol Nidre Service\, and Yom Kippur Service please call the office a
 t 415.221.8736\, ext. 111\, or Tickets@bethsholomsf.org.\n\n\n\nThere is no
  ticket needed for the following services: \n\nErev Rosh Hashanah Service\n
 \nSecond Day Rosh Hashanah Service\n\nYizkor Service\n\nMincha and Ne'ila S
 ervice\n\n\n\nWILL-CALL TICKETS \n\nCheck-in for will-call tickets will be 
 at the main entrance. Photo identification is required for pick-up of will-
 call tickets. \n\n\n\nSERVICE DESCRIPTIONS \n\nOur Sanctuary service will p
 reserve the holidays’ classic character with traditional hazzanut. \n\nOur 
 Koret Hall service will be a participatory davening experience interspersed
  with teachings. \n\n\n\nSECURITY \n\nHigh Holidays tickets are required fo
 r admission to services for members\, guests\, and nonmembers. Security gua
 rds and staff will be at the entrances to the building. Staff will have the
  names of all ticket holders and will be there to assist you. \n\n\n\nPUBLI
 C TRANSPORTATION \n\nMuni bus lines servicing the synagogue include the 1\,
  2\, 28\, and 38. Detailed directions for using public transportation from 
 within the Bay Area are available online at tripplanner.transit.511.org. \n
 \n\n\nPARKING \n\nPlease remember that parking in our neighborhood is very 
 limited and those attending services should provide adequate time to find p
 arking. Street cleaning and neighborhood parking restrictions during the Hi
 gh Holidays have been lifted for specific streets. Specific information reg
 arding affected blocks will be sent with High Holiday tickets.\n\n\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T075914Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yom Kippur Service
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
