UID:8hu6du9clk6pb3oob0mqhrc214@google.com
CREATED:20090330T224047Z
DESCRIPTION:The California Street Corridor Traveling Shavuot\nTorah Study f
 rom Shul to Shul\n\n\nIn conjunction with Congregation Sherith Israel\, The
  Taube Center for Jewish Life at the JCCSF\, and The Congregation Emanu-El.
 \n\nJoin us to celebrate Shavuot as you never have before\, tracing steps f
 rom Egypt to the Promised Land. This cross-community event begins with a fa
 mily celebration and dinner at Sherith Israel. We’ll continue the evening w
 ith Torah processions to the JCCSF\, Congregation Emanu-El\, and Congregati
 on Beth Sholom\, stopping at each site for lively and meaningful study sess
 ions with rabbis\, cantors and lay leaders.  Don’t miss the closing revelat
 ion party at Beth Sholom featuring the music of Marsha Attie. The synagogue
  will be open for informal study sessions until dawn and a morning prayer s
 ervice. \n\nCome for one session\, or walk or bus with us for all sessions.
  If you’ve “passed over” celebrating Shavuot in the past\, this is your cha
 nce to experience a beautiful Jewish holiday in the spirit of community. \n
 \nLook for a complete schedule of events in May editions of HaLuach.\nPleas
 e R.S.V.P. for dinner with Oleg Strutsovski at Congregation Sherith Israel:
  415.346.1720\, ext. 28 or school@sherithisrael.org.\n\nDinner registration
  by May 15: $5 per person\, $10 per family\nDinner registration by May 22: 
 $7 per person\, $12 per family \n(maximum family size is two adults\, two c
 hildren)\n\nFor further information\, contact the CBS office: 415.221.8736.
  \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080420Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The California Street Corridor Traveling Shavuot
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
