DESCRIPTION:MAY EVENT\nCOUPLES KEHILLAH LAG B'OMER BONFIRE\nThursday\, May 
 10\, 5:30-9 p.m.\nBeach Chalet\, Ocean Beach\n\nJoin the first Beth Sholom 
 Couples Kehillah for an evening gathering on Lag B'Omer\, Thursday\, May 10
 . We'll meet in front of the Beach Chalet (1000 Great Highway) at 5:30 p.m.
 \, then make our way to Ocean Beach for a sunset bonfire in honor of Lag B'
 Omer.  After we've had our fill of the beach\, the view\, and snacks (pleas
 e bring something to share!)\, we'll return to the Beach Chalet bar to enjo
 y good conversation\, and happy hour drinks.\n\nIf you'd like to join the g
 roup\, but can't make it to the Beach Chalet by 5:30pm\, call Christopher O
 rev Reiger (917) 627-2039\, to find out where the group is located on the b
 each.\n\nLet us know if you plan to attend by sending your email RSVP to cb
 sck1@gmail.com.\n\nGROUP DESCRIPTION:\n•    Chairs: Jamie Artman and Christ
 opher Orev Reiger\n•    A community group which brings together young profe
 ssionals for fun\, social action\, and exploration of their Jewish heritage
 \n•    Couples Kehillah generally meets once a month 
