DESCRIPTION:Kosher Feast of Freedom with Rabbis Micah Hyman and Aaron Philm
 us\n"Everyone must experience Passover as if you were taken out of Egypt." 
 - Haggadah\nCome celebrate the Exodus to freedom with community at Congrega
 tion Beth Sholom.\nWe will recount the Haggadah\, share personal storeis\, 
 and drink four cups of wine to our redemption. All agees are welcome.\n\nCo
 st Members:\nAdults\, $60\; children ages 5-12\, $30\; toddlers ages 2-4\, 
 $18\; no charge for babies\n\nCost Nonmembers:\nAdults\, $65\; children age
 s 5-12\, $35\; toddlers ages 2-4\, $20\; no charge for babies\n\nFor more i
 nformation please contact Beth Jones at BJones@bethsholomsf.org or call 415
 .221.8736\, ext. 105. Online registration and prepayment by Monday\, March 
 26 is required to attend.
