DESCRIPTION:Two Winter Sunday Afternoons with Rabbi Gedaliah Fleer at Congr
 egation Beth Sholom: All congregants are invited to  join Rabbi Gedaliah Fl
 eer\, visiting scholar from Jerusalem\, for his annual winter teaching at C
 ongregation Beth Sholom. Rabbi Fleer will lecture on the following topics:\
 n\nSunday December 26th:  The Mind\, The Seat of the Soul:  A Kabbalistic a
 nd Psychological Perspective \nSunday January 9th:  Eternity and the Singul
 ar Moment:  The Process of Spiritual Discovery\n\nLocation & Time:  The Gro
 nowski Chapel from 12 noon until 4 p.m.\nTuition: Two classes\, $100.00\, o
 ne class\, $60.00. Payable to Rabbi Gedaliah Fleer upon entry. R.S.V.P.: Ap
 preciated but not mandatory. Please contact Lisa Berkelhammer at lisabwelln
 ess@gmail.com.\n\nTo receive an in depth description of the two lecture top
 ics\, or for further information\, please contact Lisa Berkelhammer.\n
