CREATED:20090329T182549Z
DESCRIPTION:The Joy of Jewish Dancing with Bruce Bierman\nWalk-ins $10 per 
 class.\nPreregistration strongly encouraged\, but walk-ins welcome.\n\nWork
 shop participants will learn the basic steps\, patterns\, gestures\, and st
 yles of Yemenite\, Hasidic\, Yiddish\, and Israeli folkdance. Special empha
 sis will be on dancing with "dveykus"-clinging close to the powerful rhythm
 s of the music\, on another's friendship\, and your own unique expression.\
 n\nBruce Bierman is the artistic director of the Jewish Dance Theatre. He i
 s an award-winning actor\, director\, choreographer and playwright with dan
 ce residencies currently throughout the Bay Area.\n\nContact Ariana Barth i
 n the office for more information at 415.221.8736\, ext. 111.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080421Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Joy of Jewish Dancing
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
