 son Singular (2010). \n\nSayed Kashua is an Israeli Arab who is a writer an
 d journalist.  He is Moslem\, but writes in Hebrew.  He is also the author 
 of the Israeli TV series Arab Labor (Avoda Aravit).\n\n
