UID:i5nupop7oefn83hbr1ev79anmg@google.com
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20101013T202757Z
DESCRIPTION:A WIDER BRIDGE PRESENTS: Israeli\, Orthodox and Gay: A panel di
 scussion with men and women leading a growing and historic movement.\n\nOve
 r the past few years\, a growing number of gay\, lesbian\, bisexual and tra
 nsgender individuals have emerged from within Israel’s Orthodox communities
 \, and new organizations have developed to serve their needs. The largest o
 f these organizations – Havruta and Bat Kol – create community\, provide su
 pport groups\, promote greater visibility and understanding about the lives
  of the LGBT Orthodox\, and create welcoming spaces for prayer and celebrat
 ion. This panel discussion will feature leaders of these groups\, who are o
 n a tour of the U.S. with A Wider Bridge. Come hear their stories and learn
  about the successes they have had and the challenges they face as they for
 ge new ground in Israeli society.\n\nCo-sponsored by: The LGBT Alliance of 
 the Jewish Community Federation\, Congregation Beth Sholom\, and Congregati
 on Sha’ar Zahav. For more on the tour\, the panel discussion\, and A Wider 
 Bridge\, please visit: www.awiderbridge.org. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080344Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel/ and Gallery Hallway
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LGBT with Orthodox Israelis
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
