DESCRIPTION:Our 13th Annual “Keshet Shabbat” will take place on Shabbat mor
 ning\, June 26.  This is an important time\, once a year\, for us to acknow
 ledge who we are as out\, proud and active members of this congregation\, t
 o acknowledge the great strides forward for LGBT visibility and inclusion t
 hat have taken place in the Conservative movement over the past 15 years an
 d\, perhaps most importantly\, to acknowledge that there is still work to d
 o.  We are fortunate to have the opportunity to carry this work forward\, f
 ully supported by the Board\, clergy and leadership of Congregation Beth Sh
 olom.\n\nWe will read from Parashat Balak that morning. If you would like t
 o take on one of these readings\, or participate with an aliyah\, or ark op
 ening\, please contact Kenny Altman at kennyaltman@earthlink.net\n\nFor mor
 e information call  the office at 415-221-8736\, ext. 101.
