DESCRIPTION:This month there is a special guest presentation: Career and Bu
 siness Consultant Deborah Gavrin Frangquist will discuss "Looking while Lea
 ping: Making good enough business and career decisions when the future is h
 ard to predict."\n\nAll congregants seeking professional and business devel
 opment and networking opportunities are warmly invited! The evening will in
 clude Q & A with Deborah plus time to pitch\, nosh and schmooze.\n\nThe Net
 work:\nThe Beth Sholom Professional Network is dedicated to supporting the 
 professional and business lives of our congregants. We offer friendly\, inf
 ormal networking opportunities to all interested congregants. The entire sy
 nagogue community is encouraged to actively support us by making referrals 
 and introductions to Beth Sholom professionals and businesses.\n\nThe Linke
 dIn Group:\nThe Beth Sholom SF LinkedIn Business and Professional Group is 
 the primary showcase of Beth Sholom's diverse wealth of talent and expertis
 e. With over 85 active participants\, the LinkedIn Group provides immediate
  visibility and communication within and beyond the community. Any congrega
 nt who wishes to join may do so by going to www.linkedin.com. Search under 
 groups for "Beth Sholom SF Business and Professional."\n\nFor more informat
 ion please contact Lisa Berkelhammer at lisabsf@earthlink.net and Rebekah J
 ackson Sapirstein at rebekah@sapirstein.com.  
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080544Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beth Sholom Professional Network
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
