 ight Live Band (especially bass\, keys\, brass and sax) or if you have othe
 r talents you would like to share.\n\nEvening Programming:\nAdults\n•5 p.m.
 - Singing Mincha service (Camp Ramah style)\n•5:30 p.m.- Torah Study on Son
 g in Jewish Prayer\nK-6th grade\n•5 p.m.- Preparation for Havdallah by grad
 e\nPreschool Families\n•5:30 p.m.- PJ Havdallah\nEveryone\n•6 p.m.- Havdall
 ah\, potluck and Saturday Night Live Talent Show\n
