DESCRIPTION:Do you want to learn cooking secrets from professionally traine
 d kosher chef\, Valerie Philmus? At the same time\, help make delicious foo
 d for our Shabbat morning Kiddush?\n \nJoin us for the first session of Pro
 ject B*shul--a cooking class for people interested in learning cutting skil
 ls\, flavor combinations\, and efficiency in the kitchen. The food will the
 n be served for our Kiddush on Saturday mornings.\n \nDuring each class Rab
 bi Aaron Philmus will dish out a taste of Torah from Hazon's "Min Ha'Aretz"
  curriculum to explore the intersection between contemporary food issues an
 d Jewish ethics.\n \nThursdays\, 7-9 p.m.:\nOctober 27\nNovember 3\nNovembe
 r 10\nNovember 17\n \nJoin us for all four classes\, or just one or two\, b
 ut please r.s.v.p. to Julia Yasser at 415.221.8736\, ext. 101 or JYasser@be
 thsholomsf.org.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080252Z
