DTEND:20091201T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:5kjfl9v7ue4t1n8l46gl00c6ds@google.com
CREATED:20091103T001632Z
DESCRIPTION:Congregation Beth Sholom is co-sponsoring a film with American 
 Jewish World Service (AJWS)  - a special advanced screening of Reporter\, t
 he new documentary featuring Nicholas Kristof\, the two-time Pulitzer Prize
 -winning New York Times columnist.  \n\nReception: 5:30 p.m. \nFilm: 7 p.m.
 \nThe event will also feature a conversation with Ruth Messinger after the 
 film.  \nFree\n\nREPORTER documents Nicholas Kristof's efforts to write abo
 ut the world's most wrenching conflicts\, which he brings alive for readers
  in The New York Times. In the Democratic Republic of Congo\, Kristof seeks
  personal stories of women and children in the midst of the decade-long con
 flict to illuminate the violence\, hardship and injustice that AJWS address
 es through grassroots work.\n\nFor more information contact the JCCSF at 41
 5.292-1200.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T075742Z
LOCATION:JCCSF\, 3200 California Street\, San Francisco\, CA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Reporter: Advanced Film Screening
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
