BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20100519T003000Z
DTEND:20100519T083000Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:qvtl4regqvdrkgfr69sn0oqp24@google.com
CREATED:20100304T001418Z
DESCRIPTION:The 2nd Annual California Street Corridor Travelling Shavuot\nT
 uesday\, May 18\, 2010\, 5:30 p.m.–midnight\n\nPresented in partnership wit
 h the Jewish Community Center of San Francisco\, and Congregations Sherith 
 Israel\, Emanu-El\, and Beth Sholom.\n\nJoin with members of the Jewish Com
 munity Center and Congregations Sherith Israel\, Emanu-El\, and Beth Sholom
  in this all-night mobile learning experience and celebration. A Progressiv
 e Torah Study from Shul to Shul — Walk from location to location in a Shavu
 ot Torah procession\, or join us anywhere along the way!\n\n \nSchedule:\n\
 nSherith Israel\, 2266 California Street — 5: 30–7 p.m.\nVegetarian Family 
 Dinner\, Children’s Art Project\, and Program\n$7 adult\, $12 family by May
  7 ($10 and $15 after May 7)\nR.S.V.P. for dinner to Oleg Strutsovski at 41
 5.346.1720\, ext. 28 or school@sherithisrael.org. Kosher meals available.\n
 \nJCCSF\, 3200 California Street — 7:30–8:30 p.m.\nRabbi Micah Hyman — When
  the Dessert Begins to Bloom: Jung’s Red Book in the Light of Revelation @ 
 Sinai.\nRabbi Julie Saxe-Taller — What If We Hadn’t Been Strangers In Egypt
 ? The Role of Our Story in Shaping Our Viewpoints as Jews.\nRabbi Rosalind 
 Glazer — Faith Lost and Found: Megilat Ruth as Spiritual Biography.\n\nEman
 u-El\, 2 Lake Street — 9–10 p.m.\nRabbi Larry Raphael — Revelation at Sinai
 : What Does It Mean For A Liberal Jew?\nRabbi Ryan Bauer — The True Value o
 f Torah: Elisha ben Abuyah\, The Heretic of the Talmud.\nAdeeb Yousif & Oth
