DESCRIPTION:Exploring the Wisdom of the Talmud with Renowned Scholar Rabbi 
 Daniel Landes\n\nProfessor and Rosh HaYeshiva of Pardes Insitute in Jerusal
 em Rabbi Daniel Landes will lead an exploration into core concepts of Talmu
 dic literature. \n\n1. Selichot\nCongregation Beth Sholom\n8:00 – 10:00 pm 
 – Learning with Rabbi Daniel Landes\n10:00 – 12:00 am - Selichot Service wi
 th Roz Barak and Marcia Attie in Sanctuary\n\nTopic:  The Emergence of Jewi
 sh Time.  After the fall of the 2nd Temple in 70 CE\, the sages of the Talm
 ud establish the sanctity of time over space.  Through the cycle of Shabbat
 \, the new moon and regular holidays\, the Talmud erects a structure by whi
 ch we understand our place in time. September 8\, Congregation Beth Sholom\
 , 8:00 – 10:00 pm.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080558Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Selichot Teaching 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
