  the office at 415.221.8736\, ext. 111\, or Tickets@bethsholomsf.org.\n\n\n
 WILL-CALL TICKETS \nCheck-in for will-call tickets will be at the main entr
 ance. Photo identification is required for pick-up of will-call tickets. \n
 \nSERVICE DESCRIPTIONS \nOur Sanctuary service will preserve the holidays’ 
 classic character with traditional hazzanut. \nOur Koret Hall service will 
 be a participatory davening experience interspersed with teachings. \n\nSEC
 URITY \nHigh Holidays tickets are required for admission to services for me
 mbers\, guests\, and nonmembers. Security guards and staff will be at the e
 ntrances to the building. Staff will have the names of all ticket holders a
 nd will be there to assist you. \n\nPUBLIC TRANSPORTATION \nMuni bus lines 
 servicing the synagogue include the 1\, 2\, 28\, and 38. Detailed direction
 s for using public transportation from within the Bay Area are available on
 line at tripplanner.transit.511.org. \n\nPARKING \nPlease remember that par
 king in our neighborhood is very limited and those attending services shoul
 d provide adequate time to find parking. Street cleaning and neighborhood p
 arking restrictions during the High Holidays have been lifted for specific 
 streets. Specific information regarding affected blocks will be sent with H
 igh Holiday tickets.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080321Z
LOCATION:Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yizkor Service
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
