DESCRIPTION:301 14th Avenue\, Board Room\n\nIntro to Judaism with Rabbi Mic
 ah Hyman \n1st and 3rd Thursdays (except when a holiday)\nThis class will o
 ffer an opportunity to learn about the foundations of the Jewish tradition\
 , including calendar\, life cycle\, history\, philosophy\, liturgy\, theolo
 gy\, and Israel. Most of all\, it will be an opportunity to address your ne
 eds and hopes for a deeper involvement with Judaism and the Jewish people. 
 Through readings\, meetings with the rabbi\, attending services\, and shari
