DESCRIPTION:Get a Head Start in the New Year: Meet with The Beth Sholom Pro
 fessional Network on Tuesday\, September 15\, 6:30-8 p.m.\, Main Meeting Ro
 om\n\nThe Beth Sholom Professional Network is dedicated to supporting the p
 rofessional and business lives of all of our congregants. Come meet new peo
 ple\, make connections\, and discover more about  the talented and fascinat
 ing fellow congregants you've been davening next to at shul!  \n\nPlease be
  prepared to give a thirty second pitch about your work or the position whi
 ch you are seeking. (Schmoozing and noshing will be encouraged too.)\n\nAll
  are welcome to attend the evening minyan at 6 p.m.\, in the Gronowski Fami
 ly Chapel before the meeting.\n\nIf you have not already joined the Beth Sh
 olom LinkedIn Business and Professional Group\, please consider doing so\; 
 we now have over 60 participating members. The group is a convenient way to
  make referrals\, recommendations\, and introductions\, and will greatly ex
 pand your professional and business connections. Please visit www.linkedin.
 com and search under groups for "Beth Sholom SF Business and Professional".
  \n\nFor further information\, contact Lisa Berkelhammer: lisabwellness@gma
 il.com and Rebekah Jackson Sapirstein: rebekah@lawrjs.com.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T075957Z
LOCATION:San Francisco\, CA\, Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beth Sholom Professional Networking Group
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
