DESCRIPTION:MENTAL ILLNESS SUPPORT GROUP\n\nFor people whose lives are affe
 cted by mental illness\, including persons with an illness\,\nfamily member
 s\, and friends\n\n\nWe will gather in a safe and confidential setting to s
 hare our experiences and support each other.\n\n8-Week Series\nThursdays at
  Congregation Beth Sholom\nJanuary 7–February 25\, 2010\n7–9 p.m.\, Makom S
 holom\nCoffee/tea: 6:45 p.m.\, small meeting room\n\nFREE—but pre-registrat
 ion is required.\nTo register\, or for more information\, call 415.221.8736
 \, ext. 101.\n\nSponsored by Nachamu (“Comfort”) Network\,\nthe mental illn
 ess support program of Congregation Beth Sholom\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080029Z
