CREATED:20090807T193050Z
DESCRIPTION:Everything You Always Wanted to Know About Conversion but Were 
 Afraid to Ask\n\nEver wondered who converts? How does it work? What if I wa
 nted to convert\, what would be involved? Join a panel of Jews by Choice as
  they describe their own journeys and answer questions about their experien
 ces.\n\nFacilitated by Rabbi Micah Hyman.\n\nTo R.S.V.P.\, or for more info
 rmation\, contact Jill Pettegrew at 415.221.8736\, ext. 101\, or JPettegrew
 @bethsholomsf.org.\n\nThis class is cosponsored with Lehrhaus Judaica. To f
 ind out more about this and other classes copy this link into your browser:
  http://www.lehrhaus.org/catalog/course.asp?code=P150-CBS-F09.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080051Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Intro to Judaism Panel
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
