DESCRIPTION:This year’s 4th annual Jewish Volunteer Day at Project Homeless
  Connect is rapidly approaching ! Last year\, your enthusiasm and involveme
 nt made a real difference and we hope that you will be able to join us agai
 n in this meaningful and rewarding experience this December.\n\nThe 2010 Je
 wish Volunteer Day is taking place on Wednesday\, December 8th\, starting a
 t 8 AM with an optional reflection and Jewish service learning opportunity.
  Registration for general participation will begin at 8.30AM and the day wi
 ll finish at 4PM. \nTo be part of this great collaborative and moving exper
 ience\, please register online by clicking here or by contacting me at (415
 ) 977 7444 or lbounaud@jcrc.org.  \n\nComplete details at: http://www.beths
 holomsf.org/beth-sholom-news/news-and-events.html.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T075818Z
LOCATION:Bill Graham Civic Auditorium\, 99 Grove St\, San Francisco
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jewish Volunteer Day at Project Homeless Connect
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
