DESCRIPTION:The 3rd Annual California Street Corridor Travelling Shavuot\nT
 uesday\, June 7\, 2011\, 5:30 p.m.–midnight\n\nPresented in partnership wit
 h the Jewish Community Center of San Francisco\, The Swig Program in Jewish
  Studies and Social Justice\, and Congregations Sherith Israel\, Emanu-El\,
  and Beth Sholom.\n\nJoin with members of the Jewish Community Center and C
 ongregations Sherith Israel\, Emanu-El\, and Beth Sholom in this all-night 
 mobile learning experience and celebration. A Progressive Torah Study from 
 Shul to Shul — Walk from location to location in a Shavuot Torah procession
 \, or join us anywhere along the way!\nSchedule:\n\n5:30-7 p.m. Congregatio
 n Sherith Israel\nVegetarian Family Dinner\, Children's Art Project & Progr
 am (see flyer to r.s.v.p.)\n\n7:30-8:30 p.m. JCCSF\n\n9-10 p.m. Congregatio
 n Emanu-El\n\n10\;30-11:30 p.m. Congregation Beth Sholom\nCompleting with a
  Siyum at 11:30 p.m.-midnight\nand a communal Oneg\n\nSee a link from the H
 ome Page to download the flyer with the complete schedule\, and list of spe
 akers. \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T075839Z
LOCATION:Chapel\, Board Room\, Main Meeting Room\, Makom Sholom\, Sanctuary
 \, Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:THOU SHALT LEARN AND TEACH: Traveling Shul Crawl
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
