DESCRIPTION:Club Shabbat is a special program designed to provide children 
 of all ages with a Shabbat related spiritual\, educational and social exper
 ience in the synagogue. Every Saturday morning from 9:30 a.m.-12 noon\, cou
 nselors and childcare providers stand by to care for our congregation's chi
 ldren while parents attend services.  I invite parents to check out the fol
 lowing programs: \n\n•Childcare is provided to families with children ages 
 newborn–7 in Room 27 located on the second floor in the school building. Ki
 t and Erin\, our childcare providers\, will provide interactive Shabbat app
 ropriate activities.\n\n•School-age children will gather in the Youth Loung
 e with Alisa and David\, the Shabbat counselors\, for board games\, discuss
 ions\, sports and social activities\; they will also use the library for re
 ading and prayers.\n\nAll children are invited to join the congregation for
  the concluding Adon Olam prayer at the end of morning services\, followed 
 by Kiddush.\n\nFor more information call Yaffa Tygiel at 415.221.8736\, ext
 . 106.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T075841Z
LOCATION:Rabin Library/ Zweifach Family Meditation Garden
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Club Shabbat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
