DESCRIPTION:\nChildren's Shabbat Programming participants will engage in pu
 ppet shows\, Alef-Bet yoga\, mock Shabbat dinners\, and much more. \nChildr
 en birth to age five are welcome in the Gan Mayim preschool classroom while
  adults attend the Shabbat morning service. \n\nAt 11:15 a.m.\, children wi
 ll be brought to Tot Shabbat in the Gronowski Family Chapel\, and parents a
 re invited to join!\n\nDale Kleisley will facilitate this interactive servi
 ce that allows our youngest community members to experience the joy of Shab
 bat in a warm and welcoming setting. Tot Shabbat concludes at noon in the c
 hapel.
