UID:495tmfl2kbjhhu35mg8t8kbm4s@google.com
CREATED:20101108T210920Z
DESCRIPTION:THOU SHALT BE FREE\n2nd Night Community Pesach Seder\nKosher Fe
 ast of Freedom with Rabbi Micah Hyman and Rabbi Aaron Philmus\n\nAt Congreg
 ation Beth Sholom we provide a Jewish ritual life that is meaningful for ev
 eryone who desires a tradition that speaks to modern life–adults\, children
  and families. This Passover we will offer a Seder that is filled with lear
 ning\, song\, activities for all ages and\, of course\, four cups of wine. 
 For adults\, the Seder will be a philosophical symposium with questions to 
 consider from your personal history. For children and families\, it will be
  a children’s adventure story\, and for those who are so inclined\, it can 
 be both wrapped into one. Please consider Congregation Beth Sholom your sec
 ond home for the second-night Seder this year. It will be an experience you
  will never forget.\n\nMembers: \nAdults\, $50\; children ages 3-12\, $25: 
 children ages 0-2 No charge\nNonmembers: \nAdults\, $60\; children ages 3-1
 2\, $25\; children ages 0-2\, No charge\n\nTo R.S.V.P. or for information\,
  contact Beth Jones at 415.221.8736\, ext. 105\, or seder@bethsholomsf.org.
   \n\nDeadline for reservations is Monday\, April 11.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080044Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:THOU SHALT BE FREE: Community Feast of Freedom
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
