CREATED:20210429T015315Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>As many of you know\, Isak Khodek (z''l)\, beloved elder sta
 tesman of Beth Sholom for many years\, passed away last month. To honor his
  memory\, we will be holding a Sh'loshim Memorial Service in the late after
 noon of Sunday\, May 16. </p><p>We will start with a mincha service - no on
 e was more loyal to our minyanim than Isak! We will also share memories and
  photos of isak from all the years he was with us.<br><br>If you have any p
 hotos of Isak to add to our display\, please email or share to <a href="mai
 lto:communications@bethsholomsf.org"><strong>communications@bethsholomsf.or
 g</strong></a>.<br> <br>If there are any questions about this event\, pleas
 e contact Marilyn Heiss at devraitorah@gmail.com.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080459Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Virtual Shloshim Ceremony for Isak Khodak
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
