DESCRIPTION:Shabbat Parent and ME class on the third Saturday of the month 
 from 10:30 a.m.–12 noon. For children ages walking to three years old. This
  class provides the unique experience for parents and their child attending
  a class together with age appropriate activities for the child\, and a gro
 up discussion for parents. This class is facilitated by Fern Eisenberg the 
 director of our preschool and a child development specialist\, with music a
 nd activities for the parent and child.\n\nPlease contact Fern Eisenberg wi
 th questions at 415.221.8030.\n\nComplimentary babysitting is offered on a 
 first-come first-served basis on Saturdays from 9 a.m.-12 noon\, in the sch
 ool building\, Kitah Bet. Limited spots are available.
