DESCRIPTION:2nd Annual "Jewish Comedy Night" \n\nThe hottest line-up of Jew
 ish comics you’ll see all season long…\nDon’t miss it!\n\nHosted by Kenny A
 ltman\nStarring Ross Turner\nFeaturing house favorite Joe Nguyen\nAlso with
  David Kleinberg\, Jerry Goldstone\, and Sam Davidoff\n\nTickets - $15: Pur
 chase online at http://www.brownpapertickets.com/event/84517 \nPartial proc
 eeds benefit the Congregation Beth Sholom Gesher Building Fund\n\nSuggested
