CREATED:20110926T223628Z
DESCRIPTION:November 12\, 2011 through March 10\, 2012\n5 p.m. - Mincha\n5:
 40 p.m. - Class and Seudah Shlishit (light meal) \n6:30 p.m. - Havdallah\n\
 nClass: What's In a Name? \n\nBring your Hebrew or Yiddish name and the nam
 es of family members. Over the weeks\, we will look at the origins and mean
 ings of all these names using Biblical and other sources. \n\nRabbi Pam Fry
 dman is a scholar and mystic. She serves as Director of the Holocaust Educa
 tion Project for the Academy for Jewish Religion\, California. She was the 
 founding rabbi of Or Shalom Jewish Community in San Francisco and has been 
 affiliated with Congregation Beth Sholom for almost a decade. \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080109Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Mincha
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
