BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20111008T011500Z
DTEND:20111008T031500Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:mb1ckbiptk5jnj34lerte0jvd0@google.com
CREATED:20110628T215635Z
DESCRIPTION:For more information and tickets for First Day Rosh Hashanah Se
 rvice\, Kol Nidre Service\, and Yom Kippur Service please call the office a
 t 415.221.8736\, ext. 111\, or Tickets@bethsholomsf.org.\n\nThere is no tic
 ket needed for the following services: \nErev Rosh Hashanah Service\nSecond
  Day Rosh Hashanah Service\nYizkor Service\nMincha and Ne'ila Service\n\nWI
 LL-CALL TICKETS \nCheck-in for will-call tickets will be at the main entran
 ce. Photo identification is required for pick-up of will-call tickets. \n\n
 SERVICE DESCRIPTIONS \nOur Sanctuary service will preserve the holidays’ cl
 assic character with traditional hazzanut. \nOur Koret Hall service will be
  a participatory davening experience interspersed with teachings. \n\nSECUR
 ITY \nHigh Holidays tickets are required for admission to services for memb
 ers\, guests\, and nonmembers. Security guards and staff will be at the ent
 rances to the building. Staff will have the names of all ticket holders and
  will be there to assist you. \n\nPUBLIC TRANSPORTATION \nMuni bus lines se
 rvicing the synagogue include the 1\, 2\, 28\, and 38. Detailed directions 
 for using public transportation from within the Bay Area are available onli
 ne at tripplanner.transit.511.org. \n\nPARKING \nPlease remember that parki
 ng in our neighborhood is very limited and those attending services should 
 provide adequate time to find parking. Street cleaning and neighborhood par
 king restrictions during the High Holidays have been lifted for specific st
 reets. Specific information regarding affected blocks will be sent with Hig
 h Holiday tickets.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T075955Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kol Nidre Service (Koret Hall)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
