DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us for our weekly Community Kiddush Lunch\,</p><p>and s
 tay for this unique learning opportunity with our visiting scholar-in-resid
 ence\, Rabbi Noah Bickart.</p><p>Teaching topic: "Rabbis Killing Rabbis: Or
  How the Talmud Became the Talmud"<br>In this session we will encounter the
  Talmud in the process of its own redaction\, and see how far the competiti
 on for power extended in the Talmudic academies in Babylonia at the dawn of
  the Islamic age.</p>
