DESCRIPTION:JULY GIANTS GAME -- SAVE THE DATE!\nTuesday\, July 31\, 7:00-10
 :30 p.m.\nAT&T Park\, San Francisco\n\nThe Beth Sholom Couples Kehillah wil
 l convene for an evening of peanuts\, Cracker Jack\, and Giants baseball on
  Tuesday\, July 31.  Our home team will take on the Amazin' New York Mets (
 which means some of us will be branded dual-loyalists!).  Our group will me
 et at our seats in AT&T Park. The ballpark is located at 24 Willie Mays Pla
 za\, at the corner of King and 3rd Streets.\n\nIf you plan to attend\, emai
 l cbsck1@gmail.com by June 20th to let us know the number of your party.  T
 ickets are limited (we have 16 seats in View Reserve Right Field\, which of
 fers a nice view of the Bay as well as the game) and cost $18 each.  Please
  do not purchase your own tickets.  Instead\, mail a personal check to the 
 address below\, indicating that your payment is for "Couples Kehillah Giant
 s' tickets."  Please make checks out to Christopher Reiger.\n \nSend to:\nA
 ttn: CBS Couples Kehillah\n498 Carl Street\, Apt. 5\nSan Francisco\, CA 941
 17\n\nDigital tickets will be emailed to each Couples Kehillah participant 
 a week before the game.\n\nBeth Sholom Couples Kehillah: \nA community grou
 p which brings together young professionals for fun\, social action\, and e
 xploration of their Jewish heritage.  Couples Kehillah generally meets once
  a month.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080016Z
LOCATION:AT&T Park
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Couples Kehillah - Giants Game
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
