DESCRIPTION:This series of classes will offer an opportunity to learn about
  the foundations of the Jewish tradition\, including calendar\, life cycle\
 , history\, philosophy\, liturgy\, theology\, and Israel. Most of all\, it 
 will be an opportunity to address your needs and hopes for a deeper involve
 ment with Judaism and the Jewish people. Through readings\, meetings with t
 he rabbi\, attending services\, and sharing meals together\, we hope to for
 m a community within the community during our time together. \n\nPlease con
 tact the rabbi’s assistant\, Jill Pettegrew at 415.221.8736\, ext. 101\, or
  JPettegrew@bethsholomsf.org\, if interested.  Space is limited. \n\nClasse
 s continue through May\, 2010.
