CREATED:20090810T192314Z
DESCRIPTION:Sukkot-Fest! Community Harvest Celebration\n\nJewish Farmers Ma
 rket! Live Music! Beit HaShuevah (Water-Drawing Ceremony and Rain Dance Par
 ty)\, Ushpizin (Honoring Exalted Guests in the Sukkah)\, Wine and Cheese\, 
 Yaakov-Lantern Carving\, and Native American Lulav Making!                 
                                                                            
            \n\nBring cash to buy produce from local Jewish farmers\, your h
 ome-grown produce\, home-baked goods and homemade crafts to sell for tzedak
 ah\, nonperishables for the Food Bank\, musical instruments to jam along (d
 rums\, guitars\, trumpets\, rain-sticks)\, and … your funkiest dance groove
 s! Please register with Sarah Hefter if you wish to bring something to the 
 market.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080431Z
LOCATION:301 14th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sukkot-Fest! Community Harvest Celebration
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
