DESCRIPTION:Come learn the necessary skills to chant from the Torah. \nThe 
 Torah readers in our community enable us to fulfill the mitzvah of reading 
 from the Torah on weekdays\, Shabbat and holidays. Come to refine your skil
 ls or learn for the first time. All are welcome!\n\nParticipants must be ab
 le to read Hebrew (see our course listings on page 11 if you want to learn 
 to read Hebrew).\nMondays\, please arrive at 6 p.m. for minyan.\n\nPrice: P
 ublic $360 | CBS Member $180\nLocation: Beit Midrash (Library)\nTime: Monda
 ys\, 6:00-7:30 p.m.\nDates: Sunday-Intensive Kickoff \, Nov 3\, 9 a.m. - 12
  p.m.\n16 Monday Sessions\, 11/4\, 11/18\, 12/2\, 12/16\, 1/6\, 1/27\, 2/3\
 , 2/24\, 3/2\, 3/16\, 4/6\, 4/20\, 5/4\, 5/18\, 6/8\, & 6/22.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081450Z
