CREATED:20100111T214853Z
DESCRIPTION:The Beth Sholom Professional Network is dedicated to supporting
  the business and professional lives of all of our congregants.\n\nTuesday\
 , February 9th: Special Mini Workshop!  The best way to get new clients is 
 through referrals\, yet most small business owners hate asking for them. Jo
 in CBS congregant and preschool mom Jennifer Block Martin and Julie Thompso
 n -a.k.a. J&J Marketing- for a 20 minute mini workshop that will leave you 
 with loads of tips and strategies to boost your referral rate in 2010. Jenn
 ifer and Julie consult with businesses on a variety of marketing topics inc
 luding strategy\, client acquisition and retention\, and brand identity. \n
 \nAll congregants are invited to network\, nosh and learn!\n\nPlease join t
 he Beth Sholom LinkedIn Business and Professional Group. This group is a co
 nvenient way to make referrals\, recommendations and introductions\, and wi
 ll greatly expand your professional and business connections. Please visit 
 www.linkedin.com and search under groups for "Beth Sholom SF Business and P
 rofessional".\n\nFor further information\, please contact Lisa Berkelhammer
  (lisabwellness@gmail.com) and Rebekah Jackson Sapirstein (rebekah@lawrjs.c
 om).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080637Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beth Sholom Professional Networking
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
