DESCRIPTION:Weekly Talmud Study with Rabbi Avi Novis-Deutsch\n(Tonight only
  at 6:30 for join the Tu B'Shevat Seder)\n\nA weekly course in Talmud for a
 ll levels.\n\nRabbi Avi Novis Deutsch is a former Talmud and Halacha profes
 sor at the SRS Schechter Rabbinical school in Israel and served for six yea
 rs as a Masorti pulpit Rabbi in Ma'ayanot congregation in Jerusalem. Over t
 he last three years\, he has worked as Program Manager for a non-profit org
 anization\, managing and initiating a variety of educational programs for c
 hildren and youth from underprivileged neighborhoods in Jerusalem. He is a 
 graduate of the Mandel Educational Leadership Institution and holds a Maste
 r's degree in Talmud and Halacha.\n\nAvi served for three years as Rosh Yes
 hiva of the Human Rights Yeshiva and spent eight years studying and teachin
 g in an Orthodox Yeshiva. 
