CREATED:20100510T214907Z
DESCRIPTION:Young Adult Shabbat Service\n\nWe will begin with drinks\, fing
 er-foods and schmoozing at 6:30 p.m. and then transition into the Makom Sho
 lom meditation room for a more formal service with Rabbi Aaron Philmus.\n\n
 Many often are intimidated when they hear “Conservative” Judaism\, but you 
 don’t have to be! This will be a warm and friendly environment where we wil
 l pause often to explain the ideas behind the prayers or activities. Afterw
 ards\, you are free to stick around or head to the local pub with some new 
 found friends! Hope to see you there on June 18 and please feel free to inv
 ite your friends!\n\nFor more information contact Sarah Hefter at 415.221.8
 736\, ext. 140.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081423Z
LOCATION:Makom Sholom
SEQUENCE:4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Young Adult Shabbat Service
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
