CREATED:20110422T185217Z
DESCRIPTION:Thou Shalt Know Israel: Lag B'Omer Celebration\nIsraeli Scholar
  Rabbi Avi Novis Deutsch \n\nOur special speaker will be Rabbi Avi Novis-De
 utsch who will discuss "Why Masorti is essential for Israel and America". R
 abbi Novis-Deutsch is a Conservative (Masorti) Rabbi. He has served as a pu
 lpit rabbi in Israel and a teacher at the Israeli Rabbinical Seminary. He i
 s spending the year as Masorti visiting scholar in the Bay Area. He will ex
 plore Masorti as a Jewish concept and the main values that characterize it 
 in light of the Israel we seek. We hope that you will join us.\n\nBreakfast
  will be served.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080805Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:THOU SHALT KNOW ISRAEL: Israeli Scholar Rabbi Avi Novis Deutsch 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
