UID:57othrk7luf7vs4hapga39s0ks@google.com
CREATED:20080921T215051Z
DESCRIPTION:Preparing for the High Holy Days\n\nJoin Rabbi Alan Lew for fou
 r Tuesday evenings of studies and preparation for the High Holy Days on Sep
 tember 2\, 9\, 16\, and October 7\, 7–9 p.m.\, in the Gronowski Family Chap
 el at Congregation Beth Sholom. Rabbi Lew will take us through the sequence
  of the Days of Awe and its stages of preparation.\n\nThese three classes a
 re specifically designed to help us prepare for teshuvah\, the return we mu
 st make to God and to ourselves on the High Holy Days. We will devote each 
 evening to the study of particular texts selected from different Jewish sou
 rces. We begin with a short period of meditation. Previous meditation exper
 ience is not necessary.\n\nFor information and registration contact Yaffa T
 ygiel at 415.221.8736\, ext. 106.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081031Z
LOCATION:301 14th Avenue\, Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:High Holy Days Preparation class
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
