DESCRIPTION:How Does Halacha Change? <br>What is the "CJLS\," and what are 
 some of its recent discussions that affect our community?<br><br>The CJLS i
 s the body within the Conservative Movement which is tasked with helping co
 ngregants and their rabbis apply Jewish Values to contemporary times - thro
 ugh the language of law. In this session\, we will explore some of the more
  recent developments (and Disagreements) on the committee\, and how and why
  congregants should care.<br><br><b>TICKETS FOR THIS EVENT ARE SOLD OUT<br>
 (email bjones@bethsholomsf.org for waitlist)</b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080920Z
LOCATION:MMR\, CBS-1-Main Meeting Room (MMR) (40)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dinner and Dialogue with Rabbi Ain & Scholar in Residence\, Rabbi N
 oah Bickart
TRANSP:OPAQUE
