DESCRIPTION:Weekly Talmud Study with Rabbi Avi Novis-Deutsch\n\nA weekly co
 urse in Talmud for all levels.\n\nRabbi Avi Novis Deutsch is a former Talmu
 d and Halacha professor at the SRS Schechter Rabbinical school in Israel an
 d served for six years as a Masorti pulpit Rabbi in Ma'ayanot congregation 
 in Jerusalem. Over the last three years\, he has worked as Program Manager 
 for a non-profit organization\, managing and initiating a variety of educat
 ional programs for children and youth from underprivileged neighborhoods in
  Jerusalem. He is a graduate of the Mandel Educational Leadership Instituti
 on and holds a Master's degree in Talmud and Halacha.\n\nAvi served for thr
 ee years as Rosh Yeshiva of the Human Rights Yeshiva and spent eight years 
 studying and teaching in an Orthodox Yeshiva. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080706Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
