DESCRIPTION:Summer Sundays: SF Giants Outing (AT&T Park)\nSunday\, August 2
 8\, 1:05 p.m.\n\nCongregation Beth Sholom invites congregants to an afterno
 on at AT&T ballpark this summer. Join fellow Beth Sholom members for some p
 eanuts\, Cracker Jack\, and Giants' baseball on Sunday\, August 28 at 1:05 
 p.m.\, as our home team takes on the Houston Astros. We will reserve a bloc
 k of seats for our group\, and there will be opportunity to visit with old 
 friends and to make new ones while enjoying the 2010 World Series Champions
 . Please do not purchase your own ticket(s)\; a Beth Sholom volunteer will 
 acquire tickets. If you plan to attend\, email Events@bethsholomsf.org to l
 et us know the number in your party. Tickets cost $25 each. Please indicate
  that your check is for “Giants’ tickets” and mail your payment to: Congreg
 ation Beth Sholom\, 301 14th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94118. Our group w
 ill meet at our seats in AT&T Park. The ballpark is located at 24 Willie Ma
 ys Plaza\, at the corner of King and 3rd Streets.\n\nPlease R.S.V.P. by Fri
 day\, June 24 to Events@bethsholomsf.org. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080823Z
LOCATION:AT&T Park
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Summer Sundays: SF Giants Game
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
