UID:l93mou4fhcr0c49f6o531r6024@google.com
CREATED:20120814T200759Z
DESCRIPTION:For more information and tickets for Erev Rosh Hashanah Service
 \, First Day Rosh Hashanah Service\, Second Day Rosh Hashanah Service\, Kol
  Nidre Service\, and Yom Kippur Service (including Yizkor Service) please c
 all the office at 415.221.8736\, ext. 111\, or Tickets@bethsholomsf.org.\n\
 nThere is no ticket needed for the following service: \nMincha and Ne'ila S
 ervice\n\nWILL-CALL TICKETS \nCheck-in for will-call tickets will be at the
  main entrance. Photo identification is required for pick-up of will-call t
 ickets. \n\nSERVICE DESCRIPTIONS \nOur Sanctuary service will preserve the 
 holidays’ classic character with traditional hazzanut. \nOur Koret Hall ser
 vice will be a participatory davening experience interspersed with teaching
 s. \n\nSECURITY \nHigh Holidays tickets are required for admission to servi
 ces for members\, guests\, and nonmembers. Security guards and staff will b
 e at the entrances to the building. Staff will have the names of all ticket
  holders and will be there to assist you. \n\nPUBLIC TRANSPORTATION \nMuni 
 bus lines servicing the synagogue include the 1\, 2\, 28\, and 38. Detailed
  directions for using public transportation from within the Bay Area are av
 ailable online at tripplanner.transit.511.org. \n\nPARKING \nPlease remembe
 r that parking in our neighborhood is very limited and those attending serv
 ices should provide adequate time to find parking. Street cleaning and neig
 hborhood parking restrictions during the High Holidays have been lifted for
  specific streets. Specific information regarding affected blocks will be s
 ent with High Holiday tickets.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080717Z
LOCATION:Sanctuary 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:First Day Rosh Hashanah
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
