 you have questions at nans55ster@gmail.com.\n\nBuy your 2015 Mah Jongg card
  through Congregation Beth Sholom. Small cards are $8.00 and large $9.00.  
 If you want to order a card send a check to CBS marked Mah Jongg with your 
