DESCRIPTION:Kabbalat Shabbat Service\nSING on the second Friday of each mon
 th\n\n\nSING with us\, every second Friday of each month!\n\nHow can we tak
 e the routine liturgy that we know so well and make it new time and time ag
 ain? One way: by singing out loud!\n\nJoin Rabbi Amanda Russell and Jonatha
 n Bayer for a musical Shabbat experience\, which will combine old and new t
 unes from different places around the world. We will use the music as a veh
 icle to prayer\, grounding us where we feel comfortable and allowing us to 
 deepen our prayer with melodies more unfamiliar to us.\n\nJonathan Bayer of
  San Francisco is a singer\, instrumentalist and Jewish educator. You may k
 now him as the Music Specialist at CBS and he is an asset to our musical te
 am. His contributions in the Preschool\, Shabbat School program and other S
 habbat services are unmatched and he looks forward to another year with the
  CBS team and exploring new ways to pray and make music together.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080817Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel\, CBS-1-Gronowski Family Chapel (GFC) (100
 )
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SING - Kabbalat Shabbat Services
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
