UID:11j7a36npt7ibkrgjja6t8afjc@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=bethsh
 olomsf@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:bethsholomsf@gmail.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20191202T183000
CREATED:20190913T185147Z
DESCRIPTION:Introduction to Kabbalah (part 1)\nwith Yosef Rosen\n\nThis cla
 ss will take you on a journey across the 2\,500 year history of Jewish myst
 icism and Kabbalah. We will map this past together so we can better engage 
 with contemporary forms of Jewish spirituality\, and revisit forgotten\, ab
 andoned\, or now-impossible forms of imagination\, devotion\, and love. Alo
 ng the way we will learn about archangels\, medieval mysticism of language\
 , celestial aesthetics\, meditation techniques\, false messiahs\, erotic de
 votion\, cosmology\, theological revolutions\, poetry of the ineffable\, Ha
 ssidut\, Madonna\, and more. Each meeting’s conversation and learning will 
 emerge out of primary-source readings (all in English translation). All are
  welcome\; no previous Jewish knowledge is required. This is for beginners 
 who want to go deep.\n\n\nPrice: Public $180 | CBS Members $36\nLocation: B
 eit Midrash (Library)\nTime: Mondays\, 6:30 p.m.\nDates: November 25\, Dece
 mber 2\, 9\, and 16\nemail Rebecca Goodman to register rgoodman@bethsholoms
 f.org
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081832Z
LOCATION:Congregation Beth Sholom (TBD)\, CBS-1-Kitchen (KT) (20)\, CBS-1-R
 abin Library (RL) (30)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Introduction to Kabbalah (part 1)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
