UID:4ac5hkh7g7erjnck0ei3lmcmlo@google.com
CREATED:20120302T230045Z
DESCRIPTION:By Shlomo Rosenfeld\nThis is an amazing 'detective' story full 
 of surprises\, and coincidences resulting in discovering a live branch of o
 ur ROSENFELD family that survived the Shoah which my father did not know ab
 out.  One incredible coincident is that about six months before the discove
 ry\, my sister attended a wedding event invited by the groom family.  Now w
 e know that the bride is the daughter of our newly discovered second cousin
 .  Invited by the groom but more related to the bride!!!\n\nAt the end of 2
 010 I got into the research of my family roots.  I started with a few pre W
 WII family correspondences and other memorabilia which lead me to the Germa
 n records of the Lodz Ghetto in which I found records of over 800 ROSENFELD
 s among them my extended family\, some I knew about and some I did not.  \n
 Then\, I found birth\, marriage\, and other documents tracing our family ro
 ots to the mid 1700. \n\nIn January 2011 Yad Vashem made their Holocaust ar
 chive records available on the web and to my surprise\, I discovered a live
  branch of our ROSENFELD family that survived WWII which my father did not 
 know about.  They did not know about us and we did not know about them.  So
  now\, my sister and I have three newly discovered second cousins and their
  families.  We met them in San Francisco Bay Area\, in Israel and in Florid
 a.  Even facebook played a role in the discovery.  One small branch even ex
 tended and exists in Berkeley\, CA next to me.  What a surprise!\n\nMy inte
 nt is to inform and assist others in their family research by sharing the f
 amily discovery story.  In my talk I describe: What we found\, how we found
  it\, where we found it\, how we interpreted what we found\, what leaps of 
 faith we took in the research process where information was missing\, the l
 ogic of our detective work\, the incredible coincidences involved in discov
 ering a live branch of the family coincidently during their visit to San Fr
 ancisco and meeting them for the first time.\n\nOne cannot describe the emo
 tions associated with each discovery.  I’ll try.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080921Z
LOCATION:Main Meeting Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yom Hashoah Program - '" Digging Family Roots and Discovering a Liv
 e Family Branch" 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
