DESCRIPTION:<strong>Join us for this special session sitting together on Fr
 iday\,&nbsp\;January&nbsp\;10. in memory of Rabbi Allan&nbsp\;Lew (</strong
 ><strong><i>z"l</i></strong><strong>).&nbsp\;</strong><br>We will continue 
 the study of the teachings that he envisioned as central to Makor Or and th
 e mindful Jewish life. Join&nbsp\;Makor Or and&nbsp\;Norman Fischer in medi
 tation and study.<br><br><strong>After the meditation you are invited to jo
 in the Kabbalat Shabbat service</strong>&nbsp\;led by Rabbi&nbsp\;Amanda Ru
 ssell.This will be an approachable service filled with song.<br><br>Please 
 contact makororsf@gmail.com to RSVP.
