CREATED:20111115T222908Z
DESCRIPTION:The Mental Health Support Group\, a project of the Nachamu Netw
 ork\, meets on the third Wednesday of every month. This group is for people
  whose lives are affected by mental illness\, including those with an illne
 ss\, family members\, and friends. We will gather in a safe setting to shar
 e our experiences and support each other. These ongoing meetings are free a
 nd open to all. For information call the Beth Sholom office at 415.221.8736
 \, ext. 101. 
