DESCRIPTION:The Learners’ Minyan: Introduction to the Spirituality of Jewis
 h Prayer \nwith David Malman and Ellen Shireman\n8 Shabbat mornings\, 10:15
 –11:45 a.m\, October 17–December 5\nGronowski Family Chapel\n\nDeepen your 
 personal connection to the Shabbat morning service while you learn to devel
 op spiritual mindfulness (kavanah). You will also increase your ability to 
 participate as you discover the liturgical\, spiritual\, and emotional arc 
 of the service. A knowledge of Hebrew is encouraged but not required. Class
 es will include study\, discussion\, and a shortened Shabbat service.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081450Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:None today: Learners' Minyan
TRANSP:OPAQUE
