DESCRIPTION:Join Yehuda Solomon (of Moshav band)\, Hazzan Avyatar Alfassi (
 Congregation Anshey Sfard)\, Rabbi Glazer (CBS)\, and other friends. Yehuda
 \, Hazzan Alfassi\, and Rabbi Glazer will lead us in a joyous communal sing
 -along experience that features appearances by many special guests. Togethe
 r\, we’ll rediscover the power of the Selichot\, our tradition’s beautiful 
 and meaningful penitential piyyut (Jewish liturgical poems).
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081552Z
LOCATION:Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hardly Strictly Selichot: Communal Singing from the Heart
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20120909T050000Z
DTEND:20120909T070000Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:84l5une32ir2c5hp5jdqj5s40o@google.com
CREATED:20120814T210658Z
DESCRIPTION:Exploring the Wisdom of the Talmud with Renowned Scholar Rabbi 
 Daniel Landes\n\nProfessor and Rosh HaYeshiva of Pardes Insitute in Jerusal
 em Rabbi Daniel Landes will lead an exploration into core concepts of Talmu
 dic literature. \n\n1. Selichot\nCongregation Beth Sholom\n8:00 – 10:00 pm 
 – Learning with Rabbi Daniel Landes\n10:00 – 12:00 am - Selichot Service wi
 th Roz Barak and Marcia Attie in Sanctuary\n\nTopic:  The Emergence of Jewi
 sh Time.  After the fall of the 2nd Temple in 70 CE\, the sages of the Talm
 ud establish the sanctity of time over space.  Through the cycle of Shabbat
 \, the new moon and regular holidays\, the Talmud erects a structure by whi
 ch we understand our place in time. September 8\, Congregation Beth Sholom\
 , 8:00 – 10:00 pm.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081802Z
LOCATION:Sanctuary 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Selichot Service
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
