 hite Sharkskin Suit: A Jewish Family's Exodus from Old Cairo to the New Wor
 ld."\n\nThis award-winning memoir by a Wall Street Journal reporter chronic
 les her Jewish family’s traditions\, tragedies and triumphs in their epic e
 xodus in 1963 from the splendor of cosmopolitan Cairo\, to Paris\, and fina
 lly Brooklyn. 
