DESCRIPTION:<table><tbody><tr><td><table><tbody><tr><td><table><tbody><tr><
 td><span><span>Shabbat School tefillah<br></span></span><p><strong><i><span
 >Do you hear the beat of drums?</span></i></strong></p><span>Join us and 75
  drums as we explore alternative forms of<span><i>&nbsp\;</i></span><em>tef
 illah&nbsp\;</em>(prayer) at our annual Drum Café experience. Shabbat Schoo
 l parents are encouraged to attend with their child(ren)!&nbsp\;Let’s come 
 together and beat the drums (almost) in unison. Last year was truly amazing
  and I know that this year will be as well!</span><span><span><br></span></
 span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody>
 </table>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081205Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Drum Cafe - Shabbat School Tefillah
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
