BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20110313T230000Z
DTEND:20110314T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:uol1a1d4pa6vjvcmi191oq1cu0@google.com
CREATED:20110121T204308Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a presentation on the Szyk Haggadah by Irvin Ungar\
 , a former pulpit rabbi\, and the curator of the recent Szyk exhibit at the
  Palace of the Legion of Honor. Learn how Arthur Szyk fused his two passion
 s--art and history--into a visual commentary on the dangerous parallel betw
 een the Exodus narrative of Egyptian oppression and alarming developments u
 nfolding in Nazi Germany. Copies of the new edition of the Szyk Haggadah\, 
 published by Mr. Unger\, will be available for purchase.\n\nFollowing the p
 resentation\, join in for taste-tests of charosets from around the world (r
 ecipes supplied too)\, blind tastings of matzos (determine which\, if any\,
  have any “flavor”)\, and more. Learn how to give your Seders new substance
  and new tastes\, along with friends\, old and new.\n\nSuggested donation: 
 $10 \n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080750Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Freedom Illuminated: Understanding the Szyk Haggadah\, Charoset Tas
 ting and More
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
