DESCRIPTION:The Mental Health Support Group\, a project of the Nachamu Netw
 ork\, meets on the first Thursday of every month. This group is for people 
 whose lives are affected by mental illness\, including those with an illnes
 s\, family members\, and friends. We will gather in a safe setting to share
  our experiences and support each other. These ongoing meetings are free an
 d open to all. For information call the Beth Sholom office at 415.221.8736\
 , ext. 101. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T080716Z
LOCATION:Rabin Library
SEQUENCE:5
