 om location: Board Room.\n \nThe book selection is A Pidgeon and A Boy by I
 sraeli author Meir Shalev.  Our group facilitator will be Erin Hyman (mom o
 f Nathan-3rd grade and Theo-K).\n\nCopies of this book will be available (a
 s of Thursday afternoon) and can be checked out\, at the Beth Sholom Office
  on a first-come\, first-serve basis. Please see Rabbi Zelony or Julia on T
