UID:ddb328a0plja9cr8c7op1cob30@google.com
CREATED:20160104T210807Z
DESCRIPTION:Life Line Screening\, a leading provider of community-based pre
 ventive health screenings\, will offer their affordable\, non-invasive\, an
 d painless health screenings in Koret Hall on January 26\, 2016. Five scree
 nings will be available\, each scanning for potential health problems relat
 ed to: blocked arteries (leading cause of stroke)\; abdominal aortic aneury
 sms\; hardening of the arteries in the legs (predictor of heart disease)\; 
 atrial fibrillation or irregular heart beat (tied to stroke risk)\; and a b
 one density screening for men and women (assessing risk of osteoporosis).\n
 \nPre-register for a Wellness Package which includes 4 vascular tests and t
 he osteoporosis screening from $149 ($139 with our member discount). It tak
 es 60-90 minutes to complete all five screenings.\n\nPre-registration is re
 quired. To book your appointment and to receive a $10 discount off any pack
 age priced above $129\, please call 1-888-653-6441 or visit www.lifelinescr
 eening.com/community-partners.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081604Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Life Line Screening
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
