UID:4urfvk292fhbge8uievpnp44m0@google.com
CREATED:20181130T035629Z
DESCRIPTION:\nDAVEN - on the first Friday of each month\nFor 500 years\, Je
 ws have used the Kabbalat Shabbat service to\nmake a transition from busy w
 eekdays to the calm spaciousness\nof Shabbat. In the DAVEN service\, we wil
 l explore the Hebrew\nliturgy\, using niggun (wordless melody)\, chant\, so
 ng\, and silence\nto engage this joyous tradition with our friends and fami
 lies.\nDavid Malman has been a CBS member since 1998. He has led\nShabbat\,
  daily minyan\, and High Holy Days services. He is an\nactive participant i
 n Makor Or\, the meditation group started by\nRabbi Alan Lew (z”l). David a
 nd his wife Ellen Shireman taught\na successful Learner’s Minyan for severa
 l years\, and he attended\nJoey Weisenberg’s “Building Singing Communities”
  multi-day\nworkshops in 2013 and 2014. He is honored and pleased to be\nwe
 lcoming Shabbat with the CBS community.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081216Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kabbalat Shabbat Services - DAVEN
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
