DESCRIPTION:Club Shabbat is a special program designed to provide children 
 of all ages with a Shabbat related spiritual\, educational and social exper
 ience in the synagogue. Every Saturday morning from 10 a.m.-12 noon\, couns
 elors and childcare providers stand by to care for our congregation's child
 ren while parents attend services.  I invite parents to check out the follo
 wing programs: \n\n•Childcare is provided to families with children ages ne
 wborn–7 in Kitah Bet classroom located on the first floor in the school bui
 lding. Kit and Erin\, our childcare providers\, will provide interactive Sh
 abbat appropriate activities.\n\n•School-age children will gather in the Yo
 uth Lounge with Alisa and David\, the Shabbat counselors\, for board games\
 , discussions\, sports and social activities\; they will also use the libra
 ry for reading and prayers.\n\nAll children are invited to join the congreg
 ation for the concluding Adon Olam prayer at the end of morning services\, 
 followed by Kiddush.\n\nFor more information call Yaffa Tygiel at 415.221.8
 736\, ext. 106.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081233Z
LOCATION:301 14th Avenue\, Rabin Library/ Room 125
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Club Shabbat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
