DESCRIPTION:Club Shabbat is a special program designed to provide children 
 of all ages with a Shabbat related spiritual\, educational and social exper
 ience in the synagogue. Every Saturday morning from 10 a.m.-12 noon\, couns
 elors and childcare providers stand by to care for our congregation's child
 ren while parents attend services.  I invite parents to check out the follo
 wing programs: \n\n•Childcare is provided to families with children ages ne
 wborn–7 in Room 27 located on the second floor in the school building. Kit 
 and Erin\, our childcare providers\, will provide interactive Shabbat appro
 priate activities.\n\n•School-age children will gather in the Youth Lounge 
 with David Agam\, the Shabbat counselor\, for board games\, discussions\, s
 ports and social activities\; they will also use the library for reading an
 d prayers.\n\nAll children are invited to join the congregation for the con
 cluding Adon Olam prayer at the end of morning services\, followed by Kiddu
 sh.\n\nFor more information call the office at 415.221.8736.
