DESCRIPTION:The Mental Health Support Group\, a project of the Nachamu Netw
 ork\, meets on the third Wednesday of every month (note: meeting on the sec
 ond Wednesday in September\, November\, and December of 2012). This group i
 s for people whose lives are affected by mental illness\, including those w
 ith an illness\, family members\, and friends. We will gather in a safe set
 ting to share our experiences and support each other. These ongoing meeting
 s are free and open to all. For information call the Beth Sholom office at 
 415.221.8736\, ext. 101.
