 elop spiritual mindfulness (kavanah). You will also increase your ability t
 o participate as you discover the liturgical\, spiritual\, and emotional ar
 c of the service. A knowledge of Hebrew is encouraged but not required. Cla
 sses will include study\, discussion\, and a shortened Shabbat service.\n\n
