DESCRIPTION:Stern Grove Festival featuring the SF Opera\nSunday\, August 19
 \, 1:30-5pm\nStern Grove\, 19th Avenue and Sloat Blvd.  \n\nWhether you lov
 e drama and duets or picnics in the park\, we hope you will join us at the 
 Stern Grove festival in August.  When the date approaches\, we will coordin
 ate goodies for the picnic.  Please feel free to pass on the invitation to 
 others who may be interested\, the more the merrier!\n\nPlease let us know 
 if you plan to attend by sending an email RSVP to cbsck1@gmail.com.\n\nFor 
 more information about Rosalie Stern visit: http://www.magnes.org/digital-p
 rograms/dusty-archives/rosalie-meyer-stern-papers-and-photographs-1842-1977
  \n\n\nBeth Sholom Couples Kehillah: \nA community group which brings toget
 her young professionals for fun\, social action\, and exploration of their 
 Jewish heritage.  Couples Kehillah generally meets once a month.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081417Z
LOCATION:Stern Grove\, 19th Avenue and Sloat Blvd.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Couples Kehillah - Stern Grove Festival featuring the SF Opera
TRANSP:OPAQUE
