 ong friendships\, share the ritual of Shabbat\, and bond with the ones you 
 love.<br><br>Members: FREE<br>Guests: $180 for 10 weeks beginning January 2
 0<br>Drop-ins: $18<br><br><a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/baby-me-com
