 uired. There will be ample schmoozing and coffee always. Mark those calenda
 rs!<br><br><b>WHEN</b>:<b> </b>Saturdays\, 10 a.m. <br><span>             J
 anuary 28\, March 4\, April 1\, and May 13</span><br><br><b>WHERE</b>: CBS 
