ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=bethsh
 olomsf@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:bethsholomsf@gmail.com
CREATED:20190916T165343Z
DESCRIPTION:This year\, join us for a traditional observance of this servic
 e.\n\nSelichot is an essential element in traditional Jewish preparation fo
 r the Yamim Noraim. The service is comprised of some familiar elements from
  the daily service and some familiar elements from the liturgy of Yom Kippu
 r and Rosh Hashanah as well as some piyyutim (liturgical poems) special to 
 the occasion. At Selichot we take up the special melodies of the Yamim Nora
 im.\n\nIn the days of Rabbi Lew (z"l) the observance of Selichot was a hall
 mark. This year we are returning to a more traditional observance led by Ra
 bbi Ain\, and Rabbi Russell\, joined by musician Jeremiah Lockwood. We will
  attempt to recover a more direct dialogue with G-d in our prayers\, in com
 munity.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T082134Z
LOCATION:Gronowski Family Chapel
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Selichot
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
