DESCRIPTION:Young Adult Shabbat\nBeginning August 20\, 6:30 p.m.\n\nCongreg
 ation Beth Sholom is very interested in developing its Young Adult Communit
 y. As such\, we are planning to have a “Young  Adult Shabbat” every third F
 riday of the month beginning August 20\, with a potluck. Please bring a veg
 etarian dish or beverage to share with the community. More information abou
 t specific dates to come. It will be a welcoming atmosphere where people wi
 ll be able to develop their Jewish identity as well as meet new friends.\n\
 nThis is a grassroots effort in which we can use all possible help that we 
 can get. If you are interested in assisting\, feel free to contact Derek Li
 ef at dereklief@gmail.com.\n
