DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to get engaged in social activism? We wil
 l be hosting several letter writing parties on various themes and invite al
 l teens and adults to participate. Bring a friend or two! We will provide s
 nacks and supplies\, all you need to do is show up. Hand written letters ca
 rry significantly more weight with your elected representatives and members
 hip organizations than emails\, form letters\, or online petitions. Our sec
 ond letter writing party will take place on Thursday\, January 16\, 6:30-8:
 00 PM. The theme is racial equality. Let your elected officials know what y
 ou think or thank them for the work they are already doing. Please join us!
 \n\nCost: Free with RSVP to rgoodman@bethsholomsf.org
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081937Z
LOCATION:Youth Lounge\, CBS-1-Youth Lounge (YL) (50)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Chesed va'Tzedek: Racial Equity Letter Writing Event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
