DESCRIPTION:Join Beth Sholom for havdalah in your neighborhood - this time 
 in <b>NOE VALLEY</b>.<br><br><br>This <b>members only </b>event is meant to
  create social opportunities during the summer\, connect you with Beth Shol
 om members in your neighborhood and give you a chance to celebrate havdalah
  in community. Of course you don't <i>have </i>to share a zip code with the
  host\, but the idea is to participate in your neighborhood-"ish."<br><br>W
 ine and light bites will be served. Parts of this evening may be outdoors\,
  so please dress accordingly.<br><br><b>Saturday\, August 5\, 8 - 10 p.m.</
 b> (Havdalah at 8:57 p.m.)<br><b>Address given upon RSVP</b> a few days bef
 ore the event. Space is limited\, <a href="https://forms.gle/rj9HgWDsuzEPBo
 mcA">please RSVP by Thursday at 10 a.m.</a><br><br>Questions? Contact the R
 abbi's office - rabbi@bethsholomsf.org
LAST-MODIFIED:20230609T180351Z
