 -part series with Rabbi Russell.<br><br>Thursdays after morning minyan (~8:
 30) - in person and online.<br><br>Aug 24<br><b>Aug 31</b><br>Sept 7<br><br
 >Join Zoom Meeting: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://us02web.z
 oom.us/j/81632373785&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=16906844000252
