DESCRIPTION:Join CBS member and challah-baker extraordinaire\, Jackie Shelt
 on-Miller\, and other fabulous CBS women (21+...there will be wine) to conn
 ect with friends new and old as we gather together to make challah. Come be
  a part of this evening of <b>community</b>\, <b>creativity</b>\, and <b>co
 nversation</b>! <br><br>This event includes casual dinner by our very own C
 hef Marlene. Participants will leave with a braided challah dough that they
  will bake in their home kitchens. Please bring a bottle of Kosher or Calif
 ornia wine to share.<br><br><b>Thank you to those who have registered. We h
 ave reached our capacity for this event.</b> If you would like to attend an
 d missed the deadline please email us at communications@bethsholomsf.org an
 d we will add you to a waiting list. We hope to host future women's events\
 , so thank you for your interest!<br><br><i>Please note: if you have a chan
 ge of plans\, kindly let us know so that we can make your spot available fo
 r someone else. We will aim to prioritize Beth Sholom members</i>.<br><br><
 br><b>WHERE</b>: CBS Main Meeting Room and Rainbow Courtyard
