 ooze<br><br>5:30 p.m. - Learn how to participate in the REJOICE service. Tr
 aining and practice in the rhythms and chants that we use. If you like\, br
 ing a drum.<br><br>6 p.m. - our sacred ecstatic musical rejoice Kabbalat Sh
 abbat service with Reb Tsvi and Middle Eastern drummer Susie Goldenstein. T
 here will be a Kaddish for mourners.<br><br>7 p.m. - Our ruach refreshed\, 
