  after life\, the most important conversations Americans are not having.  T
 ogether\, we will enjoy dinner while participating in a facilitated convers
 ation about Jewish death and dying. Led by David Katznelson\, Executive Dir
 ector of Reboot Network\, this is a CBS members-only event (21 years +).<br
 ><br><strong><b>$36 Per Person</b></strong><em><br>Registration includes a 
 nice dinner and an evening of meaningful conversation and connection<br></e
 m><br><strong><b>$72 Per Person (Sponsorship)<br></b></strong><em>One seat 
 for the price of two to support and defray the costs of this series</em></p
 ><p><strong><b>Childcare Available for $18 Per Child</b></strong><br><em>We
  are glad to provide childcare for children 5-years and older. Think “pizza
  and a movie.”</em></p><p><em><a href="https://cbssf.shulcloud.com/form/cbs
 -death-over-dinner.html">Register Here! </a></em></p>
