DESCRIPTION:<strong><b>SING Kabbalat Shabbat</b></strong><br><p>5:30 p.m. n
 osh\, 6:00 p.m. service<br><em>A musical Kabbalat Shabbat</em></p><p><b>WHE
 RE</b>: CBS Chapel<em><br></em></p><p>Followed by dinner and learning ~ 7:1
 5 p.m.</p><p><strong><b>Rededicating Ourselves: Models of Jewish Resilience
 <br></b></strong>Hanukkah commemorates the rededication of the Temple after
  it was defiled by Greek armies. But there have been other attacks on our m
 ost sacred spaces throughout history\, and we have responded in different w
 ays\, given the needs of the moment. </p><p><a href="https://cbssf.shulclou
 d.com/form/cbs-Dinner-and-learning-with-Rabbi-David-Kasher.html">Register f
 or Dinner Here</a> - <span>Members only: $18</span></p><p><em>This members 
 only event will have limited seating. Please register by December 4.</em></
 p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231204T042924Z
