DESCRIPTION:Dr. Ernest M. Weitz Breakfast Club\nNewman Fisher\, President\n
 \nThe Breakfast club currently meets on the second Sunday of each month (ex
 cept summer months). There is a brief business meeting followed by an infor
 mal talk on topics of interest to the Jewish Community. Speakers have inclu
 ded many community leaders of the San Francisco Jewish Community\, along wi
 th members of Beth Sholom. Meetings are held at 9:00 a.m. and start with a 
 breakfast.\n\nCost: $40 per couple\, $25 per individual\, $5 drop-in\n\nFor
  more information call the office 415.221.8736\, ext. 105\, attn: Beth Jone
 s\n
