DESCRIPTION:<b>This event is SOLD OUT.</b><br><b><br></b><br>Join Beth Shol
 om for havdalah in your neighborhood - this time in the <b>INNER RICHMOND</
 b>.<br><br>This <b>members only </b>event is meant to create social opportu
 nities during the summer\, connect you with Beth Sholom members in your nei
 ghborhood and give you a chance to celebrate havdalah in community. Of cour
 se you don't <i>have </i>to share a zip code with the host\, but the idea i
 s to participate in your neighborhood-"ish."<br><br>Wine and light bites wi
 ll be served. Parts of this evening may be outside so please dress accordin
 gly.<br><br><b>Saturday\, July 15\, 8 - 10 p.m.</b> (Havdalah at 9:15 p.m.)
 <br><br>Questions? Contact the Rabbi's office - <a href="mailto:rabbi@beths
 holomsf.org">rabbi@bethsholomsf.org</a>
