UID:08prmtfkupr92pu9ut8d3u8fed@google.com
CREATED:20240103T232520Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><span>Join us in honoring the resilience and courage of Kibb
 utz Kfar Azza's members\, whose children are now playing on the playset we 
 recently purchased for them. They will share with us how that day impacted 
 and reshaped the community's dynamics. In this conversation\, we'll delve i
 nto personal experiences during the events of October 7\, including insight
 s into the community's strength and unity in the face of unprecedented chal
 lenges.</span></p>We hope you’ll join us on the 14th. No registration requi
 red.<br><br>Date: Sunday\, January 14th\, 2024<br>Time: 9:00 a.m. Pacific<b
 r><br>Speakers: Kibbutz Kfar Azza members\, Orit Tzadikevitch and Keren Fla
