DESCRIPTION:"Summer Sundays": Biking the Bay Area\nSunday\, June 19\, 9 a.m
  -12 p.m.\nSan Francisco and Marin\nCongregation Beth Sholom invites member
 s to take part in our first "Summer Sundays" event! Join fellow Beth Sholom
  congregants for a 23-mile ride from Sausalito with a coffee and muffin sto
 p in Tiburon to kick off Father's day. We'll meet at Beth Sholom and car po
 ol over the bridge or\, for the more energetic\, meet us in Sausalito\, on 
 the bike path just past Mike's Bikes. We will meet at Beth Sholom at 9 a.m.
  and will leave from Sausalito at 9:30 a.m.  This is a moderate ride.  R.S.
 V.P. to summer@bethsholomsf.org.
