DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><p><strong><b>WHEN:</b></strong>  Friday\, March 4\,
  6-7 p.m.</p><p><strong><b>WHERE</b></strong>: CBS - Gronowski Family Chape
 l </p><p>Join us for the next REJOICE sacred ecstatic musical Kabbalat Shab
 bat service\, live in the Chapel. Come to participate with the REJOICE musi
 cal ensemble in using rhythm\, drumming\, chanting without words\, singing 
 with simple words\, and movement to get into the G!dzone - Dveikut\, kirvat
  Elohim\, it-taqaarub il-Allah - where I am still me\, and the Beloved is s
 till the Beloved\, and yet the wall between us dissolves!<br></p><p>The REJ
 OICE Ensemble:</p><ul><li><p>Reb Tsvi Bar-David - voice and service leader<
 /p></li><li><p>Susie Goldenstein - Middle Eastern percussion</p></li><li><p
 >Gary Haggerty - oud</p></li></ul><br>This event will be held<b> in person 
 at CBS!</b><br><br></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081951Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:REJOICE musical Kabbalat Shabbat Service (In Person)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
