 ng(ish) members and new friends alike in the mid-20s to 40-ish range are we
 lcome and encouraged to attend. If you're a seasoned Shabbat pro\, great! I
 f not\, even better - all are welcome.</p><p>For more information\, please 
 email <a href="mailto:thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.org"><u>thirdfridays@bethsh
 olomsf.org</u></a>. </p><p><b>We close registration on Wednesday\, February
  14th.</b></p><p><b><a href="https://forms.gle/qZMA5cGsXRFvuTvGA">Advance r
 egistration required</a></b></p><p><span><b>Details:</b></span><br></p><p>L
 ocation: Congregation Beth Sholom\, 301 14th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94
 118</p><p>Time: 7:00 PM for dinner (optional: Kabbalat Shabbat services beg
 in at 6:00 PM\; folks are welcome to arrive early to attend services)</p><p
 ><br><br></p>
