  dinner on the <strong><b>Third Friday of each month</b></strong> at Congre
 gation Beth Sholom. We’ll eat\, sing\, talk\, bless and celebrate! Both You
 ng(ish) members and new friends alike in the mid-20s to 40-ish range are we
 lcome and encouraged to attend. If you&#39\;re a seasoned Shabbat pro\, gre
 at! If not\, even better - all are welcome.<br></p><p>For more information\
 , please email <a href="mailto:thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.org" target="_blan
 k"><u>thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.org</u></a>. </p><p><span><b>Details:</b></
 span><br></p><p>Location: Congregation Beth Sholom\, 301 14th Avenue\, San 
 Francisco\, CA 94118</p><p>Time: 7:00 PM for dinner (optional: Kabbalat Sha
 bbat services begin at 6:00 PM\; folks are welcome to arrive early to atten
 d services)</p><p><br><br></p>
