 Tough Conversations in a Post October 7th World” on Sunday\, April 7th at 2
  PM in San Francisco.  Address with be shared upon registration.</p><br><p 
 dir="ltr">Pre-register here: <a href="http://events.hadassah.org/ToughConve
 rsations"><u>events.hadassah.org/<wbr />ToughConversations</u></a> </p><p d
