UID:6sm6ebcrrlu6rm1tnbc6bkt1is@google.com
CREATED:20110603T172212Z
DESCRIPTION:"Summer Sundays (on a Thursday!)": "The Steins Collect" at SFMO
 MA\nThursday\, July 14\, 7-9:30 p.m.\nSFMOMA and The Grove\n\nJoin fellow B
 eth Sholom congregants at SFMOMA for an informal tour of "The Steins Collec
 t\," a "landmark exhibition draw[ing] on collections around the world to re
 unite the Steins' -- writer Gertrude\, her brothers Leo and Michael\, and M
 ichael's wife\, Sarah -- unparalleled holdings of modern art\, bringing tog
 ether\, for the first time in a generation\, dozens of works by Matisse\, P
 icasso\, Paul Cézanne\, Pierre-Auguste Renoir\, Henri de Toulouse-Lautrec\,
  and many others."  After the museum visit\, all are welcome to share a gla
 ss of wine\, cup of tea\, or other libation and good conversation at The Gr
 ove\, a restaurant very near SFMOMA.  (SFMOMA is located at 151 Third Stree
 t\, between Mission and Howard. The Grove is located at 690 Mission Street.
 ). R.S.V.P. to summer@bethsholomsf.org.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T082004Z
LOCATION:SFMOMA and The Grove
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Summer Sundays (on a Thursday!): "The Steins Collect" at SFMOMA
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
