 al centers of Jewish life. It is the place our people have gathered togethe
 r to pour over sacred texts\, debate their meaning and application\, and em
 erge with wisdom to guide Jewish living.<br></p><p><b>See session topics an
 d more information <a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.org/beit-midrash">HERE
 </a></b></p><p>All are welcome\, and there's no background necessary!  </p>
 <p>Four sessions - FREE and open to the community\, 6:30-8:30 p.m.</p><br><
 b>Register <a href="https://hadar.tfaforms.net/5104800">HERE</a></b>
