 ak in Jewish meditation practice\, prayer\, and learning. Sit\, sing\, lear
 n\, and walk with an open heart and mind. Connect deeply to yourself\, to t
 he Divine\, and to the practices and rituals of Elul\, the month of spiritu
 al preparation for the High Holidays. Come together in community to access 
 the still small voice of your soul. We will be meeting in person at Makom S
 halom and an option to join by Zoom.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com
 /url?q=https://www.bethsholomsf.org/elul-5783-makor-or&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sourc
 e=calendar&amp\;ust=1691355307702306&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2fDqnS_ZTL_ne_0zTPKil-"
  target="_blank">Registration Required</a>
