 h Adam Lowy and their fabulous partners\, David Katz and Shira Rutman</b>\,
  for an unprecedented and unparalleled\, collaborative\, multisensory\, int
 eractive Seder that will bring joy and jubilation to your Exodus experience
 . This second night Seder will be the perfect blend of intention\, traditio
 n\, innovation\, contemplation\, and inspiration. <br><br>Come <b>learn </b
 >with us\, <b>lean </b>with us\, <b>eat </b>with us\, <b>drink </b>with us\
 , <b>sing </b>with us\, and <b>be </b>with us and our multigenerational com
 munity on Thursday\, April 6 at 5 p.m. <br><br><b>Limited pillows are avail
 able</b> for your reclining needs. <br><br>[SOLD OUT]<br><br><b>WHERE</b>: 
 <span>CBS Koret Hall</span>
