DESCRIPTION:How to Tell Your Life Story and Family History\nKoret Hall\n\nH
 onor the past by learning how to preserve your life story and family histor
 y. Video biographer Leron Kornreich will discuss how to move beyond family 
 trees\, dates\, and names to create a dynamic family history or personal me
 moir that will be\ncherished for generations to come.\n\nLearn how to organ
 ize your life story and family history\; sort memorabilia and photos\; make
  dates and names come alive\; incorporate hobbies\, collections\, recipes\,
  and traditions\; and pass down core values and life lessons. Please bring 
 a copy of a photograph\, heirloom\, or meaningful memorabilia.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T082115Z
LOCATION:301 14th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Family Legacies
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
