 \, egalitarian Shabbat dinner on the <strong><b>Third Friday of each month<
 /b></strong> at Congregation Beth Sholom. We’ll eat\, sing\, talk\, bless a
 nd celebrate! Both Young(ish) members and new friends alike in the mid-20s 
 to 40-ish range are welcome and encouraged to attend. If you&#39\;re a seas
 oned Shabbat pro\, great! If not\, even better - all are welcome.</p><p>For
  more information\, please email <a href="mailto:thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.
 org" target="_blank"><u>thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.org</u></a>. </p><p><a hr
 ef="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://forms.gle/yQH3yZM4gBSJDCxz8&amp\;s
 a=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1705859626385793&amp\;usg=AOvVaw33HwY1-Tx
 hfzonNtZVXkuZ" target="_blank">Advance registration required</a>. We close 
 registration on Wednesday\, January 17th.</p><p><span>We look forward to se
 eing you!</span></p><p><span><br></span></p>
