UID:15cuebm7icqdmecq42b4mg9i66@google.com
CREATED:20231123T191705Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>In light of the recent war in Israel and Gaza\, some of us f
 ind ourselves separating from the news and others simply consumed by it. Jo
 in <b>Raf Burde</b>\, Beth Sholom board member and member of the Google Tru
 st &amp\; Safety team in conversation with <a href="https://en.wikipedia.or
 g/wiki/Yoel_Roth"><u><b>Yoel Roth</b></u></a>\, head of Trust &amp\; Safety
  at Twitter from 2018-2022. Engage in questions like: how do we think about
  the information environment during times of crisis? How to engage\, if at 
 all? And\, is there anything Judaism has to say?</p><p><b>When: </b>Wednesd
 ay\, December 6\, 6:30 - 8 p.m.</p><p><b>Where: </b>Congregation Beth Sholo
 m</p><p><i><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSffaS_r3DVSotf
 7zYddwZclf474pwJ5tdHwC8oP9hvJiBWN-Q/viewform?usp=sf_link">Registration appr
 eciated.</a></i></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231123T191922Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Staying Sane on Social Media: Tips and Tricks During Crisis
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
