UID:5nfehikgsmfi82ape6g8kka0r8@google.com
CREATED:20120726T185940Z
DESCRIPTION:Please join us on Sunday\, November 11 at 9 a.m. for a presenta
 tion by Rabbi Susan Leider of Congregation Kol Shofar in Tiburon. Rabbi Lei
 der will speak about her experience in Ghana with the American Jewish World
  Service. The focus of her trip was working at “Challenging Heights” – a re
 nowned program to stop children from being indentured and trafficked throug
 h education of parents and children. \n\nThis is the start of the 12th seas
 on of the Breakfast Club which presents stimulating and interesting talks o
 n Jewish themes\, accompanied by a delicious breakfast prepared by Carol We
 itz. The Breakfast Club will meet quarterly on Sunday mornings. Babysitting
  will be provided.\n \nDues are $25 per year for an individual\, $40 for a 
 couple\, or $5 per meeting. If you have any questions please contact Beth J
 ones at BJones@bethsholomsf.org or 415.221.8736\, ext. 105. We look forward
  to seeing you there!\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T081940Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dr. Ernest M. Weitz Breakfast Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
