DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Tot Shabbat with music guest\, Melita Silberstein and
  Director of Family Engagement\, Dale Kleisley.\n\nOur weekly Tot Shabbat s
 ervice is designed and created especially for children aged 5 and under and
  their families. (Siblings are welcome too!). Join us as we share stories\,
  sing songs and recite prayers together.\n\nDATES: Saturdays\nTIME: 10:30 a
 .m. - 11:30p.m.\nPLACE: Congregation Beth Sholom\nTot Shabbat is free to CB
 S Members\n$18/ session for non-members
