 will be led by Beth Sholom congregant and Director of Makor Or\, Ellen Shir
 eman. Come join us for silent sitting and Jewish chant\, as we enter into t
 he beauty and peace of Shabbat.\n\nAll are welcome\, no experience necessar
 y!\n\nDATE: Every First Friday before DAVEN Kabbalat Shabbat\nTIME:  5:50 -
  6:20 p.m.\nPLACE: Makom Sholom\nWHO: Free and open to all! Beginners are e
 ncouraged to attend. No RSVP required!
