DESCRIPTION:Just Because It's Not Wrong Doesn't Make It Right: From Toddlet
 s to Teens\, Teaching Children to Think and Act Ethically\n\nSolid and prac
 tical advice on how to use everyday life to tach children to act with integ
 rity\, civility\, responsibility\, and compassioin.\n\nBarbara Coloroso is 
 a bestselling author and an internationally recognized speaker and consulta
 nt on bullying\, parenting\, teaching\, school discipline\, positive school
  climate\, grieving\, nonviolent conflict resolution\, and restorative just
 ice.\n\nCost: $20 in advance\; $25 at the door\; scholarships available.\nR
 egister at: www.parentsplaceonline.org/san-francisco\nRegister early! Space
  is limited\, and this event will sell out.\nIf you have questions\, please
  contact Parents Place at 415-359-2454 or PaarentsPlaceSF@jfcs.org.\n
