DESCRIPTION:<strong><b>Ethical and Legal Wills: When is it the Right Time t
 o Write?</b></strong><br><em>Facilitated by Rabbi Dorothy Richman and Kathl
 een Hunt\, Attorney and Counselor at Law</em><strong><b><br></b></strong><b
 r><p>What do you want to pass on from your life to those with whom you have
  shared it? How do you attempt to pass down your values and best advice in 
 a way that will be meaningful? What is it important to consider when writin
 g a legal will and who can help you? </p><p>When is the right time to write
  both an ethical will and a legal will — and why is the answer\, "probably 
 now"?</p><p>Light Supper Included</p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/fo
 rms/d/e/1FAIpQLSco7Uf4YfFU8Cpm_95c5IvXpH_Ph-AeXR9MpSaOHgYWXX5F7w/viewform">
 Registration Appreciated</a><br></p><p><br></p>
