DESCRIPTION:Dr. Ernest M. Weitz Breakfast Club\nNewman Fisher\, President\n
 \nThe Dr. Ernest M. Weitz Breakfast Club meets the second Sunday of each mo
 nth (except summer months). Meetings begin with a sit-down breakfast\, ther
 e is a brief business meeting followed by an informal presentation on topic
 s of interest to the Jewish Community. Speakers have included many communit
 y leaders of the San Francisco Jewish Community\, along with members of Bet
 h Sholom. A delicious breakfast will be served at 9 a.m. when the meeting b
 egins.  \n\nThe next meeting of the Breakfast Club will be on Sunday\, Sept
 ember 11 in Koret Hall. The special guest speaker is Ruth Messinger\, presi
 dent of American Jewish World Services (AJWS)—one of our country’s leading 
 Jewish voices on the National stage fighting for justice and human rights. 
 The Forward has named her one of the “50 Most Influential Jews of the Year”
  for nine years\, and she was on The Jerusalem Post’s “World’s Most Influen
 tial Jews” list in 2011. \n\nCost: $40 per couple\, $25 per individual\, $5
  drop-in\n\nFor more information call the office 415.221.8736\, ext. 105\, 
 attn: Beth Jones\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T082159Z
LOCATION:Koret Hall
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dr. Ernest M. Weitz Breakfast Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
