CREATED:20240412T174829Z
DESCRIPTION:<h2>A CELEBRATION OF BETH SHOLOM\, SAN FRANCISCO AND SANDY EDWA
 RDS!</h2><p>Join us on Sunday\, June 2\, 2024 at 5:30 pm for the annual Con
 gregation Beth Sholom Fundraiser celebrating San Francisco’s diverse Jewish
  community and our outstanding honoree\, Sandy Edwards. We are proud to hon
 or Sandy's devotion to CBS and her numerous contributions to the broader Je
 wish community.</p><p>Come together with friends\, family\, clergy and staf
 f to experience all that makes CBS a special place to gather\, worship and 
 support each other.</p><p>You’ll enjoy food\, drink and music spanning glob
 al Jewish traditions. It will be a festive evening complete with dinner\, l
 ive klezmer music\, dancing and opportunities to make an impact for our syn
 agogue.</p><p>We hope you'll join us for this special evening!</p><p>Ticket
  Info and Sponsorship Levels available <a href="https://www.bethsholomsf.or
 g/gala-2024" target="_blank">here</a>.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240528T193156Z
LOCATION:k\, CBS-1-Koret Hall (KH) (200)
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beth Sholom Annual Gala
TRANSP:OPAQUE
