  23rd\, 8:00 p.m. — 10:30 p.m.</p><p>We're excited to announce that this ye
 ar's Purim party is happening at Manny's! <b>We're teaming up once again wi
 th our friends from the Kaf Lamed Young Adults group at Congregation Sha'ar
