 yer and how do we balance those limitations with the need for hope and conn
 ection? When do we put someone on the <i>Mi Sheberach </i>list and when it 
 is time to take someone off? Discuss these questions and more in this three
 -part series with Rabbi Russell.<br><br>Thursdays after morning minyan (~8:
 30) - in person and online.<br><br>Aug 24<br>Aug 31<br><b>Sept 7</b><br><br
 >Join Zoom Meeting: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://us02web.z
 oom.us/j/81632373785&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=16906844262547
 93&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0A9htM_iMITgSrurUMS9jT" target="_blank"><u><u>https://us0
 2web.zoom.us/j/81632373785</u></u></a> <br><br>Meeting ID:  816 3237 3785
LAST-MODIFIED:20230801T210429Z
LOCATION:CBS Board Room and https://us02web.zoom.us/j/81632373785 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Limits of Prayer with Rabbi Russell
