DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Shabbat as we honor HIAS’ Sixth Annual Refugee Shabba
 t - an opportunity to express solidarity with the global Jewish movement fo
 r refugee protection and welcome. Please join the Beth Sholom Chesed v’Tzed
 ek Committee and other community members as we support this critical Shabba
 t morning and kiddush lunch-n-learn experience. <br><b><br></b><br><span>~1
 2:30 p.m. </span><span>Lunch-n-Learn</span><span> </span><br><span>Led by T
 ara Winter\, Executive Director of the International Rescue Committee. She 
 will teach on the topic: "Understanding and Welcoming Refugees in Northern 
 California.”</span>
