DESCRIPTION:<p><strong>Celebrate Tot Shabbat&nbsp\;with&nbsp\;beloved song 
 leader\, Mimi Greisman and Director of Family Engagement\, Dale Kleisley</s
 trong><strong>!&nbsp\;Join us as we share&nbsp\;Shabbat stories\, sing song
 s and recite prayers together. Each&nbsp\;family&nbsp\;will&nbsp\;</strong>
 <strong>receive</strong><strong>&nbsp\;a map with a scavenger hunt and will
  be invited to embark on a nature blessings walk in Mountain Lake Park.</st
 rong><br><br><strong>Our&nbsp\;weekly Tot Shabbat service is designed and c
 reated especially for children age 5 and under and their&nbsp\;families. (S
 iblings are welcome too!) This is a wonderful opportunity to come as a&nbsp
 \;family\, hear live music\,&nbsp\;marvel at the wonders in&nbsp\;nature an
 d meet new friends in the park!&nbsp\;</strong></p>&nbsp\;<strong>*Advanced
  registration required*</strong><br><strong>DATES: Saturdays</strong><br><s
 trong>TIME: 10:30 a.m. - 12:00 p.m.</strong><br><strong>PLACE: Mountain Lak
 e Park - 11th Avenue picnic area<br>Tot Shabbat is free to&nbsp\;CBS Member
 s<br>$18/ session for non-members</strong><br><br><strong>Tot Shabbat begin
 s at 10:30a.m. at Mountain Lake Park 11th Avenue picnic area and concludes 
 at noon at&nbsp\;Congregation Beth Sholom - Rainbow Courtyard. Each&nbsp\;f
 amily&nbsp\;will receive an Irving's Premium Bakery challah and grape juice
  Shabbat package.</strong><br><b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1
 BFdC5nlQsletAgtcYb1GRxOfuRJJyZpXInN-KaM4Lvg/edit">REGISTER FOR TOT SHABBAT&
 nbsp\;</a></b><br><strong><br></strong>
