DESCRIPTION:<h2>TU B'SHEVAT SEDER</h2><p><strong><b>WHEN</b></strong>: Wedn
 esday January 24\, 2024\, 6:00 p.m. - 7:30 p.m.<br><strong><b>WHERE</b></st
 rong>: Beth Sholom Main Meeting Room</p><p>Tu B'Shevat marks the beginning 
 of the Year of Trees. As we leave the darkest days of winter behind\, there
  is no better time to pause\, reflect\, reset our intentions\, and give tha
 nks as a community for the bounty that trees provide.<br><br>Join us for a 
 participatory seder led by Beth Sholom congregant Juliette Hirt as we read 
 poetry and sample a variety of fruits\, nuts\, and wines.</p><p><a href="ht
 tps://cbssf.shulcloud.com/form/cbs-Tu-b%27Shevat-seder-2024.html">Register 
 here! </a></p><b><b>Member</b></b><b><b>: $18<br></b></b><p><b><b>Non-Membe
 r: $25</b></b> <br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231220T221331Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tu B'Shevat Seder - Led by Congregant Juliette Hirt
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
