DESCRIPTION:<b>Makor Or Jewish Meditation Retreat for Hanukkah  </b><br> <b
 r>Hanukkah is a festival of rededicating ourselves to holy purpose. Join No
 rman Fischer and Rabbi Dorothy Richman for a day-long soak in Jewish medita
 tion practice\, prayer\, and learning. Sit\, sing\, learn\, and walk with a
 n open heart. Connect deeply to yourself\, to the Divine\, and to the texts
  and rituals of Hanukkah. Candle-lighting and singing\, included!<br> <br>N
 o meditation experience necessary. All are welcome. Please join us in perso
 n at Congregation Beth Sholom in SF\, CA or on Zoom. A recording of the ret
 reat will be sent to anyone who registers.<br> <br> When: Sunday\, December
  10\, 2023\, 10:00am - 5:00pm (Pacific Time)  <br> <br>Where: Congregation 
 Beth Sholom in SF\, CA or on Zoom  <br> <br>Zoom fee: $18 <br> In-person re
 gistration: $54 (spaces limited) <br>Sponsor: $118<br><br>Registration requ
 ired. <a href="https://cbssf.shulcloud.com/form/cbs-makororjewishmeditation
 retreat-hanukkah.html">Register here. </a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231117T074722Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CBS Makor Or Jewish Meditation Retreat for Hanukkah
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
