DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u>Join us this Friday for a Kabbalat Sha
 bbat service. <br><br>We have a little something for everyone:<br><br>5:15 
 p.m. - a little nosh and schmooze<br><br>5:30 p.m. - Learn how to participa
 te in the REJOICE service. Training and practice in the rhythms and chants 
 that we use. If you like\, bring a drum.<br><br>6 p.m. - our sacred ecstati
 c musical rejoice Kabbalat Shabbat service with Reb Tsvi and Middle Eastern
  drummer Susie Goldenstein. There will be a Kaddish for mourners.<br><br>7 
 p.m. - Our ruach refreshed\, we are energized for Shabbat and out the door!
 <br><br>For more information\, please contact Reb Tsvi at: <a href="mailto:
 tsvi.bardavid@gmail.com" id="ow850" __is_owner="true">tsvi.bardavid@gmail.c
 om</a><br><br><b>WHERE</b>: CBS Chapel</html-blob>
