BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20100320T170000Z
DTEND:20100320T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:selu0v9mbc6bvobpin40nsssi8@google.com
CREATED:20100312T175815Z
DESCRIPTION:The Learners' Minyan is offering a single class session on the 
 liturgical themes of Pesach. The class will participate in a shortened morn
 ing prayer service that teaches the davenner how to bring their innate spir
 ituality into the text building a deeper relationship to Jewish practice.  
 \n \nThe study session will address the conflicts that arise with the tradi
 tional Pesach themes of chosen-ness\, redemption and triumphal-ism. Are the
 se themes in conflict with building world peace on values of tolerance and 
 mutual respect?\n \nJoin us for this special holiday class\, taught by Davi
 d Malman and Ellen Shireman. Knowledge of Hebrew is not necessary but alway
 s encouraged.\n
