  jaunt down Market Street in one of the most iconic Pride Parades around th
 e world. Plus\, all participants get a complimentary JCCSF Pride tee. Thank
 s to our partners who will be joining in to bring the energy from around th
 e Bay for a very memorable and prideful day. Security will be provided. <br
 ><br>All ages and abilities are welcome. <a href="https://www.jccsf.org/eve
 nt/sf-pride-parade/">Advance registration required.</a><br><br><p>We will g
 ather at the Parade Assembly Area downtown and end at the Civic Center Cele
 bration Area. The Parade is about 1 – 1.5 miles.</p><p>If you are registere
 d\, please keep an eye on your email a few days before the parade for furth
 er details or call the Front Desk at 415-292-1200.</p><p><u>We recommend br
 inging</u>:<br>Water bottle<br>Comfy walking shoes<br>Sunscreen<br>Hat<br>P
 ride style\, including flags\, rainbows and spirited swag</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230615T173102Z
