DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20110320T113000
DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:g7popvi1p0o0123fsmif9593hk@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20110320T100000
CREATED:20110124T172452Z
DESCRIPTION:NEW! Torah Trope with Kenny Altman\nSundays: February 6\, 13\, 
 27\, March 6\, 13\, 27\, April 3\, 10\, 17 (9 sessions)\, 10-11:30 a.m.\n$1
 00 for members of Congregation Beth Sholom (members: use password "CBS" whe
 n registering online)\n$125 for non-members\nRegister online at http://www.
 brownpapertickets.com/event/154267\nNo one turned away due to lack of abili
 ty to pay.\nFor low-income inquiries contact Kenny Altman at kennyaltman@ea
 rthlink.net or 415-377-6350.\n\nLearn to chant Torah! At Congregation Beth 
 Sholom in San Francisco \, our Torah services are truly participatory in th
 at we have trained hundreds of our members to chant from Torah. At Bar and 
 Bat Mitzvahs\, it is not uncommon to see parents\, siblings\, and other fam
 ily members reading Torah along with the Bar/Bat Mitzvah. On any given Shab
 bat\, it is not uncommon to see anywhere from one to seven different reader
 s approach the bimah to take part in the reading of the Torah.\n \nThe only
  requirement for this class is that you be able to read Hebrew. You do not 
 have to read fast\, and you do not have to be fluent in the language\, but 
 you do need to be able to read Hebrew.  \n\nStudents will learn to chant To
 rah\, and will be given an assignment to work on. Assignments could be for 
 an upcoming Shabbat "graduation ceremony" with the class\, or a family life
 cycle event\, whatever the student chooses.\n \nKenny Altman is San Francis
 co 's only Stand-up Comic and Torah Trope Instructor. He has been teaching 
 Torah Trope at Congregation Beth Sholom\, and at other locations throughout
  the Bay Area\, since 1999\, and has taught over 200 people to chant Torah 
 and Haftorah\, most of those at Congregation Beth Sholom. He is currently t
 he lead Bar/Bat Mitzvah tutor at Congregation Beth Sholom.\n \nPlease note 
 this class is for the general public\, and not exclusive to members of Cong
 regation Beth Sholom.\n\nThank you!  I look forward to learning with you!\n
 \nKenny Altman\n-- \nKenny Altman\nStand-up Comic/Torah Trope Instructor\nk
 ennyaltman@earthlink.net\n415-377-6350\nhttp://www.facebook.com/kenny.altma
 n \nhttp://www.amazon.com/shops/proper_pronouns_productions\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T082023Z
LOCATION:Board Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:No Torah Trope Class today
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
