DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Tot Shabbat with music specialist\, Jonathan Bayer an
 d Director of Family Engagement\, Dale Kleisley! Join us as we share Shabba
 t stories\, sing songs and recite prayers together. Each family will receiv
 e a map with a scavenger hunt and will be invited to embark on a nature ble
 ssings walk in Mountain Lake Park.  Our weekly Tot Shabbat service is desig
 ned and created especially for children age 5 and under and their families.
  (Siblings are welcome too!) This is a wonderful opportunity to come as a f
 amily\, hear live music\, marvel at the wonders in nature and meet new frie
 nds in the park! \n *Advanced registration required*\nDATES: Saturdays\nTIM
 E: 10:30 a.m. - 12:00 p.m.\nPLACE: Mountain Lake Park - 11th Avenue picnic 
 area\nTot Shabbat is free to CBS Members\n$18/ session for non-members\n\nT
 ot Shabbat begins at 10:30a.m. at Mountain Lake Park 11th Avenue picnic are
 a and concludes at noon at Congregation Beth Sholom - Rainbow Courtyard. Ea
 ch family will receive an Irving's Premium Bakery challah and grape juice S
 habbat package.\nREGISTER FOR TOT SHABBAT
