DESCRIPTION:Dr. Ernest M. Weitz Breakfast Club\nNewman Fisher\, President\n
 \nThe return of Rabbi Sam is today's topic. Breakfast is served\, and all a
 re welcome.\n\nThe Breakfast club currently meets one Sunday of each month 
 (except summer months). There is a brief business meeting followed by an in
 formal talk on topics of interest to the Jewish Community. Speakers have in
 cluded many community leaders of the San Francisco Jewish Community\, along
  with members of Beth Sholom. Meetings are held at 9 a.m. and start with a 
 free breakfast.
