DESCRIPTION:<br>Let’s ride! Join the CBS community on Rabbi Jamie Hyam’s <a
  href="http://www.chaicycle.org/" target="_blank">Chai Cycle</a>\, where cy
 clists experience Jewish community through bicycling and text study. We rid
 e\, stop halfway for coffee and study\, then ride back.<br><br>Sunday\, May
  18. Route: <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/49750348" target="_blan
 k">To Tiburon via Seminary</a><br>   * SF start at Beth Sholom- 35.6 miles\
 , 1600 feet of climbing.  Meet at 8:00\, ride at 8:15<br>   * Marin start a
 t downtown Sausalito rest rooms- 20 miles\, 300 feet of climbing.  Meet at 
 8:30\, ride when the SF contingent arrives.<br><br>Must bring a helmet\, wa
 ter and tire change kit and sign a standard ride waiver. <br><br><b>RSVP re
 quired</b>\, to Mark Gunther (<a href="mailto:mhgunther@comcast.net" target
 ="_blank">mhgunther@comcast.net</a>)\, 415.515.4733.
