DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://forms.gle/gmaAoVDW9m5Ju3GB9" target="_blank"><
 u>Register here! </u></a><br><br>Celebrate Tu B'Shevat with Us! 🌲 We're ex
 cited to invite you to register for two wonderful Tu B'Shevat Youngish even
 ts. Choose one or join us for both!<br><br><p>Celebrate the birthday of the
  trees with nature\, learning\, and connection. Space is limited\, register
  today! </p><p><b>Event 1: Torah on the Trails - Presidio Hike &amp\; Young
 ish Brunch </b></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Sunday\, February 1\, 10:30 AM
  - 12:00 PM Hike\, 12:30 brunch at Colibri</p><p><strong>Where:</strong> <b
 > </b>Bay Area Ridge Trail - Presidio Golf Course Entrance<b>   </b></p><p>
 Join us for Torah on the Trails\, a unique Tu B'Shevat community wide exper
 ience that combines the beauty of nature with meaningful Jewish learning. L
 ed by Lifelong Learning Moreh Derech Adam Lowy\, we'll celebrate the birthd
 ay of the trees by exploring the stunning trails of the Presidio while enga
 ging in Torah study and reflection. This special program brings together ph
 ysical movement\, spiritual growth\, and community connection in the great 
 outdoors—the perfect way to honor our relationship with nature and the envi
 ronment.</p><p><i>Note: Youngish folks will break off from the group and he
 ad to brunch after the hike</i></p><p><strong>What to Expect:</strong></p><
 ul><li>Guided community hike through the beautiful Presidio trails</li><li>
 Tu B'Shevat-themed Torah study and reflection in nature\, led by Lifelong L
 earning Moreh Derech Adam Lowy</li><li>Brunch together following the hike a
 t Colibri in the Presidio</li><li>Note: In an effort to help to subsidize t
 he cost of brunch\, we are charging $10 per person and covering the rest! <
 /li></ul><p></p><p>Wear comfortable walking shoes and dress in layers. All 
 fitness levels welcome! This event is open to members. </p><p>_____________
 ____</p><p><b>Event 2: Monday Night Youngish Happy Hour at Propagation Plan
 t Bar</b></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Monday\, February 2nd\, 5:30 - 7:30 
 PM<br><strong>Where:</strong> Propagation Plant Bar\, 895 Post St. </p><p>C
 ontinue the Tu B'Shevat celebration at Propagation Plant Bar—what better ve
 nue to honor the birthday of the trees than a plant-filled space! Join us f
 or a relaxed\, social Monday evening. Whether you're looking to make new fr
 iends\, build professional connections\, or simply unwind with Youngish\, t
 his is the perfect opportunity to connect in a special setting for Tu B'She
 vat. This is open to members and community guests. </p><p><strong>What's In
 cluded:</strong></p><ul><li>Complimentary drink ticket for a fantastic cock
 tail or mocktail</li><li>Pizza provided from local pizzeria\, Del Poppolo</
 li><li>Great people and opportunities for new friends and connections</li><
 /ul>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260114T182552Z
LOCATION:Colibri Mexican Bistro\, 50 Moraga Ave\, San Francisco\, CA 94129\
 , USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Youngish Tu B'Shevat Brunch at Colibri
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
