DESCRIPTION:<b>This event has been cancelled. Please contact Cara\, </b><br
 ><table><tbody><tr><td><br><b>cwalden@sinaichapel.org for more information.
   </b><br><b><br></b><br><b><br></b></td></tr></tbody></table><br>Note: Thi
 s is a free video seminar\, not in person <br><br>Planning for the future c
 an feel overwhelming\, but it doesn't have to be. Join us for an informativ
 e and thoughtful session on Jewish end-of-life traditions and funeral plann
 ing. <br>We’ll be joined by Cara Walden\, Advance Planning Counselor at Sin
 ai Memorial Chapel\, who will guide us through what advance planning entail
 s\, how it supports our loved ones\, and the steps to take now to ensure pe
 ace of mind later. Together you will discuss:<ul><li>Why plan in advance?</
 li><li>What in our Jewish tradition encourages advance planning?</li><li>Wh
 o is Sinai and what do we do?</li><li>What are the core things to think abo
 ut when making an advance plan?</li><li>What are the steps to proceed</li><
 /ul><br><br>registration link: <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/reg
 ister/5HUZdt8JSR6_TchZEj6E0Q" target="_blank">https://us06web.zoom.us/<u></
 u>meeting/register/5HUZdt8JSR6_<u></u>TchZEj6E0Q</a><br><u><a href="https:/
 /us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/5HUZdt8JSR6_TchZEj6E0Q" target="_blank">P
 lease use this link to register for the event.</a></u><a href="https://us06
 web.zoom.us/meeting/register/5HUZdt8JSR6_TchZEj6E0Q" target="_blank"> </a>I
 f you are interested in learning more but are unable to come to this progra
 m\, please<u><a href="https://forms.gle/vK2qeeyZhaXk4DHMA" target="_blank">
  FILL OUT THIS FORM </a></u>or reach out to Cara Walden directly at (201)-7
 24-4958 or <u><a href="mailto:cwalden@sinaichapel.org" target="_blank">cwal
 den@sinaichapel.org</a></u>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260115T173835Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CANCELLED Sinai Memorial Chapel: Advance Planning Seminar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
