DESCRIPTION:<b>Sept 16\, 6:30 p.m. (following evening minyan at 6 p.m) </b>
 <br><p dir="ltr">The world is full of bad news. Before we process one crisi
 s\, another one strikes. The news feels like whiplash. We try to be so many
  things to so many people. It is exhausting.</p><p dir="ltr">Are we listeni
 ng to each other? </p>Join us for our second listening circle in the month 
 of Elul: sharing\, heart-opening\, connecting and listening through the len
 s of <i>teshuvah.</i><b></b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250912T175832Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Erev Shmia: An Evening of Listening
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
