DESCRIPTION:<p>Celebrate Shabbat with Young<i>ish</i>: our Third Fridays mo
 nthly gathering</p><p>Experience the warmth and joy of a traditional\, egal
 itarian Shabbat dinner with Young<i>ish</i> at Congregation Beth Sholom. Jo
 in us on the <b>Third Friday of each month</b> for an evening of:</p><ul><l
 i>Delicious food</li><li>Traditional songs and blessings</li><li>Engaging c
 onversation</li><li>Community celebration and togetherness</li><li><b>Pleas
 e consider donating a bottle of wine (Kosher or Californian) to help mitiga
 te costs and help special events like continue to thrive</b></li></ul><p>Wh
 ether you&#39\;re a Young(ish) member or a new friend\, if you&#39\;re in y
 our mid-20s to 40-ish\, we&#39\;d love to have you!</p><p>Seasoned Shabbat 
 enthusiasts and curious newcomers alike are warmly welcomed. No experience 
 necessary – just bring your appetite for good food and great company! Come 
 as you are\, leave inspired. Let&#39\;s make Shabbat memorable together!</p
 ><p>For more information\, please email <a href="mailto:thirdfridays@bethsh
 olomsf.org" target="_blank"><u>thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.org</u></a>. </p><
 p><b>Registration is at capacity and has now closed. </b><b>We look forward
  to seeing you!</b></p><p><i>Please let us know if you can no longer attend
 \, as we are in high demand! </i></p><p><b>Details:</b><br></p><p>Location:
  Congregation Beth Sholom\, 301 14th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94118</p><
 p>Time: 7:00 PM for dinner (optional: Kabbalat Shabbat services begin at 6:
 00 PM\; all are welcome to arrive early to attend services)</p>
