DESCRIPTION:<p>Celebrate Shabbat with Young<i>ish</i>: our Third Fridays mo
 nthly gathering</p><p><u><a href="https://forms.gle/wYgTB2MbvbCxFaZ88">Regi
 stration required</a></u></p><p>Experience the warmth and joy of a traditio
 nal\, egalitarian Shabbat dinner with Young<i>ish</i> at Congregation Beth 
 Sholom. Join us on the <b>Third Friday of each month</b> for an evening of:
 </p><ul><li>Delicious food</li><li>Traditional songs and blessings</li><li>
 Engaging conversation</li><li>Community celebration and togetherness</li><l
 i><b>Please consider donating a bottle of wine (Kosher or Californian) to h
 elp mitigate costs and help special events like continue to thrive</b></li>
 </ul><p>Whether you're a Young(ish) member or a new friend\, if you're in y
 our mid-20s to 40-ish\, we'd love to have you!</p><p>Seasoned Shabbat enthu
 siasts and curious newcomers alike are warmly welcomed. No experience neces
 sary – just bring your appetite for good food and great company! Come as yo
 u are\, leave inspired. Let's make Shabbat memorable together!</p><p>For mo
 re information\, please email <a href="mailto:thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.org
 " target="_blank"><u>thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.org</u></a>. </p><p><i>Pleas
 e let us know if you can no longer attend\, as we are in high demand! </i><
 /p><p><b>Details:</b><br></p><p>Location: Congregation Beth Sholom\, 301 14
 th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94118</p><p>Time: 7:00 PM for dinner (option
 al: Kabbalat Shabbat services begin at 6:00 PM\; all are welcome to arrive 
 early to attend services)</p>
