 xpress solidarity with the global Jewish movement for refugee protection an
 d welcome. Please join the Beth Sholom Chesed v’Tzedek Committee and other 
 community members as we support this critical Shabbat morning and kiddush l
 unch-n-learn experience. </span><br><span><br></span><br><span>During servi
 ces\, Rabbi Russell will deliver a sermon on this important topic (~11:30 a
 .m.)\, and immediately following Shabbat services come learn with <b>Tara W
 inter\, Executive Director Northern California of the International Rescue 
 Committee\, as she speaks on "Understanding and Welcoming Refugees in North
 ern California.”</b></span><br><br><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></
 u>Join Rabbi Russell this Saturday for in-person Shabbat services.<u></u><b
 r><br><u></u>Engage in prayer\, song\, Torah reading\, and a delicious Kidd
 ush. Enjoy community as you share authentic and meaningful religious and sp
 iritual experiences. <br><br><b>WHERE</b>: CBS Sanctuary<br><u></u><u></u><
 u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u>
