DESCRIPTION:<p>With the heaviness of this year and in the middle of our hol
 iest days\, let’s pay our departed ones a visit. We visit the cemetery duri
 ng this period of reflection to reconnect with the lives of those who have 
 passed and carry their memory with us as we enter a new year. Join Rabbi Am
 anda Russell at Home of Peace Cemetery in Colma for a short memorial gather
 ing. Afterwards\, individuals will be given time to visit the graves of the
 ir loved ones with their own time and space.</p><p><b>When: </b>Thursday\, 
 October 10\, 11 a.m.<b><br></b><b>Where: </b>Congregation Beth Sholom (meet
  if needed)\, Home of Peace in Colma<br></p><p><i>This offering is for memb
 ers of Beth Sholom.</i></p><p><b>Please let us know that you are coming and
  <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfgUJEKdQ0OTjVcS02e_bIlG
 NTtwXsT0Il49DFufp3_uqRLVQ/viewform?usp=sf_link" target="_blank">Register He
 re</a></b></p>
