DESCRIPTION:Join in this meaningful tradition that emphasizes themes of for
 giveness and introspection\, and feel the energy of those final days that l
 ead us into Rosh Hashanah. We welcome you to join us in changing the Torah 
 covers to white as part of our spiritual preparation. Following havdalah\, 
 the Selichot service creates an atmosphere of solemnity and anticipation as
  our Jewish community begins its spiritual journey toward the Days of Awe.
