 he Grownoski Chapel at CBS using a hybrid model (Zoom for those not attendi
 ng in person).<br><br>Please note that on secular\, national holidays daily
  minyan will start at 8:30 a.m.   <br><br>The definition of a minyan for Th
 ursday is 10 people in person\, based on which he will lead the minyan serv
 ices that will include kaddish\, barchu\, and a heicha kedusha (during Amid
 ah)\, as well as Torah leyning. If we do not have 10 people in person then 
 we will revert to only reading Torah from Chumash\, and a pastoral kaddish.
