DESCRIPTION:<b>Sages</b> is going to the theater on <b>January 5!</b><br>SF
  Playhouse has tickets for us for the play <b><i>Waitress</i></b> at a barg
 ain price of $45. <br><i>Waitress</i> (a musical) tells the story of Jenna\
 , a small-town waitress who dreams of something bigger.  <br>Our tickets ar
 e for the 2PM performance with a wine and cheese reception at 1:00PM.  <br>
 Please contact SF Playhouse for tickets by either going to website <a href=
 "https://www.google.com/url?q=http://sfplayhouse.org/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source
 =calendar&amp\;ust=1733768965905948&amp\;usg=AOvVaw27T2pQmodWrHVJcHcsfHBg" 
 target="_blank">sfplayhouse.org</a> or calling the box office at 415-677-95
 96.  <br>The code for our group is <b>SAGESOFTHEAGES</b>. Choose your seat 
 and then discount will appear.  Everyone is welcome!
LAST-MODIFIED:20241204T183044Z
