DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Tot Shabbat with Dale Kleisley\, Director of Early Ch
 ildhood Education and Family Engagement and musical guests!\n \nOur Tot Sha
 bbat service is designed and created especially for children aged 5 and und
 er and their families. (Siblings are welcome too!). Join us as we share sto
 ries\, sing songs and recite prayers together. \n\nWHEN: 3rd Saturdays only
  during July and August\, 10:30 a.m. - 11:30p.m.\nWHERE: Congregation Beth 
 Sholom - Chapel
