BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20220730T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20220730T120000
DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:h1ebb5tj7odi5fa3pqfjtqskud@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20220730T093000
CREATED:20210616T153334Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>Join us this Saturday\, for in person Shabbat servic
 es. <br><p dir="ltr">This Shabbat\, July 30\, we will be joined by Dr. Step
 hen Daniel Arnoff\, CEO of The Fuchsberg Jerusalem Center (FJC)\, who will 
 give a <i>d'var Torah </i>during Shabbat morning services (approximately 11
 :30am). Afterwards\, Dr. Arnoff will mingle at <i>Kiddush</i> to talk more 
 about FJC and the Conservative Yeshiva\, and any other questions and intere
 sts you may have. (Make sure to ask him about Bruce Springsteen and Bob Dyl
 an -- he's the author of <a href="https://www.amazon.com/About-Man-God-Law-
 Spiritual/dp/1631956884/ref=sr_1_4?keywords=arnoff+stephen&amp\;qid=1639317
 416&amp\;sr=8-4"><i><u>About Man and God and Law: The Spiritual Wisdom of B
 ob Dylan</u></i></a>.)</p><br><b>Stephen Daniel Arnoff</b> illuminates the 
 intersection of popular culture and religion. His book <i>About Man and God
  and Law: The Spiritual Wisdom of Bob Dylan</i> has been called "evocative\
 ," "soulful\," "stirring\," and "a revelation." Teaching and lecturing arou
 nd the world\, Stephen lives in Jerusalem\, where he is CEO of the Fuchsber
 g Jerusalem Center. Find out more at <a href="http://www.mangodlaw.com/"><u
 >www.mangodlaw.com</u></a>.<br></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20241014T211825Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shabbat Services (In Person)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
