DESCRIPTION:<p><b>The Place of All Possibility by R. Adina Allen Book Group
 </b></p><p>How is human creativity part of our blessing and responsibility 
 as humans? How can we meet our Creator in creativity? How might this help u
 s do teshuvah? Join Rabbi Richman for four sessions exploring Rabbi Adina A
 llen’s rich book exploring Torah as creativity and creativity as Torah. As 
 we read\, we will look more deeply at some of the Torah sources Allen bring
 s and reflect on our own creativity and teshuvah. </p><p><b>Aug 27</b></p><
 p><b>Sept 3</b></p><p><b>Sept 10</b></p><p><i><b>Wednesdays 12-1 p.m. pacif
 ic on </b></i><i><u><u><a href="http://goog_308511827" target="_blank">Zoom
  </a></u></u></i><i><b><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/83581757247" targ
 et="_blank">. </a>Come to one session\, come to all sessions. All are welco
 me.</b></i></p>
