 rmly welcome to attend all six classes or to drop in when you can. All clas
 ses will take place on Zoom.<br><br><b>WHEN: </b><br>Weekly (Thursdays) on 
 Zoom\, 9-9:45 a.m.<br>May 2\, May 9\, May 16\, May 23\, May 30\, June 6<br>
