DESCRIPTION:<b>Friday\, April 15 at 7:30am (Siyyum\, 8:15am)</b><br><br>It 
 is a traditional custom for the firstborn to fast on the day before Passove
 r\, to commemorate the miracle which spared the firstborn Jewish sons from 
 the 10th plague - death of the firstborn.<br>Therefore\, it is also customa
 ry to arrange a siyyum (teaching in completion of something) to take place 
 after morning minyan on the 14th of Nisan. Those who participate in the lea
 rning may continue to eat for the rest of the day!<br><br>After Beth Sholom
  morning minyan\, The Rabbinical Assembly has made it possible to do this s
 iyyum together as a wide-spread West Coast community. <br><br><a href="http
 s://www.rabbinicalassembly.org/story/pre-pesah-siyyum-bekhorot-5782" id="ow
 1157" __is_owner="true">More Information Here</a><br>Friday Morning Minyan 
 at Beth Sholom: [<a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/84118598000" id="ow1167
 " __is_owner="true">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/84118598000</a>]<br><br>Siyyu
 m hosted by Rabbinical Assembly: <a href="https://zoom.us/j/908168811" id="
 ow1171" __is_owner="true">https://zoom.us/j/908168811</a> (Password: Zoom2T
 BA)
LAST-MODIFIED:20241223T182526Z
LOCATION:https://us02web.zoom.us/j/84118598000
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Minyan: Friday Morning  and Pre-Passover Siyyum Bechorot
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
