 ng to our Sages</b><br><br>Join Rabbi Richman and your HaMerkaz community f
 or a lively discussion. Using the ancient texts of our tradition and our ow
 n experiences of life\, we'll consider what we have learned about ourselves
  so far and what the next stage might hold. How have we shifted meaning\, p
 urpose\, and identity already in the decades gone by? And what might be nex
 t? <br><a href="https://forms.gle/6QSEkgtVobXnzepU6">RSVP</a> appreciated.
