 rson minyanim will take place in the Grownoski Chapel at CBS using a hybrid
  model (Zoom for those not attending in person). Masks are required and soc
 ial distancing will be in effect. All attendees will also be required to at
 test to their vaccination status &nbsp\;before entering.</span><br></h2><br
 >The definition of a minyan for Thursday is 10 people in person\, based on 
 which he will lead the minyan services that will include kaddish\, barchu\,
  and a heicha kedusha (during Amidah)\, as well as Torah leyning. If we do 
 not have 10 people in person then we will revert to only reading Torah from
  Chumash\, and a pastoral kaddish.</html-blob><br><html-blob><br><b>Join Zo
