 o have you!</p><p>For more information\, please email <a href="mailto:third
 fridays@bethsholomsf.org" target="_blank"><u><u>thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.o
 rg</u></u></a>. </p><p><i>Please let us know if you can no longer attend\, 
 as we are in high demand! </i></p><p><b>Details:</b><br></p><p>Location: Co
 ngregation Beth Sholom\, 301 14th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94118</p><p>T
 ime: 7:00 PM for dinner (optional: Kabbalat Shabbat services begin at 6:00 
 PM\; all are welcome to arrive early to attend services)</p>
