DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><h2><br></h2><u><
 /u>We are excited to announce that both Monday and Thursday in-person minya
 nim will take place in the Grownoski Chapel at CBS using a hybrid model (Zo
 om for those not attending in person). Masks are required and social distan
 cing will be in effect. All attendees will also be required to attest to th
 eir vaccination status &nbsp\;before entering.<u></u><br><u></u><br><u></u>
 <br><u></u>The definition of a minyan for Thursday is 10 people in person\,
  based on which he will lead the minyan services that will include kaddish\
 , barchu\, and a heicha kedusha (during Amidah)\, as well as Torah leyning.
  If we do not have 10 people in person then we will revert to only reading 
 Torah from Chumash\, and a pastoral kaddish.<u></u><br><u></u><br><b>Join Z
 oom Meeting</b>:&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/238145044"
 ><u>https://us02web.zoom.us/j/238145044</u></a>&nbsp\;<br><br>Meeting ID: 2
 38 145 044<br><br><br>------------<u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u></html
 -blob>
