 ml">Register here! </a></p><p>Celebrate Shabbat with Young<i>ish</i>: our T
 hird Fridays monthly gathering</p><p>Experience the warmth and joy of a tra
 ditional\, egalitarian Shabbat dinner with Young<i>ish</i> at Congregation 
 Beth Sholom. Join us on the <b>Third Friday of each month.</b></p><p>Whethe
 r you're a Young(ish) member or a new friend\, if you're in your mid-20s to
  40-ish\, we'd love to have you!</p><p>For more information\, please email 
 <a href="mailto:thirdfridays@bethsholomsf.org" target="_blank"><u>thirdfrid
 ays@bethsholomsf.org</u></a>. </p><p><i>Please let us know if you can no lo
 nger attend\, as we are in high demand! </i></p><p><b>Details:</b><br></p><
 p>Location: Congregation Beth Sholom\, 301 14th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA
  94118</p><p>Time: 7:00 PM for dinner (optional: Kabbalat Shabbat services 
 begin at 6:00 PM\; all are welcome to arrive early to attend services)</p>
