UID:1nq885qn9c7e6dnrk9orhch6kl@google.com
CREATED:20241209T223907Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>Makor Or Shabbaton Retreat</b></p><p><b>Parshat Vaera</b>
 </p><p>Join Norman Fischer and R. Dorothy Richman for an in-person Jewish M
 editation Shabbaton retreat at Congregation Beth Sholom  beginning Friday\,
  Jan 24 \, at 5 PM through the conclusion of Saturday\, Jan 25\, 6:30 PM.</
 p><p>We will sit\, sing\, eat\, pray\, study and celebrate Shabbat in commu
 nity. </p><p><b>This is a non-residential retreat— we will conclude around 
 9 PM on Friday night and return at 9 am on Saturday morning.</b> </p><p><i>
 <b>Three meals are included in your registration.</b></i></p><p>Makor Or Sh
 abbat retreats have always been our favorite: full of joy\, depth and commu
 nity. No experience with meditation or knowledge of Hebrew necessary. Join 
 us and experience the sweetness and soulfulness of Shabbat- body\, mind and
  spirit.</p><p>Explore with us what Norman calls “religious life as a song\
 , a melody\, maybe without words."</p><p>Any questions? Please email R. Dor
 othy Richman: <a href="mailto:rabbirichman@bethsholomsf.org" target="_blank
