  angels in the Torah and the Midrash.</p><p><b><i>First session: November 1
 3\, 7:00-9:00 p.m.</i></b></p><p><b><i>Second session: December 11\, 7:00-9
 :00 p.m. </i></b></p><p>Register <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http
 s://hadar.org/learn/classes-events/hadar-sf-beit-midrash-angels%23register-
