  welcome Shabbat.</p><p>Some weeks include musical instruments\, while othe
 rs are lifted by the ruach (spirit) of voices alone. However we gather\, it
 ’s a time to slow down\, reflect\, and ease into the peace of Shabbat.</p><
 br><b>WHERE</b>: CBS Chapel
