DESCRIPTION:TORAH ON THE TRAILS<br>WHEN: Sunday\, January 21\,  10:30 a.m. 
 - 12:30 p.m. <br>WHERE: Bay Area Ridge Trail - Presidio Golf Course Entranc
 e<br><br>Fun for all ages. We will start our journey at the Bay Area Ridge 
 Trail and embark on a spiritual journey through the trails using our senses
  as a guide.  Torah on the Trails will illuminate our relationship with nat
 ure\, reconnect us with the benefits that are derived from trees\, rededica
 te ourselves to preserving nature\, and honor the holiday of Tu B'Shevat. *
 Please bring a packed lunch to the site.<br><br><a href="https://docs.googl
 e.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeGFz3WmZTdwtq8jaWj6LIeXHLDMTfmFw1uRLuqK3-nlIk6Eg/vi
 ewform" target="_blank">Advance registration required.</a>
