 Lior Ben-Hur as we say goodbye to Shabbat and kick off a new week with the 
 Havdalah ritual!<br>Dinner will be served\, music will be played and the ev
 ening will culminate with a fire\, marshmallow roasting and sweet community
  BUILDing!<br><br><br><b>Learn more about Lior <a href="https://liorbenhur.
