 han Bayer\, CBS Music Specialist and lover of Torah and Jewish texts\, to d
 ive deeper into our most foundational prayers. Each session will focus on o
 ne prayer: the whats\, hows and whys. Join us for one class or all five!</p
 ><p><em>No registration necessary\, walk-ins welcome.</em></p>
