DESCRIPTION:Kadima is a CBS youth group for 5th through 8th graders that al
 lows our youth to engage with each other and Judaism in an informal way whi
 le strengthening their connections to Judaism\, the Jewish people\, and our
  larger community.\n\nWe invite Kadima-age kids to join us for an afternoon
  of fun\, games\, and crafts at CBS! On Sunday\, January 31\, from 1 - 3 p.
 m.\, San Francisco USY and Kadima will be holding our official launch event
  for our new and improved Kadima chapter! Join in some board games with new
  friends\, learn a popular Israeli mischak (game) or two\, decorate a plant
 er and plant some seeds for Tu B'Shevat\, and\, of course\, pig out on some
  kosher food!\n\nThis event is open to all 5th through 8th graders in the S
 an Francisco Jewish community\, so please invite your friends!\n \nThe even
 t costs $5/Kadima-nik. (Participants can pay at the door.) All proceeds wil
 l support your USY and Kadima chapter.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250830T142651Z
LOCATION:CBS Main Meeting Room\, Board Room\, Rainbow Courtyard
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kadima Day @ CBS!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
