 ></p><p>Location: Congregation Beth Sholom\, 301 14th Avenue\, San Francisc
 o\, CA 94118</p><p>Time: 7:00 PM for dinner (optional: Kabbalat Shabbat ser
 vices begin at 6:00 PM\; all are welcome to arrive early to attend services
 )</p>
