 ><br><div dir="auto">Special Guest Speaker: Jessica Steinberg<div dir="auto
 "><p><strong>Still Life in Israel: What Israeli Society Looks Like Right No
 w</strong></p><p><strong>Event Details:</strong></p><ul><li>Date: Wednesday
 \, February 4 at 6:00 p.m.</li><li>Location: Congregation Beth Sholom</li><
 li><b>For security\, all attendees must be registered by name</b></li><li>C
 ost: free! </li></ul><p><strong>About Jessica Steinberg\, journalist at The
  Times of Israel:</strong></p><p>Jessica Steinberg is the Arts and Culture 
 Editor for The Times of Israel\, where she has covered Israeli arts\, music
 \, travel\, food\, film\, and TV since 2013. She hosts the site's popular D
 aily Briefing podcast and has written for The New York Times\, Wall Street 
 Journal\, Bloomberg\, and other major publications. A former New Yorker who
  has lived in Israel for 28 years\, Jessica reports and speaks on Israeli n
 ews\, culture\, fashion\, and entrepreneurship.</p><p>This event will be in
  partnership with our friends at Kol Shofar.</p>
