CREATED:20211116T203153Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us as we take this traditionally underestimated service
  to new heights with <em>ruach</em>\, song and inspiration. Welcome Rosh Ha
 shanah (and Shabbat!) with joy and community in our Sanctuary as we set <em
 >kavannot</em> (intentions) for the new year of 5784. The Rabbis will be jo
 ined by Beth Sholom’s own Jonathan Bayer and other Bay Area musicians who w
 ill make our prayer sing. Musical instruments included.</p><p>Keep the fest
 ivities going as we invite you to an inaugural Erev Rosh Hashanah Community
  dinner. Share a delicious meal with friends and family prepared by Chef Ma
