 ir="ltr">Friday\, December 5 at 5:00 p.m.</p><p dir="ltr">Saturday\, Decemb
 er 6 at 10:00 a.m.</p><p dir="ltr">Do you think meditation might be for you
  but you aren’t sure? Have you tried it and might be open to trying it agai
 n? In advance of the “Rededication and Celebration” of Makor Or (25 years!)
 \, join Rabbi Dorothy Richman for an introduction to Jewish meditation. We’
 ll explore what Jewish meditation is and practice in a gentle and supported
  way. All questions welcome! </p><p dir="ltr">There will be two opportuniti
 es during Shabbat: Friday night and Saturday morning.  All are welcome\, no
  experience needed.</p>
