DESCRIPTION:<p>At the <a href="https://frankresidences.org/">Frank Residenc
 e</a>\, In partnership with the San Francisco Campus for Jewish Living (SFC
 JL) and  the Jewish Film Institute (JFI)\, the Sages of the Ages are deligh
 ted to present <em>Labors of Love: The Life &amp\; Legacy of Henrietta Szol
 d. </em>This stirring documentary honors Henrietta Szold\, a Jewish America
 n humanitarian who championed binational cooperation and founded Hadassah a
 fter a pivotal 1909 visit to Palestine.</p><p>Interested in joining? RSVP t
 o Judy Leash at <a href="mailto:jleash@gmail.com?subject=Documentary%20Scre
 ening%3A%20Labors%20of%20Love"><u>jleash@gmail.com</u></a>.</p>
