DESCRIPTION:The book to be discussed is Moacyr Scliar's "The Centaur in the
  Garden."\n\nAn outsider among outsiders\, a Jewish centaur narrates his li
 fe’s journey from his birth on a farm homesteaded by his Russian immigrant 
 family in southern Brazil through his efforts to rid himself of the equine 
 portion of his body and take his place in contemporary Brazilian society. L
 isted by the National Yiddish Book Center as one of the 100 greatest works 
 of modern Jewish literature\, this earthy tale is one you won’t soon forget
 .  \n\nWith coffee\, tea\, and a light nosh.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250830T143400Z
LOCATION:Board Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CBS Parents Book Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
