DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://forms.gle/cXF7Cn1H47ktCQxX8">Register here<
 /a></p><p dir="ltr">With the heaviness of this year and in the middle of ou
 r holiest days\, let’s pay our departed ones a visit. We visit the cemetery
  during this period of reflection to reconnect with the lives of those who 
 have passed and carry their memory with us as we enter a new year. Join Rab
 bi Amanda Russell at Home of Peace Cemetery in Colma for a short memorial g
 athering. Afterwards\, individuals will be given time to visit the graves o
 f their loved ones with their own time and space.</p><p dir="ltr"><b>When: 
 </b>Tuesday\, September 30th\, 1:00 p.m..<b><br></b><b>Where: </b>Congregat
 ion Beth Sholom (meet if needed)\, Home of Peace in Colma<br></p><p dir="lt
 r"><i>This offering is for members of Beth Sholom.<br></i></p>
