DESCRIPTION:NIF CEO Daniel Sokatch\, together with NIF Board Member and Har
 vard Kennedy School Fellow Dr. Yasmeen Abu Fraiha this November. <br><br><e
 m>Presented by Congregation Sherith Israel in partnership with New Israel F
 und<br>Co-sponsored by The Kitchen Shared Society Project\, Congregation Be
 th Sholom and Sha'ar Zahav</em><br><br><a href="https://secure.nif.org/a/dr
