CREATED:20251107T230507Z
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">Makor Or at 25! Intro to Jewish Meditation</p><p><
 a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://forms.gle/XAyT3eNt1M4nffJo7&am
 p\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1762988690646472&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3dBbt
 5Wx5Lq8f7fxdfWyaa" target="_blank">Please RSVP here! </a></p><p dir="ltr">F
 riday\, December 5 at 5:00 p.m.</p><p dir="ltr">Saturday\, December 6 at 10
 :00 a.m.</p><p dir="ltr">Do you think meditation might be for you but you a
 ren’t sure? Have you tried it and might be open to trying it again? In adva
 nce of the “Rededication and Celebration” of Makor Or (25 years!)\, join Ra
 bbi Dorothy Richman for an introduction to Jewish meditation. We’ll explore
  what Jewish meditation is and practice in a gentle and supported way. All 
 questions welcome! </p><p dir="ltr">There will be two opportunities during 
 Shabbat: Friday night and Saturday morning.  All are welcome\, no experienc
 e needed.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251107T230507Z
