DESCRIPTION:<p><strong><b>Celebrate Shabbat with Young<i><i>ish</i></i>: ou
 r Third Fridays monthly gathering - Hanukkah Edition with Lights and Latkes
 <br><u>Note: New time this month - 6:00 p.m. (Services at 5:00 p.m. in the 
