 com/form/youngish-shabbat-12/19/25.html"><u>Register here! </u></a></b></st
 rong></p><p>Experience the warmth and joy of a traditional\, egalitarian Sh
 abbat dinner with Young<i><i>ish</i></i> at Congregation Beth Sholom.</p><p
