  in your mid-20s to 40-ish\, we'd love to have you!</p><p>Seasoned Shabbat 
 enthusiasts and curious newcomers alike are warmly welcomed. No experience 
 necessary – just bring your appetite for good food and great company!<br><b
 r><strong><b>Hosts: </b></strong>Melanie and Russell </p><p><strong><b>Loca
 tion:</b></strong> Congregation Beth Sholom</p><p><strong><b>*NEW* Time:</b
 ></strong> 6:00 PM for dinner (optional: Kabbalat Shabbat services begin at
