RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20230404T081500
CREATED:20211213T200846Z
DESCRIPTION:What's All this Fuss About Counting the Omer?<br><br>The Torah 
 instructs us to count a measure of grain each of the forty-nine days from P
 assover to Shavuot without giving any reason why. <br><br>This Tuesday's To
 rah Study will be devoted to the origins and rituals of this daily journey 
 through time\, looking at how Kabbalists brought a layer of intention to th
 is mitzvah\, and discussing what meaning performing this simple\, tradition
 al ritual can bring us today.<br><br><u></u>Join us on Zoom every Tuesday m
 orning at 8:15 a.m. to look at the weekly <i>parsha </i>and delve into the 
 teachings that our text has brought us throughout the past millennia\, and 
 to today.<br><br>Weekly discussions will be led by our lay leaders and Rabb
 is. You're also welcome to sign-in early and catch some morning minyan!<b><
 br></b><br>Join Zoom Meeting: <a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/8163237378
 5"><u>https://us02web.zoom.us/j/81632373785</u></a> <br><br>Meeting ID:  81
 6 3237 3785<br><br><i>Please note\, Tuesday morning minyan and Tuesday morn
 ing Torah study share the same Zoom link. </i><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260209T213650Z
LOCATION:https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86431403445
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SPECIAL Tuesday Morning Torah Study
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
