  important thought leaders!<br><br><b><a href="https://forms.gle/gXfXtnvcqR
 AY2enF8">Registration</a> required\, donation appreciated</b><br><br><u></u
 ><b>5:30 p.m. </b>- Nosh and schmooze<br><br><b>6 p.m.</b> - Service<br><br
