DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us monthly for <strong>SING</strong>\, a lively musical
  Kabbalat Shabbat led by Rabbi Amanda Russell and musicians. Come early to 
 connect and enjoy light refreshments\, then welcome Shabbat with song and s
 pirit.</p><p></p><p>SING is a joyful way to transition from the week into S
 habbat\, with music\, community\, and a warm\, inclusive space for all.</p>
 <u></u><b>5:30 p.m. </b>- Nosh and schmooze<br><br><b>6 p.m.</b> - Service<
 br><br><b>WHERE</b>: CBS Chapel
