CREATED:20260116T213808Z
DESCRIPTION:Pink Purim Club Annual Carnival and Preschool Fundraiser! \n\nT
 his Purim we are turning joy all the way up at Pink Purim Club\, our Annual
  Purim Carnival and Preschool Fundraiser a day filled with laughter imagina
 tion and togetherness. From ponies and carnival games to delicious food and
  drinks for all ages every moment is designed to delight children and adult
 s alike.\n\nCome together for a joyful spiel performance and Megillah readi
 ng as the Purim story is shared through humor and heart. Whether you are he
 re for the games or the mitzvah this celebration is the place to be!\n\nAll
  proceeds support the Preschool Scholarship Fund helping create access to a
  quality award winning Jewish education for children and families in our co
 mmunity. Come in costume bring your sparkle and celebrate Purim the Beth Sh
 olom Pink Purim Club way! \n\nChag Purim Sameach!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260218T235846Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pink Purim Club Annual Carnival and Preschool Fundraiser
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
