 lar or a first-timer\, if you’re in your <b>mid-20s to 40-ish</b>\, we’d lo
 ve to have you at the table. No experience necessary!</p><h3><b>The Details
 </b></h3><ul><li><p><b>Location:</b> Congregation Beth Sholom</p></li><li><
 p><b>Time:</b> <b>6:00 PM</b> for dinner. <i>(Services at 5:00 PM in the Ch
 apel). </i></p></li><li><p></p><blockquote><i>note: time is early to accoun
 t for winter sunset</i></blockquote><p></p></li><li><p><b>Cost:</b> Free fo
 r CBS Members | $10 for Guests</p></li></ul><h3><b><a href="https://cbssf.s
 hulcloud.com/form/youngish-shabbat-1/16/26.html">Register Here! </a></b></h
 3><p><b>RSVP required by Wednesday\, January 15th.</b> Grab your spot! Once
  we hit capacity\, we will move to a waitlist.</p>
