DTSTAMP:20260318T055329Z
UID:2191b93n6cpm1s751mogbn1v3u@google.com
CREATED:20260225T171018Z
DESCRIPTION:5 p.m. - Mincha in the Chapel<br>~5:45 p.m. - Learning with Rab
 bi Richman<br><p><em>Purim and the Practice of Not Knowing: Ad de lo Yada</
 em></p><p>On Purim\, we’re taught to drink until we can’t tell the differen
 ce between cursed Haman and blessed Mordechai. But perhaps this isn’t just 
 about intoxication. What if “not knowing” is itself a spiritual practice? I
 n times of doubt and crisis\, can confusion open the door to renewal and de
 eper faith?</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260225T171041Z
LOCATION:CBS-1-Gronowski Family Chapel (GFC) (100)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Purim Mincha and Learning
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
